# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:20
translate chinese ccmenu_5d44998d:

    # aug "Here, some privacy~ Ah-ha!"
    aug "来，给你点私人空间~啊哈！"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:83
translate chinese cbmenu_aa970607:

    # daw "This certainly is the most explosive introduction I've had for a universe."
    daw "这确实是我经历过最炸裂的宇宙开场了。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:85
translate chinese cbmenu_541819c9:

    # daw "Hey, kitten~"
    daw "嘿，小猫咪~"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:88
translate chinese dawnmenu_ce2d5605:

    # daw "What did you have in mind?"
    daw "你有什么打算？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:109
translate chinese dawomenu_0bf1f9f1:

    # daw "Just panties? Somehow that feels lewder than being nude."
    daw "只穿内裤？这感觉比全裸还要色呢。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:117
translate chinese dawomenu_342132b2:

    # "I feel exhausted!"
    "我感觉精疲力尽！"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:131
translate chinese dawomenu_25b39db4:

    # daw "Don't be a stranger."
    daw "别这么见外嘛。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:216
translate chinese arcadiareturn_d5427064:

    # "{i}Note: Returning to Arcadia isn't considered a canon action, but for the sake of a better gameplay experience, you may leave and return at any time{/i}"
    "{i} 注意：返回 Arcadia不属于主线剧情行为，但为提升游戏体验，你可随时离开并返回 {/i}"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:218
translate chinese arcadiareturn_af96b0ee:

    # "Ready?"
    "准备好了吗？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:234
translate chinese castle3_1411ab34:

    # "The ballroom buzzes with energy as guests mingle, the soft strains of a string quartet weaving a gentle melody in the background."
    "舞厅里宾客谈笑风生，弦乐四重奏在背景中轻柔流淌。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:235
translate chinese castle3_c376f30a:

    # "We, the Virtues of Harmony stand to one side, awaiting the official ceremony. Queen [aur], steps to the center of the room, raising her hand to quiet the crowd."
    "我们\"和谐美德\"成员站在一侧等待正式典礼。[aur]女王走到厅中央抬手示意众人安静。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:241
translate chinese castle3_ae253f88:

    # aur "Citizens of Arcadia, today we welcome the return of our beloved sister, Princess [sel], who has braved the darkness that once threatened our world and emerged triumphant."
    aur " Arcadia的公民们，今日我们喜迎挚爱的妹妹[sel]公主归来，她曾勇敢直面威胁世界的黑暗并凯旋。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:242
translate chinese castle3_a7142f73:

    # aur "Let us honor her courage and welcome her in her new role as our princess and protector."
    aur "让我们致敬她的勇气，欢迎她以公主与守护者的新身份回归。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:243
translate chinese castle3_97f61164:

    # "The room erupts into applause. [sel] stands beside Queen [aur]. Her posture is poised, yet a subtle tension lingers in her stance."
    "全场爆发出掌声。[sel]站在[aur]女王身旁，姿态优雅却带着不易察觉的紧绷。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:244
translate chinese castle3_bdf419c3:

    # "The Virtues exchange glances, a mix of admiration and curiosity."
    "美德们交换着钦佩与好奇交织的眼神。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:252
translate chinese castle3_1b580955:

    # rub "*{i}Whispering{/i}* She cleans up well, doesn’t she?"
    rub "*{i} 窃窃私语 {/i}* 她打扮起来真不错，对吧？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:253
translate chinese castle3_e88a2fa5:

    # hon "The people seem to accept her. That’s what matters most right now."
    hon "民众似乎接受了她。眼下这才是最重要的。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:254
translate chinese castle3_d3ad3b51:

    # mox "She’s even got the whole princess thing down. Future’s looking bright."
    mox "连公主仪态都无可挑剔。未来一片光明呢。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:255
translate chinese castle3_f96d6341:

    # "As the ceremony concludes, [sel] catches my eye with a subtle nod, gesturing me over."
    "典礼结束时，[sel]用不易察觉的点头示意我过去。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:258
translate chinese castle3_f7c21442:

    # "She politely excuses herself from the group and steps outside, the sounds of the celebration fading as she leaves the festivities behind."
    "她礼貌地辞别众人走向室外，庆典的喧闹随她的离去渐渐消隐。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:263
translate chinese castle3_8154a885:

    # sel "I never imagined I’d be standing here like this."
    sel "我从没想过自己会这样站在这里。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:264
translate chinese castle3_14050bc3:

    # mc "You’ve more than earned it. And might I add, you look absolutely stunning."
    mc "你完全配得上这一切。而且不得不说，你此刻美得令人屏息。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:266
translate chinese castle3_46ffa2e2:

    # sel "Hehe, you may."
    sel "呵呵，准了。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:268
translate chinese castle3_f56c023a:

    # "We walk to the end of the balcony, we watch as fireworks soar into the sky from all across the city."
    "我们走到露台尽头，望着烟花从整座城市各处升空绽放。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:269
translate chinese castle3_b42af911:

    # mc "You’re really not going to stay at your own party?"
    mc "你真不打算留在自己的聚会上？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:271
translate chinese castle3_3e755ae1:

    # sel "I’m tired of parties. They feel like too much, too soon."
    sel "我厌倦了宴会。这一切来得太急太满了。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:272
translate chinese castle3_666c25e4:

    # sel "But here, I can relax. From here, the city looks beautiful."
    sel "但在这里我能放松。从这儿看整座城市很美。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:273
translate chinese castle3_13ac49a2:

    # sel "But up close, it feels alien… like I’m haunting a world that forgot me."
    sel "可近距离看却觉得陌生…仿佛在某个遗忘我的世界里游荡。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:274
translate chinese castle3_b9607eb5:

    # "She pauses, her gaze distant, voice soft."
    "她停顿片刻，目光飘向远方，声音轻柔。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:275
translate chinese castle3_daf5808c:

    # sel "The people, the sounds, even the stars seem unfamiliar. I’ve been gone too long."
    sel "人群、声音，连星辰都显得陌生。我离开太久了。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:276
translate chinese castle3_1a2fff35:

    # mc "A thousand years... that would make anyone feel lost."
    mc "一千年…足以让任何人迷失方向。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:278
translate chinese castle3_d3183fec:

    # sel "There’s a loneliness in being a remnant of a forgotten time. I walk these halls, hear people laugh, speak in ways I scarcely understand. Their slang, their machines, even their music… all so strange."
    sel "作为被遗忘时代的残影，孤独如影随形。我穿行于宫廊，听着人们的谈笑，那些几乎无法理解的用语、俚语、机器，甚至音乐…全都如此陌生。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:280
translate chinese castle3_1c5aebe2:

    # sel "Once, I thought myself above the mortals of Arcadia. Their lives passed in fleeting moments while I stood eternal."
    sel "曾以为自已凌驾于Arcadia的凡者之上。他们生命转瞬即逝，而我永恒存在。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:282
translate chinese castle3_32ce5d82:

    # sel "Yet now I envy them. They moved forward, even in death, while I remained frozen in time, a monument to my own failure."
    sel "可现在却羡慕他们。哪怕死亡也向前行进，而我困在时光里，成为自身失败的纪念碑。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:284
translate chinese castle3_a21b4eb4:

    # mc "Failure? No, you were a victim of circumstance, of an evil force beyond your control. What happened back then doesn’t define you. It was something done to you, not who you are."
    mc "失败？不，你是环境的受害者，是被无法控制的邪恶力量所害。过去的遭遇不能定义你，那是施加于你之事，而非你本身。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:285
translate chinese castle3_e8f202d5:

    # mc "Your worth isn't measured by the mistakes of the past but by the choices you make now."
    mc "你的价值不由过去错误衡量，而取决于此刻的选择。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:287
translate chinese castle3_a05cdcb0:

    # sel "Perhaps... But lack of control doesn’t wash away the blood staining my hands. I still remember the anger, the resentment festering inside me. I let it consume me... until there was nothing left."
    sel "或许…但失控并不能洗刷我手上的血迹。我仍记得那些啃噬内心的愤怒与怨恨，任其吞噬直至一无所有。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:289
translate chinese castle3_864f62c7:

    # sel "One thousand years of void. Now, I’m here, surrounded by strangers and customs I can barely grasp."
    sel "千年的虚无。如今身处难以理解的陌生人与习俗之中。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:291
translate chinese castle3_368633a0:

    # mc "Then it’s time to start filling that 'nothing' with something real."
    mc "是时候用真实的事物填补那片\"虚无\"了。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:292
translate chinese castle3_47fb4a7e:

    # mc "You’ve been given a second chance, [sel]. The pain from your past doesn't have to be the end of your story."
    mc "你得到了第二次机会，[sel]。过去的痛苦不必成为故事的终点。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:293
translate chinese castle3_8be7bd44:

    # mc "You have the chance to define who you are now. Not the you from the past, not Midnight. Just the person sitting here, looking at the stars."
    mc "你可以重新定义自己。不是过去的你，不是Midnight。只是此刻坐在这里凝望星辰的这个人。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:295
translate chinese castle3_e61b77d5:

    # sel "But where do I begin? How can I find my place in a world that feels so... different, so strange?"
    sel "但我该从何开始？在这个如此…不同又陌生的世界里，如何找到归属？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:297
translate chinese castle3_133889c9:

    # mc "Start small. Find the pieces of this world that speak to you. The aroma of rain, the sound of music drifting through the halls, the kindness in someone's smile. Let them guide you."
    mc "从小处着手。寻找这个世界与你共鸣的碎片：雨水的芬芳，廊间飘荡的乐声，某人笑容里的善意。让它们指引你。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:298
translate chinese castle3_fc08c231:

    # mc "The rest will come with time, like learning a language through immersion. And let us help you. Me, [aur], everyone here."
    mc "其余的自会随时间显现，就像沉浸式学习语言。让我们帮助你——我、[aur]，这里的所有人。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:299
translate chinese castle3_0cb66f93:

    # mc "We’re not just faces in the crowd. We care about you."
    mc "我们不只是人群中的面孔。我们在乎你。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:301
translate chinese castle3_890ba5d7:

    # sel "Hm… Perhaps I’ve spent too long mourning what was lost... and not enough embracing what lies ahead."
    sel "嗯…或许我沉湎于失去之物太久了…却未曾好好拥抱未来。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:302
translate chinese castle3_4aacec04:

    # mc "Exactly. And you’re more adaptable than you give yourself credit for. You’ve already survived more than most could ever face."
    mc "正是如此。你远比自以为的更具适应性。已经挺过了多数人无法想象的磨难。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:304
translate chinese castle3_c9516f4d:

    # sel "Survived, yes. Thrived... not yet. But perhaps... in time."
    sel "挺过来了，是的。但活得精彩…尚未。不过或许…假以时日。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:305
translate chinese castle3_ec54d70a:

    # "A quiet moment passes between us, occasionally broken up by the sound of the fireworks. It's hard not to notice that every flash in the sky is for her."
    "我们之间静默片刻，偶尔被烟花声打破。很难不注意到每道天幕流光都是为她绽放。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:307
translate chinese castle3_0ccff107:

    # sel "I appreciate you not treating me like some tragic relic."
    sel "感谢你没有把我当成悲惨的遗迹。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:308
translate chinese castle3_0ddbcbd7:

    # mc "You’re no relic, [sel]. You've got a life worth living and so much more ahead of you."
    mc "你才不是遗迹，[sel]。你拥有值得珍惜的生命，前方还有无限可能。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:310
translate chinese castle3_8649e623:

    # sel "Are these the words that inspired so many? You’re a dangerous man with that silver tongue. I’m glad you’re on our side."
    sel "这就是激励众人的话语吗？你的口才真是危险。真庆幸你站在我们这边。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:311
translate chinese castle3_36f3fd91:

    # mc "I admit, no one’s ever critiqued my 'gift of the gab' quite so cynically before."
    mc "说实话，从没人用这么犀利的点评批判过我的\"口才\"。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:313
translate chinese castle3_fbef5f91:

    # sel "Tell me, [mc]... What helped you adapt to this world?"
    sel "告诉我，[mc]…是什么帮助你适应了这个世界的？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:314
translate chinese castle3_8d84b768:

    # mc "It’s not something I talk about often anymore, but it felt like my entire life had been torn away."
    mc "虽然现在不常提起，但当时感觉整个生命都被撕裂了。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:316
translate chinese castle3_45dbb3d4:

    # sel "Was it truly that bad? I never meant to…"
    sel "真的那么糟糕吗？我从没想过……"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:317
translate chinese castle3_a1b756b9:

    # mc "Hey... it’s okay. You didn’t have a choice."
    mc "嘿…没关系的。你当时别无选择。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:318
translate chinese castle3_19d829e3:

    # mc "Still, I ended up here. Stranded in a world that wasn’t mine. Everything I knew, friends, my family, even the air I breathed, gone."
    mc "可最终我困在这里。滞留在一个不属于我的世界。熟知的一切、朋友、家人，连呼吸的空气都消失了。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:319
translate chinese castle3_52f6fae9:

    # sel "Then you do understand... more than I realized. How... how did you bear it? How did you keep going?"
    sel "原来你真的明白…比我想象的更深刻。怎么…你是怎么承受的？如何坚持下来的？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:320
translate chinese castle3_735c1984:

    # mc "At first? I didn’t. I was angry. Lost. Kept searching for a way back, clinging to the hope that I could undo what happened..."
    mc "最初？我没能承受。愤怒、迷失，不断寻找归途，希望我能挽回所发生的事情......"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:321
translate chinese castle3_d0a7ece5:

    # mc "But at some point, I stopped focusing on what I’d lost and started looking at what I could build instead."
    mc "但在某个时刻，我不再执着于失去之物，开始关注能创造什么。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:322
translate chinese castle3_a8684cdf:

    # mc "I realized that even though this world felt foreign, the people in it were just as real."
    mc "我意识到即便这个世界陌生，其中的人们同样真实。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:324
translate chinese castle3_1b4af362:

    # sel "So you… let go?"
    sel "所以你…放下了？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:325
translate chinese castle3_2da8aef5:

    # mc "Not completely. I don’t think you ever truly let go of the things that mattered to you."
    mc "并非完全放下。我认为真正重要的东西永远不会彻底释怀。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:326
translate chinese castle3_c48ff776:

    # mc "But I stopped letting them weigh me down. Now, I carry them forward as a part of who I am."
    mc "但我不再让它们拖垮自己。如今我带着它们前行，成为自我的一部分。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:328
translate chinese castle3_90974216:

    # sel "You must possess tremendous strength to lift such weights. For me, making peace with such loss… it feels impossible."
    sel "能承载这样的重量，你必定拥有巨大力量。但让我与这种失去和解…似乎不可能。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:329
translate chinese castle3_29b44231:

    # mc "It’s not strength, [sel]. It’s time…"
    mc "不是力量，[sel]。是时间…"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:330
translate chinese castle3_467df061:

    # mc "I had people who helped me, people who gave me reasons to stay."
    mc "曾有人帮助我，给我留下的理由。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:331
translate chinese castle3_532c6bbc:

    # mc "You’ve got a chance to build something new here too, [sel]."
    mc "你也有机会在这里重建新生，[sel]。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:333
translate chinese castle3_9fafd508:

    # sel "Having someone who understands… truly understands… makes it feel less daunting."
    sel "有人理解…真正地理解…会让这件事不再那么可怕。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:334
translate chinese castle3_107f7964:

    # mc "Exactly. We’re both a little lost, but maybe we can help each other find our way."
    mc "正是如此。我们都有些迷茫，但或许能互相帮助找到方向。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:336
translate chinese castle3_0297a6d2:

    # sel "Thank you for sharing your side, and for reminding me I’m not as alone as I thought."
    sel "感谢你分享这些，也提醒了我并非如想象中孤独。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:337
translate chinese castle3_b83b5945:

    # sel "Perhaps this world isn’t so alien after all. Maybe I simply need time… and patience."
    sel "或许这个世界终究没那么陌生。可能我只是需要时间…和耐心。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:339
translate chinese castle3_6f186733:

    # sel "I’ll take your advice. I’ll explore this new world. And, hopefully, I’ll discover there’s a place for me in it after all."
    sel "我会采纳你的建议。去探索新世界，并希望最终能找到属于我的位置。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:340
translate chinese castle3_961e4a30:

    # mc "And if you don’t find your place? Forge your own."
    mc "如果找不到位置？那就亲手打造一个。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:342
translate chinese castle3_d386319a:

    # sel "Then... Let's do it."
    sel "那么…开始吧。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:343
translate chinese castle3_61db58ee:

    # mc "Right now?"
    mc "现在就开始？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:345
translate chinese castle3_29770004:

    # sel "Right now!"
    sel "就现在！"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:348
translate chinese castle3_fe736895:

    # "She sweeps me off my feet and we soar into the sky together."
    "她将我拦腰抱起，一同跃入云端。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:350
translate chinese castle3_c4456dd4:

    # "Just as I was about the complain about the sudden take-off, the view leaves me speechless."
    "正当我要抱怨这突然的起飞时，眼前的景色让我屏息。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:351
translate chinese castle3_8fefeb57:

    # "This is one of the most beautiful views of the city, split by the deep ravine."
    "这是城市最美的景观之一，深邃峡谷将天地分割。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:352
translate chinese castle3_faee01ca:

    # sel "The ravine… A scar on the land, formed during the first battle between Midnight and [aur]."
    sel "那道峡谷…是Midnight与[aur]初次交战时在大地留下的伤疤。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:357
translate chinese castle3_b20ef49b:

    # sel "The details are hazy, like shadows flickering through firelight on a cave wall. But I remember the destruction. The chaos."
    sel "细节模糊如岩壁上跃动的火光残影，但我记得那场毁灭与混乱。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:358
translate chinese castle3_306d18d2:

    # "She pauses, staring down at the gaping ravine. I've seen it before, but I'm left in awe as I visualize the scale of their clash."
    "她停顿片刻凝视着下方裂谷。虽曾见过，但想象她们交战规模时仍深感震撼。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:359
translate chinese castle3_3957aa95:

    # sel "That battle didn’t just destroy the old Arcadia, it reshaped the entire course of this country’s history."
    sel "那场战役不仅摧毁了旧Arcadia，更重塑了整个国家的历史轨迹。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:360
translate chinese castle3_47d32403:

    # mc "I figured as much. I've wondered what the difference was between this universe and my last. What was the key event that spiraled into a thousand different possibilities?"
    mc "我猜到了。一直好奇这个宇宙与我之前世界的差异，那个引发千种可能性的关键事件究竟是什么。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:361
translate chinese castle3_4871f7ab:

    # mc "It was your absence."
    mc "是你的缺席。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:364
translate chinese castle3_2ae37df3:

    # mc "The city you see now, with its towering buildings and sprawling districts, none of it would exist without that shift."
    mc "现在这座高楼林立、城区纵横的城市，如果没有那次变故根本不会存在。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:366
translate chinese castle3_47d21702:

    # sel "It’s as though my corruption is etched into the very bones of this world."
    sel "仿佛我的堕落已铭刻在这个世界的根基里。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:367
translate chinese castle3_94e9f6af:

    # mc "I’m not so sure about that. This city may have its shadows, but to borrow your own words, it’s not just surviving; it's thriving."
    mc "我不这么认为。这座城市或许有阴影，但借用你的话：它不仅在生存，更在繁荣生长。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:369
translate chinese castle3_128bdcf1:

    # mc "Your absence sparked a wave of growth. United against the darkness, technology advanced, communities came together."
    mc "你的缺席催生了发展浪潮。人们团结对抗黑暗，科技飞跃，社群凝聚。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:371
translate chinese castle3_abac51a1:

    # sel "But at what cost? Thousands—no, tens of thousands—lost their lives. Families torn apart, futures stolen."
    sel "但代价呢？成千上万的生命消逝，家庭破碎，未来被剥夺。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:372
translate chinese castle3_8640adac:

    # sel "And all for what? For my bitterness and jealousy could run rampant. The city may have rebuilt itself, but it was forced to, like a tree growing around a wound."
    sel "而这一切为了什么？只为让我的怨妒肆虐。城市或许重建了，但那是被迫的，如同树木围着伤口生长。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:373
translate chinese castle3_62fb3eba:

    # "She turns to me, her eyes glimmering with a mix of sorrow and resolve."
    "她转向我，眼中交织着哀伤与决意。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:375
translate chinese castle3_2b7c0730:

    # sel "It was Midnight, but knowing that doesn’t make it easier to bear. I was the one that was weak. I let her in."
    sel "虽是Midnight所为，但知晓这点并未让负担减轻。软弱的是我，是我放任了她。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:377
translate chinese castle3_457e544a:

    # sel "Every brick of this city, every shadow cast by its concrete towers, feels like it rests on a foundation of my guilt."
    sel "这座城市的每块砖石，每道混凝土高塔投下的阴影，都仿佛筑于我的愧疚之上。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:378
translate chinese castle3_495ad5d7:

    # mc "And yet, here it is; alive, bustling, moving forward."
    mc "但它依然存在：生机勃勃，熙攘前行。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:380
translate chinese castle3_008979bf:

    # sel "That isn’t enough. I can’t simply sit in the castle and hope time will heal the wounds I left behind."
    sel "这不够。我不能坐在城堡指望时间治愈我留下的创伤。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:381
translate chinese castle3_30b8942c:

    # sel "I need to balance the scales, to do enough good to outweigh the evil I’ve caused. Until then, I’ll never be able to call myself whole."
    sel "我必须平衡善恶天平，用足够的善行抵消造成的罪孽。在那之前，我永远无法自称完整。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:382
translate chinese castle3_4a033617:

    # mc "And what does ‘enough good’ look like to you? Saving lives? Healing the land? You’re already taking steps in that direction by being here, [sel]."
    mc "对你而言\"足够的善行\"是什么？拯救生命？治愈大地？你出现在这里就已经迈出了步伐，[sel]"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:384
translate chinese castle3_33808872:

    # sel "It’s more all-encompassing than that. I need to know I’ve left the world better than I found it."
    sel "这需要更全面的行动。我必须让世界比我到来时更好。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:385
translate chinese castle3_f69acf02:

    # sel "That I’ve given back a hundredfold for every life lost because of me."
    sel "为每个因我消逝的生命而付出百倍回报。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:387
translate chinese castle3_376eacca:

    # sel "Maybe it’s impossible. Maybe I’ll spend the rest of eternity trying and never succeed."
    sel "也许这是不可能的。或许我将在余生中努力尝试，却永远不会成功。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:388
translate chinese castle3_3763caf5:

    # sel "But I’ll do it."
    sel "但我会坚持做下去。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:391
translate chinese castle3_a97bd75e:

    # "[sel] turns back to stare at the ravine."
    "[sel]转身再度凝视裂谷。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:393
translate chinese castle3_4b8fcab8:

    # sel "When I look at this ravine, I only see my failure. But maybe I can transform it into a reminder, not of what was lost, but of what was built around it. Do you think that’s possible, [mc]?"
    sel "当我注视这道裂谷，只看见自己的失败。但或许我能将其转化为警示，不是为失去之物，而是为环绕它重建的一切。你觉得这可能吗，[mc]？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:394
translate chinese castle3_a249f80c:

    # mc "I don’t just think it’s possible, I know it is. That scar in the land doesn’t define Arcadia, just like your past doesn’t define you."
    mc "我不认为可能，而是确信可能。大地的伤痕定义不了 Arcadia，正如你的过去定义不了你。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:396
translate chinese castle3_f0123e96:

    # sel "I like that. Perhaps it’s time I stopped seeing myself as the villain. If I want to do better, I need to be in the right mindset."
    sel "我喜欢这个说法。或许我该停止将自己视为反派。如果想做得更好，需要先调整心态。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:397
translate chinese castle3_c4b4acd7:

    # mc "That’s the spirit. If anyone can do it, it’s you."
    mc "正是这种精神。如果有人能做到，那必定是你。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:398
translate chinese castle3_33a5ed8a:

    # sel "Let's head back for now."
    sel "我们先回去吧。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:403
translate chinese castle3_21d7cbea:

    # "We returned to the balcony with the fireworks stopped. Actually... this is a different balcony, isn't it? The view is the same, but the room it's attached to seems to be different. Oh well."
    "我们回到烟花已停的阳台。其实…这是另一个阳台对吧？景色相同，但连接的房间似乎不同。算了。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:405
translate chinese castle3_eafa6b25:

    # sel "Enough about me tonight. I want to start this... healing journey on the right foot by helping you."
    sel "今晚关于我的话题够了。我想通过帮助你来正确开启这段…疗愈之旅。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:406
translate chinese castle3_59185273:

    # sel "You’ve carried the weight of multiple worlds, and you’re still standing strong. That deserves recognition."
    sel "你承载了多个世界的重量，却依然坚韧站立。这值得被认可。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:407
translate chinese castle3_62fe4d31:

    # sel "I’ve prepared the spells to tether you once you're aligned. I trust you’ve been making progress? You strike me as the type who doesn’t leave things unfinished."
    sel "我已准备好咒语，待你调整妥当即可进行锚定。相信你已有进展？你像是不会半途而废的人。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:408
translate chinese castle3_05538ebb:

    # mc "Progress is going well. I’ve formed the same relationships with the same people. Can you check?"
    mc "进展顺利。我已与相同的人们建立了同等深度的联结。能帮我确认吗？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:410
translate chinese castle3_11bc7b6f:

    # sel "Of course. One moment..."
    sel "当然。稍等…"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:413
translate chinese castle3_4ad15853:

    # "[sel] casts a brief spell."
    "[sel]施展了一个简短的咒语。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:415
translate chinese castle3_df234363:

    # sel "Oh my, you’re but a drop away from success. Anything you could tip the scales with?"
    sel "天呐，你离成功只有一步之遥。有什么能打破平衡的吗？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:416
translate chinese castle3_02c70aca:

    # mc "As I suspected. Just… one big thing left."
    mc "如我所料。只差…最后一件事。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:417
translate chinese castle3_c696840d:

    # "[sel]’s brow lifts, and her smile grows wider, the playful edge to her expression unmistakable."
    "[sel]挑眉展露更灿烂的笑容，神情中戏谑的意味显而易见。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:419
translate chinese castle3_aec7be5a:

    # sel "One big thing? Now you have my attention. Pray tell."
    sel "一件大事？这可勾起我的好奇了。愿闻其详。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:420
translate chinese castle3_e5174021:

    # mc "It’s… complicated."
    mc "这…有点复杂。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:422
translate chinese castle3_94feb67b:

    # sel "Come now, [mc], you can’t leave me in suspense like this. What is it? Do you need to slay a mythical beast? Visit some ancient ruins?"
    sel "别这样[mc]，别吊我胃口嘛。到底是什么？需要斩杀神话巨兽？还是探访远古遗迹？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:424
translate chinese castle3_9b76cc8d:

    # sel "Or perhaps… It involves me?"
    sel "或者…与我有关？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:425
translate chinese castle3_d6343eb6:

    # "I freeze for a moment, and that hesitation is all the confirmation that she needs."
    "我瞬间僵住，而这犹豫已给了她全部答案。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:427
translate chinese castle3_1feba16d:

    # sel "As I expected… How intriguing. Do enlighten me, [mc]. What exactly must we do to complete this alignment?"
    sel "果然如此…真有趣。请指点我吧，[mc]。究竟要怎么做才能完成这次锚定？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:428
translate chinese castle3_f94cc6a3:

    # mc "Hmm... I never was any good at being dishonest."
    mc "嗯…我向来不擅长隐瞒。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:429
translate chinese castle3_384d5cdf:

    # mc "You see, in the other universe... we were close."
    mc "你看，在另一个宇宙…我们关系亲密。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:430
translate chinese castle3_f1a7b6aa:

    # "Her brows lift slightly, though she doesn’t seem entirely surprised."
    "她的眉毛微微上扬，却似乎并不完全感到意外。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:432
translate chinese castle3_436fc6bc:

    # sel "Intimately? My, my, [mc], what secrets you keep."
    sel "亲密到哪种程度？哎呀呀，[mc]，你藏得可真深。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:433
translate chinese castle3_e5616c39:

    # mc "Of course, it was different there, different circumstances, another version of you."
    mc "当然，那时情况不同，环境不同，是另一个版本的你。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:434
translate chinese castle3_815cef8e:

    # mc "But to fully align with this universe, I’d have to… well..."
    mc "但要完全锚定在这个宇宙，我必须…呃…"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:436
translate chinese castle3_692a6cde:

    # sel "And here I thought you were going to ask for something impossible. Instead, you’re proposing something… dare I say, quite achievable."
    sel "还以为你会提什么不可能的要求呢。结果却是…恕我直言，相当可行的提议。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:437
translate chinese castle3_645d55f5:

    # mc "Heh, you’re taking this well."
    mc "呵呵，你接受得挺坦然嘛。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:439
translate chinese castle3_d84d96df:

    # sel "Did you think I’d faint at the suggestion? Please, [mc], I may have spent a thousand years on the moon, but I’m not some naive maiden."
    sel "你以为我会被这提议吓晕吗？得了吧[mc]，我在月亮上待了千年，可不是什么天真少女。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:441
translate chinese castle3_8852610b:

    # sel "I understand the gravity of what you’re saying. And the humor."
    sel "我明白你话语的分量。以及其中的幽默。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:442
translate chinese castle3_24bb1a59:

    # mc "Humor?"
    mc "幽默？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:443
translate chinese castle3_38b9cfad:

    # "Smirking, she leans in slightly, her voice dropping to a teasing whisper."
    "她抿嘴轻笑，微微倾身，嗓音化作戏谑的低语。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:445
translate chinese castle3_67e86db1:

    # sel "Truth is, I’ve known all along. I’ve just been playfully waiting for you to admit it~ It’s charming, really."
    sel "其实我早就知道了。只是故意等着你亲口承认呢~挺可爱的，真的。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:446
translate chinese castle3_0e1ffbd3:

    # mc "Well, when you put it like that, that is pretty funny."
    mc "嗯，你这么一说确实挺好笑的。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:448
translate chinese castle3_0e071d69:

    # sel "And as for whether or not I’m prepared for such a thing…"
    sel "至于我是否对此有所准备…"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:450
translate chinese castle3_1930f39a:

    # sel "You’re right to tread carefully, [mc]. But you’re also right to trust me with this."
    sel "你的谨慎是对的，[mc]。但将这件事托付给我也是对的。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:452
translate chinese castle3_3dc3c398:

    # sel "I’ll give it some thought. And when the time is right, we’ll see where this journey takes us."
    sel "我会认真考虑。当时机成熟，我们再看这段旅程将引向何方。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:453
translate chinese castle3_dcf95a5e:

    # mc "That’s more than fair. Thanks, [sel]."
    mc "非常公平。谢谢你，[sel]。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:455
translate chinese castle3_28873b18:

    # sel "Don’t thank me yet. Who knows, I may make you work for it~"
    sel "先别谢我。说不定我会让你付出点代价呢~"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:456
translate chinese castle3_929381ef:

    # "She winks, the playful edge returning to her voice. She almost managed to turn her back to me before I stopped her."
    "她眨眨眼，嗓音里重染戏谑。几乎要转身离去时被我拦住。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:457
translate chinese castle3_b2dc7bce:

    # mc "I can do that. What would you have me do?"
    mc "我能做到。需要我做什么？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:459
translate chinese castle3_139ebace:

    # sel "Oohh..? My, actually taking me up on my offer?"
    sel "哦…？哎呀，真要接受我的提议？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:461
translate chinese castle3_0c5887c8:

    # sel "Hm... Could I? {i}Should I{/i}?"
    sel "嗯…我能吗？{i} 我应该吗 {/i}？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:463
translate chinese castle3_cf8b0e3f:

    # sel "There's an ache in my gut that has persisted ever since I returned... Perhaps you're the only person that could alleviate this feeling..."
    sel "自从我回来后腹中一直隐隐作痛…或许唯有你能缓解这种不适……"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:464
translate chinese castle3_2d462f5b:

    # mc "Are you in pain?"
    mc "你在忍受疼痛吗？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:465
translate chinese castle3_249380a9:

    # sel "There is something I'd really like to know. An invaluable piece of information…"
    sel "有件事我迫切想知道。一条无比珍贵的信息……"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:467
translate chinese castle3_33269144:

    # sel "Can you tell me what was I like… in that other universe? The [sel] who wasn’t banished for a thousand years."
    sel "能告诉我…那个宇宙的我是什么模样吗？那个未被放逐千年的[sel]。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:469
translate chinese castle3_2882d475:

    # sel "I’d like to know… What kind of person was she? What did she dream of? What did she love? Was she like me at all?"
    sel "我想知道…她是个怎样的人？怀着怎样的梦想？爱着什么？可有一丝与我相似？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:470
translate chinese castle3_e4148f10:

    # "I consider the question carefully. This is more than just an idle curiosity, it’s a way for [sel] to measure herself, to find pieces of herself that transcend universes."
    "我仔细斟酌这个问题。这不止是好奇，更是[sel]衡量自我、寻找超越宇宙的自我碎片的方式。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:471
translate chinese castle3_b58331a2:

    # mc "She was intelligent, witty, with this air of elegance that made everyone else in the room seem dull by comparison."
    mc "她聪慧机敏，带着让满室生辉的优雅气质。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:472
translate chinese castle3_0ae59b32:

    # mc "And a sharp sense of humor. Sometimes sharper than I was ready for. Caring little for holding her princessly persona when in casual company."
    mc "还有犀利的幽默感，有时犀利得让我措手不及。在私下场合从不端着公主架子。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:474
translate chinese castle3_bd0df670:

    # sel "Haha, sounds familiar."
    sel "哈哈，听起来很熟悉。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:475
translate chinese castle3_8911448e:

    # mc "She was also incredibly curious. About everything. She once spent an entire evening explaining dreams to me."
    mc "她还拥有惊人的好奇心，对万事万物都如此。曾花整晚时间向我阐释梦境的意义。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:476
translate chinese castle3_cc670641:

    # mc "I thought it was going to be this profound, mystical talk about the dream realm, but no—she was mostly fascinated by how weird dreams could be."
    mc "本以为会是关于梦境的深奥神秘讨论，结果——她主要痴迷于梦境能有多荒诞。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:478
translate chinese castle3_030ca407:

    # sel "That does sound like me. Did you admire her?"
    sel "这确实像我。你欣赏她吗？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:479
translate chinese castle3_34b157fd:

    # mc "I mean, how could I not? She was wise but also playful, and she had this way of making the world feel lighter, even when things were heavy."
    mc "怎么可能不欣赏？她聪明却又不失顽皮，有种让世界变轻盈的魔力，即使在沉重时刻。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:480
translate chinese castle3_45caad0a:

    # mc "And she loved her work. She dealt with magical anomalies, creatures, and artifacts. Always had the wildest stories to tell."
    mc "她深爱自己的工作，处理魔法异常现象、生物与器物，总有最离奇的故事可讲。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:482
translate chinese castle3_4488e7fd:

    # sel "Magical anomalies, you say? What kind of stories?"
    sel "魔法异常？什么样的故事？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:483
translate chinese castle3_ca20243b:

    # mc "Okay, here’s one that sticks with me. In her world, the moon has an additional crater. It wasn’t just a natural formation; a strange statue caused it."
    mc "有个故事令我难忘。在她的世界，月亮多了一个环形山，并非自然形成，而是一座奇特雕像造成的。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:484
translate chinese castle3_d02991c3:

    # mc "There was a bizarre statue that would automatically move to claim a certain, magical ring. It was noted for being dangerous because it’d suddenly start to move with terrifying speed and power."
    mc "有座诡异雕像会自动移动去夺取某枚魔法戒指。它以危险著称，会突然以骇人的速度与力量移动。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:485
translate chinese castle3_5aa69ac5:

    # mc "[sel]’s solution? Teleport the ring onto the moon. And the creature? It leapt from the earth to the moon in one bound."
    mc "[sel]的解决方案？把戒指传送到月球。而那生物？它从地球一跃登月。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:486
translate chinese castle3_df56fe5b:

    # mc "That was her idea of containing a dangerous entity."
    mc "这就是她约束危险实体的方式。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:488
translate chinese castle3_08264198:

    # sel "That’s absurd. But also, brilliant. I would have liked to meet her."
    sel "荒谬。但也精彩。真想见见她。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:489
translate chinese castle3_d8ab7fd3:

    # mc "With the mirror, you still could! She was bold, confident, and a bit… unpredictable at times."
    mc "有镜子你仍能见到！她大胆自信，有时还有点…难以捉摸。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:491
translate chinese castle3_5bf04c04:

    # sel "It’s nice to know that in at least one universe, I didn’t make such a mess of things."
    sel "知道至少有个宇宙的我没把一切搞砸，真好。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:492
translate chinese castle3_394aaf37:

    # mc "But she had her own struggles. She wasn’t perfect either."
    mc "但她也有自己的困境，同样不完美。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:493
translate chinese castle3_1cd78a98:

    # mc "She just lived her life, did her best."
    mc "她只是过着自己的生活，尽力而为。"

