    "联结瞬间建立。这种感觉令人安心。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:682
translate chinese castle3_963cfa51:

    # sel "It’s done. You’re here now. And this is where you’ll stay."
    sel "完成了。你现在真正在这里了。这就是你将永远停留的地方。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:683
translate chinese castle3_5d9358db:

    # mc "Thank you... I feel it… like a part of me just clicked into place."
    mc "谢谢你……我能感觉到……就像我缺失的一部分终于归位了。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:684
translate chinese castle3_3e2dc115:

    # sel "Don’t thank me yet. The journey’s far from over."
    sel "先别急着谢我。这段旅程还远未结束。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:686
translate chinese castle3_491d15fc:

    # sel "You’ve earned more than just the tethering. I’ve been working on something else, you deserve to see it."
    sel "你得到的不仅仅是与世界的联结。我还在准备另一样东西，你值得亲眼看看。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:687
translate chinese castle3_f5d3bffb:

    # mc "Something else? What is it?"
    mc "另一样东西？是什么？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:689
translate chinese castle3_0545471c:

    # sel "Trust me. Come with me."
    sel "相信我。跟我来。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:695
translate chinese castle3_8878aeea:

    # "She took me to another room, where a great mirror stood tall. I immediately knew what I was looking at."
    "她带我走进另一个房间，一面高大的镜子矗立在那里。我立刻明白了眼前的是什么。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:697
translate chinese castle3_e3693780:

    # sel "I’ve been working on this for a while."
    sel "我准备这个已经有一阵子了。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:698
translate chinese castle3_363ec15a:

    # mc "So... it’s ready to connect back to my old world?"
    mc "所以……它已经能连接到我原来的世界了吗？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:700
translate chinese castle3_23f38a9d:

    # "I wave at myself through the mirror. It’s not a portal yet, but the reflection ripples with magic."
    "我隔着镜子朝自己挥手。这还不是传送门，但倒影已在魔法作用下泛起涟漪。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:702
translate chinese castle3_8838c8da:

    # sel "In theory, yes. I’ve done everything I need to on this side. But creating a portal isn’t a one-sided endeavor. It requires an interaction—a sort of mutual... consent, you could say."
    sel "理论上是的。我在这边已经完成了所有必要的准备。但建立传送门不是单方面能完成的事。它需要一种互动——可以说是某种双向的……认可。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:703
translate chinese castle3_87f47305:

    # mc "Consent? From whom?"
    mc "认可？需要谁的认可？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:705
translate chinese castle3_d7112c09:

    # sel "Whoever’s on the other side. The portal can’t fully open unless someone there accepts the connection."
    sel "需要来自那个世界的人。除非对面有人接受这个联结，否则传送门无法完全开启。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:706
translate chinese castle3_07e88c31:

    # mc "Hmm… That makes sense. You think someone’s going to answer the call?"
    mc "嗯…有道理。你觉得会有人回应这个召唤吗？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:708
translate chinese castle3_5a579f9e:

    # sel "I do. The way the magic works, it reaches out to those most aligned with you, those who would recognize your presence. If there’s anyone still connected to your world who cares... they’ll—"
    sel "我相信会的。魔法的运作方式会让它主动联结与你最契合的人，那些能感知到你存在的人。只要那个世界还有在乎你的人……他们就会——"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:709
translate chinese castle3_6764570b:

    # "The mirror suddenly starts to gleam with an otherworldly glow."
    "镜子突然泛起异样的微光。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:711
translate chinese castle3_43f3107d:

    # sel "Oh my… Let’s find out, shall we?"
    sel "天呐…让我们看看结果吧，好吗？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:713
translate chinese castle3_87e6b1b2:

    # "The room hums with energy as [sel] channels her magic. The surface of the mirror ripples like water, shimmering as the portal begins to form."
    "房间里能量嗡鸣，[sel]引导着她的魔法。镜面如水波般荡漾，随着传送门的逐渐形成泛起粼粼微光。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:714
translate chinese castle3_a713e1d4:

    # "The light grows brighter, and then… Suddenly, a figure steps through."
    "光芒越来越亮，接着……突然，一个身影穿了过来。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:716
translate chinese castle3_858f2d35:

    # misc "Well, well, well. What do we have here?"
    misc "哎呀呀，看看这是谁来了？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:717
translate chinese castle3_59f7bc39:

    # "Her voice is smooth and playful, as she steps forward, her eyes flicking between myself and [sel]."
    "她的声音柔和而带着玩味，一边向前走，目光在我和[sel]之间流转。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:718
translate chinese castle3_d970135b:

    # "I can’t believe it! It’s…"
    "真不敢相信！这是……"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:739
translate chinese castle3_8ab6d875:

    # daw "I felt someone knocking on the door and couldn’t resist answering. And what a fun pair to stumble into!"
    daw "我感觉到有人在敲门，实在忍不住想回应。没想到会撞见这么有趣的一对！"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:740
translate chinese castle3_cc37d6a2:

    # mc "[daw]! I... I can’t believe it!"
    mc "[daw]!我…我真没想到会是你！"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:742
translate chinese castle3_37dddcef:

    # daw "You better believe it, kitten! I see you already have some passing familiarity with me."
    daw "你最好相信哦，小猫咪！看来你已经对我有些了解了呢。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:743
translate chinese castle3_1fedbd4d:

    # daw "I was curious who’d be bold enough to call out across the void. Imagine my surprise when it turns out to be you."
    daw "我很好奇是谁这么大胆敢对着虚空呼唤。没想到居然是你，真让我惊喜。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:744
translate chinese castle3_0e6611a8:

    # "Her gaze shifts to [sel], her expression softening with curiosity."
    "她的目光转向[sel]，眼神中带着好奇柔和下来。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:746
translate chinese castle3_6ff38603:

    # daw "And you must be the [sel] of this universe?"
    daw "而你就是这个宇宙的[sel]吧？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:748
translate chinese castle3_0eb58724:

    # sel "That’s right. It’s nice to meet you [daw]. I admit, I wasn't expecting to see a unicorn I haven't met before."
    sel "没错。很高兴认识你，[daw]。说实话，我没想到会见到一位素未谋面的独角兽。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:750
translate chinese castle3_bc41c15a:

    # daw "Oh, really?"
    daw "哦，是吗？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:751
translate chinese castle3_3632cebf:

    # mc "Hold on. [daw], how did you answer?"
    mc "等等。[daw]，你是怎么回应召唤的？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:753
translate chinese castle3_cc7dfbce:

    # daw "This was my first portal opening, actually! Can you believe it?"
    daw "其实这是我第一次穿越传送门呢！没想到吧？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:755
translate chinese castle3_6212079b:

    # daw "I can’t wait to hear all about this universe. There’s so much to explore, and, well, who better to guide me than you two?"
    daw "我已经等不及要了解这个宇宙的一切了。有这么多值得探索的事物，而且——还有什么比你们两位更适合当我的向导呢？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:756
translate chinese castle3_793f9619:

    # mc "You opened this portal all by yourself? I didn’t think you had the magic for something this... complex."
    mc "你独自打开了这个传送门？我没想到你竟能施展如此……复杂的魔法。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:757
translate chinese castle3_49777c74:

    # "A second figure steps through the portal, her voice chiming with theatrical confidence."
    "第二个身影穿过传送门，她的声音带着戏剧般的自信清脆响起。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:762
translate chinese castle3_60c9ad7b:

    # pmox "And she didn’t!"
    pmox "不是她打开的！"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:763
translate chinese castle3_90cdfe62:

    # "Princess [mox], resplendent as ever, struts into the room with a triumphant smile, her wings swishing behind her."
    "[mox]公主一如既往光彩照人，她昂首阔步走进房间，带着胜利的微笑，翅膀在身后轻快地摆动。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:765
translate chinese castle3_57063e3c:

    # pmox "It was me, Princess [mox]! This was my first portal too, thank you very much."
    pmox "是我，[mox]公主！这也是我第一次开启传送门，多谢关心啦。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:766
translate chinese castle3_14e5aa6c:

    # mc "P-Princess [mox]!"
    mc "[mox]公主！"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:768
translate chinese castle3_7a37a45f:

    # "[sel]’s eyes widen slightly, the edges of her lips twitching with curiosity and surprise."
    "[sel]的眼睛微微睁大，嘴角因好奇与惊讶轻轻抽动。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:769
translate chinese castle3_58ff54f6:

    # sel "Your first too? I’m impressed. Linking two universes isn’t a trivial task."
    sel "你也是第一次？真令人佩服。连接两个宇宙可不是简单的事。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:771
translate chinese castle3_791cbf1b:

    # pmox "Oh, stop it, you’ll make me blush! ...But, yes, it’s true. I’m honored to have opened the way for not just one, but two [sel] to admire my work. And, naturally, two [mc]’s as well!"
    pmox "哎呀别夸了，人家要脸红了！…不过没错，能同时为两位[sel]展示我的杰作是我的荣幸。当然也包括两位[mc]啦！"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:772
translate chinese castle3_79daa18f:

    # mc "Ahaha, don’t let it go to your head, [mox]."
    mc "啊哈哈，可别得意过头啦，[mox]。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:774
translate chinese castle3_28bb2709:

    # pmox "Guilty as charged! Surely I’ve earned a little fanfare for this one."
    pmox "我认罪！但就凭这次壮举，总该值得一点掌声吧？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:775
translate chinese castle3_70fd9a35:

    # "Huh, did her breasts get even bigger? In fact, her {i}everything{/i} seems to be bigger. Is it because she became an alicorn?"
    "她是不是……比以前更丰满了？说实话，{i} 整个人 {/i}好像都大了一圈。这是因为变成了天角兽的缘故吗？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:777
translate chinese castle3_b8db7b33:

    # sel "Credit where it’s due. You’ve done something remarkable here. I really wasn’t expecting to stumble into an alicorn version of [mox]."
    sel "该夸的还是要夸。你确实做到了不起的事。真没想到会遇见天角兽形态的[mox]。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:778
translate chinese castle3_b768b261:

    # "Princess [mox] flashes a smile, basking in the praise."
    "[mox]公主扬起笑容，沉浸在赞美中。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:780
translate chinese castle3_fce67255:

    # pmox "Aren’t you just the sweetest? I think I’m going to like this universe already."
    pmox "你怎么这么会说话呀？我想我已经喜欢上这个宇宙了。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:781
translate chinese castle3_ad080ecf:

    # "Her playful demeanor falters as her eyes narrow slightly, something dawning on her as she examines me."
    "她嬉笑的神情忽然凝滞，微微眯起眼睛打量着我，仿佛突然意识到了什么。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:783
translate chinese castle3_eb9d13c7:

    # pmox "You must be the [mc] of this universe! It’s so great to meet another one!"
    pmox "你一定是这个宇宙的[mc]！能遇见另一个你真是太棒了！"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:784
translate chinese castle3_37ca3653:

    # "She steps forward, arms outstretched, ready to pull me into a warm hug, but suddenly freezes mid-motion."
    "她张开双臂上前一步，正要给我一个温暖的拥抱，却突然僵在原地。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:786
translate chinese castle3_d4d049d2:

    # pmox "T-That scar…"
    pmox "那-那道伤疤…"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:787
translate chinese castle3_7ba6492e:

    # "Her voice trembles as her gaze locks onto the marks on my chest."
    "她的声音微微发颤，目光紧紧锁定在我胸前的疤痕上。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:789
translate chinese castle3_5b94a258:

    # pmox "You can’t be… You’re… my [mc]?"
    pmox "不可能…你难道是…我的[mc]？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:790
translate chinese castle3_77a61967:

    # mc "I, uh… Yeah… Technically, I am."
    mc "我、呃…是的…从某种意义上说，确实是。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:794
translate chinese castle3_29d76f3b:

    # "The room falls into a stunned silence."
    "房间里陷入一片震惊的寂静。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:796
translate chinese castle3_5de353fc:

    # daw "Well, that explains how you know me, but [sel] doesn’t. Interesting twist…"
    daw "原来如此，所以你认识我而[sel]却不认识。真是有趣的巧合……"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:798
translate chinese castle3_cce0bb2f:

    # daw "We’ll have plenty of time to discuss the implications, right? I mean, with this portal open, there’s so much to learn!"
    daw "我们有的是时间慢慢理清这些关系，对吧？既然传送门已经打开，还有太多值得探索的呢！"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:799
translate chinese castle3_fe91221c:

    # "She claps her hands together, attempting to keep the tone light."
    "她双手轻轻一拍，试图让气氛轻松些。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:801
translate chinese castle3_4891e34a:

    # daw "So let’s not get too caught up in the how just yet. Instead, let’s focus on making the most of this incredible opportunity."
    daw "所以先别纠结具体原因啦。不如好好把握这个难得的机会？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:803
translate chinese castle3_748fde84:

    # pmox "You’re okay here, right? I mean… You’re safe? You’re happy?"
    pmox "你在这里过得还好吗？我是说……安全吗？开心吗？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:804
translate chinese castle3_9a01f5ec:

    # mc "Yeah! Don’t worry about me. I even have my own [mox], and you have your own [mc]."
    mc "当然！别担心我。我也有属于自己的[mox]，而你也有你的[mc]。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:805
translate chinese castle3_80886bc5:

    # "Her expression shifts from concern to tentative relief, though she remains tense with lingering questions."
    "她的表情从担忧转为初步的宽慰，但紧绷的身体仍透着未解的疑问。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:807
translate chinese castle3_4c42fcfa:

    # pmox "That’s… good. Really good."
    pmox "那就好…真的太好了。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:808
translate chinese castle3_527397d6:

    # "She exhales deeply, her wings fluttering slightly as she tries to collect herself."
    "她深深呼出一口气，翅膀轻轻颤动，努力让自己平静下来。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:810
translate chinese castle3_bf84efff:

    # sel "It’s a lot to process, I’m sure. But you’re both here now, and this connection opens up new possibilities for all of us."
    sel "我知道这需要时间消化。但既然你们都在这里，这条通道为我们所有人都开启了新的可能。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:812
translate chinese castle3_b1f249e2:

    # sel "I suggest we take this one step at a time."
    sel "我建议我们一步一步来。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:814
translate chinese castle3_e9da5799:

    # daw "Exactly! No need to overthink things just yet. And honestly, I can’t wait to meet this other [mox]."
    daw "没错！现在没必要想得太复杂。说实话，我已经等不及要见见另一位[mox]了。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:816
translate chinese castle3_a200af67:

    # pmox "Yeah… Yeah, you’re right. This portal opening is already shaping up to be a wild ride."
    pmox "是啊…你说得对。这扇传送门的开启已经注定是段疯狂的旅程了。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:817
translate chinese castle3_0e0340f4:

    # mc "You don’t know the half of it."
    mc "你看到的还只是冰山一角呢。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:819
translate chinese castle3_f72cdca3:

    # sel "For now, let’s focus on stabilizing the portal. If we’re going to keep this connection open, we’ll need to make sure it’s secure on both sides."
    sel "现在先集中精力稳定传送门。如果我们想维持这条通道，必须确保两端都稳固。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:821
translate chinese castle3_3d0bc7a0:

    # daw "Sounds like a plan! And while we’re at it, I’d love to hear all about what you’ve been up to, [mc]. I’ve got a feeling this story’s going to be good."
    daw "这主意不错！趁这机会，我很想听听你的经历，[mc]。我有预感这故事会非常精彩。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:823
translate chinese castle3_59022232:

    # "Just as we'd all got acquainted and an inevitably long discussion was about to begin..."
    "就在大家刚刚熟悉起来，一场注定漫长的讨论即将展开时…"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:828
translate chinese castle3_7b3fda61:

    # "[aur] stormed into the room."
    "[aur]猛地冲进了房间。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:829
translate chinese castle3_ca1b4954:

    # aur "[sel]! We have a problem."
    aur "[sel]！出事了。 "

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:831
translate chinese castle3_0481a0c8:

    # aur "Ah – who are…? No, that’s not important now."
    aur "啊—这些是……？不，现在不重要了。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:834
translate chinese castle3_62231d2d:

    # aur "King Umbra has declared war."
    aur "Umbra国王已经宣战了。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:838
translate chinese castle3_799d3f4f:

    # daw "Umbra, huh? That’s a name I haven’t heard in a while…"
    daw "Umbra,这名字倒是好久没听过了…"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:842
translate chinese castle3_9d82edda:

    # pmox "And it's a name I've never heard."
    pmox "这名字我可从没听说过。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:849
translate chinese castle3_43fec9f0:

    # sel "I’m in the dark too. [aur], who is this?"
    sel "我也完全没头绪。[aur]，这人是谁？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:851
translate chinese castle3_f2377353:

    # aur "Umbra is… complicated."
    aur "Umbra这人…说来话长。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:852
translate chinese castle3_c8182d34:

    # aur "Once, he was a military general of Arcadia. Brilliant, ruthless, ambitious. He was also… someone I once trusted deeply."
    aur "他曾是Arcadia的军事将领，才华横溢却冷酷无情，野心勃勃。而且…曾是我极度信任的人。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:853
translate chinese castle3_7cc4f3c4:

    # mc "Deeply? More than a colleague?"
    mc "极度信任？不止是同事关系？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:855
translate chinese castle3_6dcf5846:

    # aur "Yes. For a time."
    aur "曾经是。有过那么一段时光。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:856
translate chinese castle3_2e954194:

    # aur "But it didn’t last. Umbra’s vision for Arcadia was… extreme."
    aur "但没能持续下去。Umbra对Arcadia的规划…太过极端。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:857
translate chinese castle3_14c002cb:

    # aur "He wanted to transform it into a militant dictatorship, to push our influence and power far beyond what I was willing to condone."
    aur "他想把这里变成军事独裁国家，用超越我底线的方式扩张势力与强权。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:858
translate chinese castle3_b768cd1c:

    # aur "We clashed again and again. And when it became clear I wouldn’t yield, he left. Not quietly, either."
    aur "我们爆发了无数次冲突。当他明白我绝不会让步时，便离开了，而且离开得并不平静。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:860
translate chinese castle3_ed20d206:

    # sel "What happened?"
    sel "后来发生了什么？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:861
translate chinese castle3_b59b6032:

    # aur "He took a lot of supporters with him and moved to Ambrose. It’s fortified, militarized, and utterly loyal to him. He’s ruled there ever since."
    aur "他带着大批支持者迁往安布罗斯。那里戒备森严，军事化管理，完全效忠于他。此后他便一直统治着那座城。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:863
translate chinese castle3_4c6498dd:

    # pmox "This guy breaks off, builds his own little kingdom, and now he’s back to pick a fight with you? What’s his angle?"
    pmox "这家伙自立门户搞了个小王国，现在回来找你麻烦？他到底图什么？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:865
translate chinese castle3_a8d5c1a5:

    # "[aur] shakes her head, a hint of frustration seeping through her calm exterior."
    "[aur]摇了摇头，冷静的外表下透出一丝烦躁。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:867
translate chinese castle3_4a99ef89:

    # aur "His ambitions have always been grand, but his true intentions here are a mystery."
    aur "他的野心向来不小，但这次的真实意图还是个谜。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:869
translate chinese castle3_3e342090:

    # aur "He’s made his declaration clear and I know camps are already being set up in our territory."
    aur "他已经公开宣战，而且我知道他的营地已经设在了我们的领土上了。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:874
translate chinese castle3_37edc82c:

    # daw "He must have a reason, even if it’s just to ruffle your feathers."
    daw "他肯定有目的，哪怕只是为了激怒你。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:876
translate chinese castle3_aef70aea:

    # sel "What kind of forces are we talking about? Is this an isolated strike, or is he mobilizing for a full-scale invasion?"
    sel "对方兵力如何？是孤立袭击，还是正在动员全面入侵？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:878
translate chinese castle3_1b8156bf:

    # aur "From what we’ve gathered, his forces are more like a tightly strung spring than an immediate hammer."
    aur "根据情报，他的军队更像绷紧的弹簧，而非即刻落下的重锤。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:880
translate chinese castle3_780cb314:

    # aur "Scouts and spies are moving into Arcadian territory, not full battalions. He’s gathering information, assessing us."
    aur "潜入Arcadia的是侦察兵和间谍，并非完整编队。他在收集情报，评估我们的实力。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:881
translate chinese castle3_7c3e6448:

    # mc "Does he have allies? Anyone else we should be worried about joining his side?"
    mc "他有盟友吗？还有其他需要警惕的势力可能加入他吗？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:883
translate chinese castle3_f18b1931:

    # aur "Not that we know of. But Umbra is… persuasive. Charismatic, in his own way."
    aur "目前没有。但Umbra很…善于蛊惑人心。他有自己独特的魅力。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:885
translate chinese castle3_233eb5c7:

    # aur "If he’s convinced others to back him, they’ve yet to make themselves known. For now, it’s him and his forces in Ambrose. That’s enough of a threat on its own."
    aur "就算他说服了其他支持者，现在也还没显露痕迹。目前只有他和Ambrose的军队，但光是这样就够危险了。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:890
translate chinese castle3_85b0056b:

    # pmox "Sounds like you could use an extra pair of wings. Lucky for you, I’ve got two right here!"
    pmox "听起来你们需要多一对翅膀帮忙？正好我这儿有一对现成的！"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:892
translate chinese castle3_276b90ab:

    # aur "Absolutely not."
    aur "绝对不行。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:894
translate chinese castle3_0664ca95:

    # "[mox] blinks, caught off guard."
    "[mox]眨了眨眼，有些措手不及。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:896
translate chinese castle3_cc550661:

    # pmox "Excuse me?"
    pmox "你说什么？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:898
translate chinese castle3_974ef075:

    # aur "You’re not of this universe, Princess [mox]. Umbra is my responsibility. Arcadia is my kingdom. I can’t have outside forces intervening and risking making this worse."
    aur "你不属于这个宇宙，[mox]公主。Umbra是我的责任，Arcadia是我的王国。我不能让外部势力介入，以免局势恶化。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:900
translate chinese castle3_d4d6f3a5:

    # pmox "‘Outside forces?’ Really? I open a portal, offer my help, and now I’m some kind of liability? You’re not like my [aur] at all."
    pmox "“外部势力？”认真的吗？我打开了传送门主动帮忙，现在倒成了累赘？你跟我认识的[aur]完全不一样。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:902
translate chinese castle3_a5bf4a8e:

    # daw "She’s not saying it to be cruel, [mox]. Queen [aur]’s got a point."
    daw "她不是故意刻薄，[mox]。[aur]女王说得有道理。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:904
translate chinese castle3_c133da0b:

    # daw "We’ve all seen how fragile balance can be between universes. If Umbra catches wind of someone like you stepping in, it might escalate things."
    daw "我们都见识过宇宙之间平衡有多脆弱。如果Umbra发现你这样的存在介入，可能会让事态升级。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:906
translate chinese castle3_e12c382b:

    # pmox "Fine. I’ll sit this one out. But only because I’m so gracious and understanding."
    pmox "好吧。这次我就不插手了。纯粹是因为我既大度又善解人意。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:908
translate chinese castle3_e4c66718:

    # aur "I appreciate it. This isn’t about doubting your abilities. It’s about protecting everyone involved."
    aur "感谢你的理解。这不是质疑你的能力，而是为了保护所有相关的人。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:910
translate chinese castle3_2f0361c9:

    # pmox "Yeah, yeah. Protecting everyone. Got it."
    pmox "是是是，保护所有人。明白啦。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:911
translate chinese castle3_d9908b98:

    # "She perks up slightly, her eyes narrowing with mischief."
    "她稍稍振作起来，眼睛狡黠地眯起。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:913
translate chinese castle3_23d7b3c5:

    # pmox "But I assume [daw] here gets to help? No objections to her sticking around?"
    pmox "不过我猜[daw]可以帮忙吧？你对她留下来没意见？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:917
translate chinese castle3_bfb36dfd:

    # sel "[daw]’s no alicorn, it’s… different. Her presence here doesn’t disrupt the balance the same way yours might."
    sel "[daw]不是天角兽，情况…不一样。她在这里不会像你那样打破平衡。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:919
translate chinese castle3_440b5249:

    # daw "Well, look at that. I’m officially useful. Guess you’re stuck with me, ladies."
    daw "哟，瞧见没？我可是官方认证的有用之人。看来你们甩不掉我啦，女士们。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:921
translate chinese castle3_8e6b0f15:

    # pmox "Lucky you."
    pmox "算你走运。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:923
translate chinese castle3_8cfb33af:

    # pmox "I’ll stay out of your war council. But I’ve got my own reasons to learn more about this universe."
    pmox "你们的作战会议我不参与。但我自有理由要多了解这个宇宙。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:924
translate chinese castle3_2ca79354:

    # "She openly gazes at me, her expression softening."
    "她坦然地注视着我，眼神变得柔和。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:925
translate chinese castle3_c03a70b2:

    # mc "I suppose we're going to have a long chat?"
    mc "看来我们要好好长谈一次了？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:927
translate chinese castle3_aabcfbb2:

    # pmox "Bet on it, love~"
    pmox "当然啦，亲爱的~"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:929
translate chinese castle3_5d518923:

    # daw "You’ll have plenty of time to dig into his secrets later. For now, let’s focus on the bigger picture."
    daw "以后有的是时间挖掘他的秘密。现在先专注处理更紧急的事。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:934
translate chinese castle3_167dec12:

    # aur "Right. Back to the matter at hand. [sel], we’ll need to double patrols along the border and root out any spies. [daw], I’d like to hear any information you may regarding the Umbra of your universe."
    aur "没错。回到正题。[sel]，我们需要在边境加倍巡逻，清除所有间谍。[daw]，我想了解关于你们宇宙Umbra的任何情报。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:936
translate chinese castle3_433d494f:

    # daw "Cheeky! I love it."
    daw "调皮！我喜欢这态度。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:938
translate chinese castle3_d498b1c0:

    # sel "Agreed. We need to get ahead of this before it spirals. Let’s start planning."
    sel "同意。必须在事态恶化前掌控局面。开始制定计划吧。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:940
translate chinese castle3_35c53e85:

    # aur "[mc], I’ll be organising a meeting with the Virtues first thing tomorrow. For now, get some rest. You and [daw] may retire to a guest room if you’d like."
    aur "[mc]，明早第一件事就是召集美德议会。现在先去休息吧。你和[daw]可以去客房休息。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:942
translate chinese castle3_9a21445a:

    # daw "Oooo, the same one~? Hehe."
    daw "哦呀，同一间房呀～？呵呵。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:946
translate chinese castle3_a7f24749:

    # pmox "*{i}Sigh{/i}* Good luck, everyone."
    pmox "*{i} 唉 {/i}*各位都多加小心吧。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:947
translate chinese castle3_137d8127:

    # mc "Goodbye, [mox]. It was great to see you again."
    mc "再见，[mox]。能再见到你真的很高兴。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:949
translate chinese castle3_cc74cb92:

    # pmox "You too, my lost, little [mc]."
    pmox "你也是，我迷途的小[mc]。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:953
translate chinese castle3_46cfaeb2:

    # "I watch as [mox] takes her leave through the portal."
    "我看着[mox]穿过传送门离去。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:955
translate chinese castle3_2c93e33b:

    # "Then [daw] and I go to a guest room."
    "随后我和[daw]走向客房。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:957
translate chinese castle3_a2c981a1:

    # "The guest room is cozy. After everything that just happened, just sitting down and relaxing feels immensely cathartic."
    "客房里很舒适。经历了这么多事后，能坐下来放松片刻让人倍感舒心。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:958
translate chinese castle3_1746a446:

    # "[daw] flops onto the plush bed with dramatic flair, her hair cascading around her as she stretches like a satisfied cat."
    "[daw]戏剧化地扑进蓬松的床铺，长发如瀑布般散开，像只满足的猫咪伸着懒腰。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:961
translate chinese castle3_b49ec021:

    # daw "So, kitten, what’s it been like living in this sandbox of existence? New universe, new rules… I bet you’ve been getting into all kinds of delicious trouble, hmm?"
    daw "所以小猫咪，在这个新世界过得如何？新宇宙新规则…我打赌你肯定惹了不少刺激的麻烦对吧？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:963
translate chinese castle3_5ee360c8:

    # mc "Trouble seems to follow me no matter where I go, doesn’t it? But this place… it’s been different. A lot of highs, and… a lot of lows."
    mc "不管到哪儿麻烦总跟着我，对吧？但这里…不太一样。有过很多巅峰时刻，也…经历过不少低谷。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:965
translate chinese castle3_c22c1e8e:

    # daw "Lows? You? Oh, darling, I don’t believe it. You were always the bright little student, asking just the right questions at just the wrong time."
    daw "低谷？你？亲爱的，我可不信。你向来是那个聪明的好学生，总在最不合时宜的时候问出最犀利的问题。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:966
translate chinese castle3_325d256c:

    # mc "Yeah, well, each universe doesn’t exactly come with a manual. You should know that better than anyone, right, Miss Universe?"
    mc "是啊，可惜每个宇宙都不附赠说明书。你该比谁都清楚这点吧，宇宙小姐？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:968
translate chinese castle3_4f054f25:

    # daw "Touché, Mr. Detective. But seriously, spill. What’s the most exciting thing you’ve done here?"
    daw "反击漂亮，侦探先生。不过说真的，坦白交代，你在这儿做过最刺激的事是什么？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:969
translate chinese castle3_7f3d5485:

    # mc "Exciting? Well, let’s just say this universe has a knack for throwing curveballs. Just one look at the window should tell you that every assumption you might have here is wrong."
    mc "刺激？这么说吧，这个宇宙特别擅长出其不意。光是看窗外就能让你明白，所有既定认知在这里都不适用。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:971
translate chinese castle3_620f385c:

    # daw "Oh?"
    daw "哦？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:975
translate chinese castle3_b9fefc4d:

    # "[daw] takes a peek outside of the window, giving the view a bewildered double take."
    "[daw]朝窗外瞥了一眼，对着眼前的景象困惑地眨了两次眼睛。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:979
translate chinese castle3_8116ecef:

    # daw "This is Arcadia?! It’s like a human city!"
    daw "这是Arcadia？！简直和人类城市一模一样！"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:980
translate chinese castle3_dde548c9:

    # mc "Exactly…"
    mc "没错…"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:982
translate chinese castle3_48b62cef:

    # daw "Does it still have all the familiar faces we know? Your [lil]s, your [rub]s?"
    daw "这里还有我们熟悉的面孔吗？你的那些[lil]和[rub]们还在吗？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:983
translate chinese castle3_95fdac8f:

    # mc "You know it. Took a little bit of work to reunite them and help with their troubles, but it was worth it."
    mc "当然在。费了些功夫才让大家重聚，帮她们解决了些麻烦，但一切都值得。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:985
translate chinese castle3_7dd5bde3:

    # daw "Mmm, sounds like someone’s been keeping busy. And what about the personal kind of excitement? Surely you’ve found some time for a little… extracurricular activity?"
    daw "听起来某人过得挺充实嘛。那感情方面呢？总该抽空搞点…课外活动吧？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:986
translate chinese castle3_dbb40f21:

    # mc "Of course you’d ask that. Let’s just say things have been… interesting on that front too."
    mc "就知道你会问这个。只能说那方面也…挺精彩的。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:988
translate chinese castle3_ce7c4198:

    # daw "Ooooh, I love to hear it darling. You know how I love living vicariously through you."
    daw "噢——我就爱听这个，你知道我最喜欢通过你体验不一样的人生了。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:990
translate chinese castle3_a2a4d31d:

    # daw "To think, there are now two versions of you running around."
    daw "想想看，现在居然有两个版本的你在跑来跑去呢。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:991
translate chinese castle3_cb3969e5:

    # daw "Hell, are there even more of you, scattered across the multiverse like sprinkles on a sundae? Endless little [mc] clones?"
    daw "天呐，该不会还有更多个你像雪王大圣代上的奥利奥一样散落在多元宇宙里吧？数不清的[mc]复制体？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:992
translate chinese castle3_1a9c4a91:

    # daw "Maybe there could be a spin-off sequel where I could build my own [mc] harem."
    daw "说不定还能出个衍生续作，让我组建自己的[mc]后宫呢。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:993
translate chinese castle3_48d3dad6:

    # mc "Honestly? Maybe. [sel] told me that I’ve only been transferred twice, once to the other Arcadia, then once to here."
    mc "说实话？或许吧。[sel]告诉我只被转移过两次，先去了另一个Arcadia，然后才来到这儿。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:994
translate chinese castle3_786462ba:

    # mc "But the more I wonder, the more apparent it is that she was only saying that to reassure me."
    mc "但我越想越觉得，她当时只是为了安慰我才这么说的。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:995
translate chinese castle3_2c208002:

    # mc "The 'me' here, right now, may be locked in place."
    mc "此刻在这里的“我”，或许已经被固定在这个宇宙了。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:996
translate chinese castle3_0e6c0354:

    # mc "But out there? I might just be some cosmic handyman getting passed around."
    mc "但在其他宇宙？我可能只是个被到处传递的宇宙修理工罢了。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:998
translate chinese castle3_0d168f37:

    # daw "Hey, hey, don’t go spiraling on me, duckling. You’re you. Whether there’s one, two, or a thousand versions of you out there, it doesn’t make this you any less real. Got it?"
    daw "嘿，别陷入这种思维漩涡，小鸭子。你就是你。无论外面有一个、两个还是上千个你的版本，此刻真实的你都分毫未减。明白吗？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:999
translate chinese castle3_a2930d0a:

    # mc "I don’t mind getting transferred once. That was for [mox]. To me, that was fate."
    mc "我不介意被转移一次。那次是为了[mox]。对我而言，那是命运的安排。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1000
translate chinese castle3_b00726af:

    # mc "But twice, thrice, even? That’s too much. So, I asked [sel] to tether me to this reality. I don’t have to worry about that anymore."
    mc "但两次、三次甚至更多？那就太过了。所以我请[sel]将我与这个现实牢牢锚定。现在我再也不用担心那种事了。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1001
translate chinese castle3_11b79bbb:

    # mc "If I’m needed in another universe, I’ll let another version of me take up the mantle."
    mc "如果其他宇宙需要帮助，就让另一个版本的我接手吧。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1002
translate chinese castle3_7cf86229:

    # mc "With any luck, there's a cosmic badass version of me out there... Or more likely, just a version of me sitting at a computer reading visual novels. I know they're all doing their best."
    mc "说不定某个宇宙里存在着超级厉害的我……更可能的情况是，某个我正在电脑前读着视觉小说。但我知道每个我都尽力而为了。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1004
translate chinese castle3_7068c034:

    # daw "Look at you! Well, if you ever need witty banter and existential crisis counselling. All of that is included in the [daw] deluxe package."
    daw "瞧你这模样！不过要是需要俏皮话和存在主义危机咨询，[daw]豪华套餐全都包含哦。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1005
translate chinese castle3_b660a954:

    # mc "You really haven’t changed."
    mc "你还真是一点都没变呢。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1007
translate chinese castle3_0e03ae8e:

    # daw "Perish the thought. But seriously, this is wild. You being here… it’s like proof that the multiverse is even messier than I thought."
    daw "想都别想。不过说真的，这太疯狂了。你在这里……简直证明多元宇宙比我想象的还要混乱。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1008
translate chinese castle3_0f562df4:

    # mc "Careful, [daw]. You start asking questions like that, and you’ll be the one spiralling."
    mc "当心点，[daw]。再这样追问下去，该陷入思维漩涡的人就是你了。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1010
translate chinese castle3_6b248eef:

    # daw "Oh, please. I thrive on chaos. This is my fifth universe, remember?"
    daw "得了吧，我可是在混乱中如鱼得水。别忘了这是我经历的第五个宇宙了？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1011
translate chinese castle3_43ef2b77:

    # daw "Besides, it’s not every day I get to hang out with the multiverse’s most charming anomaly."
    daw "况且，能和多元宇宙最迷人的异常现象闲聊的机会可不是天天都有。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1012
translate chinese castle3_8b3b22a7:

    # "We laugh, the weight of the day fading as we slip into the familiar rhythm of banter. Our bond really does transcend universes."
    "我们笑了起来，日常的重压在熟悉的嬉闹节奏中逐渐消散。我们的羁绊确实超越了宇宙的界限。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1014
translate chinese castle3_e97db5ab:

    # daw "So, kitten, catch me up. This war thing [aur] mentioned—how big of a mess are we talking? And what have you been up to here? I mean, aside from charming the locals and teaming up with royalty."
    daw "所以小猫咪，跟我讲讲现状。[aur]刚说的战争——到底有多严重？你在这儿都经历了什么？我是指除了迷倒当地人和跟皇室结盟之外的事。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1015
translate chinese castle3_e569506c:

    # mc "It’s been… eventful, to say the least. I’ve been through battles, political intrigue, you name it."
    mc "至少可以说…经历相当丰富。战斗、政治阴谋，你能想到的我都经历过了。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1016
translate chinese castle3_c3db9855:

    # mc "Not to brag, but I just saved the country. With the virtues, we took down ‘Midnight,’ [sel]’s corrupted form."
    mc "不是吹牛，但我刚拯救了这个国家。我和美德们一起击败了“Midnight”，也就是[sel]黑化后的形态。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1017
translate chinese castle3_0dfef988:

    # mc "And now we’ve got two alicorns and the eight virtues on our side."
    mc "现在我们有两位天角兽和八位美德作为盟友。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1018
translate chinese castle3_05f19ee8:

    # mc "Honestly? King Umbra feels like a victory lap after all that."
    mc "说实话？经历了这些之后，Umbra国王简直像胜利后的余兴节目。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1020
translate chinese castle3_e7164ed7:

    # daw "Confidence looks good on you, kitten, but don’t get cocky. Anyone bold enough to declare war against two alicorns probably has more up his sleeve than you’re expecting."
    daw "自信的样子很适合你，小猫咪，但别太轻敌。敢同时向两位天角兽宣战的人，肯定藏着比你预期更多的底牌。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1021
translate chinese castle3_ca79f498:

    # mc "Fair point. I’ve learned not to underestimate anyone in this universe. But I’ve also learned what we’re capable of."
    mc "说得对。在这个宇宙里我学会了不轻视任何对手。但我也见识过我们的实力。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1022
translate chinese castle3_6fe412b9:

    # mc "And here's something special..."
    mc "而且还有件特别的事……"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1023
translate chinese castle3_941b6440:

    # "I surprise [daw] with a little telekinesis."
    "我悄悄用心灵感应轻轻戳了一下[daw]。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1024
translate chinese castle3_fa91ba73:

    # mc "Now, I have magic too!"
    mc "现在，我也有魔法啦！"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1026
translate chinese castle3_924ff653:

    # daw "Ooohhhh~! I'm so happy for you!"
    daw "哇哦～！真为你高兴！"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1027
translate chinese castle3_91d69caf:

    # mc "Umbra’s got his army, sure, but we’ve got each other."
    mc "Umbra有他的军队，但我们拥有彼此。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1029
translate chinese castle3_755ffb8d:

    # daw "You’ve grown a lot since I last saw you. But promise me you’ll still watch your back. Even the most powerful can fall if they’re caught off guard."
    daw "你比我上次见面的时候成熟多了。但要答应我以后依然要保持警惕。再强大的人如果掉以轻心也可能失败。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1030
translate chinese castle3_4c424a01:

    # mc "I promise. Besides, I’ve got you here now, right? Nothing gets past you."
    mc "我保证。何况现在有你在这儿，对吧？什么都逃不过你的眼睛。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1032
translate chinese castle3_e68010ee:

    # daw "Flattery will get you everywhere, duckling. Now, get some rest. You’re going to need it if this finishing lap turns into a marathon."
    daw "嘴甜的人到哪儿都吃得开，小猫咪。现在先休息吧，如果这场收尾战变成马拉松，你得养足精神才行。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1034
translate chinese castle3_416db30b:

    # "With a shared smile, we settle in for the night, the stress of what’s to come balanced by the comfort of each other’s presence."
    "相视一笑后，我们安顿下来度过夜晚。即将到来的压力被彼此相伴的温暖悄然化解。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1044
translate chinese castle3_49e3db62:

    # "I get into bed, and [daw] snuggles up beside me as we doze off together."
    "我躺上床，[daw]依偎在我身旁，我们一起沉入梦乡。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1047
translate chinese castle3_356b11b2:

    # "I spent the morning relaxing."
    "我悠闲地度过了这个早晨。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1049
translate chinese castle3_12a4d746:

    # "As the sun began to set, the city woke up."
    "随着夕阳西沉，整座城市逐渐苏醒。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1051
translate chinese castle3_0dd8bffd:

    # daw "The virtues are meeting at the castle soon, right? I can't wait to see everyone."
    daw "美德们很快要在城堡集合了对吧？我已经等不及要见大家了。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1052
translate chinese castle3_9dda5003:

    # daw "I'll wait here until you're ready."
    daw "我会在这儿等你准备好。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1059
translate chinese dawn1_874594b9:

    # "The virtues met at a large strategy table in the royal castle, its walls adorned featuring the symbols of both [aur] and [sel]. They sure got those in fast."
    "美德们聚集在皇家城堡的战略长桌旁，墙上迅速挂起了[aur]和[sel]的徽章装饰。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1060
translate chinese dawn1_0d775ab2:

    # "Everyone, [daw] included, took their seats, each looking to piece together Umbra’s actions."
    "包括[daw]在内的所有人纷纷落座，各自试图拼凑出Umbra的行动意图。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1064
translate chinese dawn1_52ef2b55:

    # lil "We still don’t know what Umbra is truly after. He’s not directly attacking, but his presence in the kingdom feels like a storm waiting to break. We need to understand his goals, or we’ll be caught off guard."
    lil "我们仍不清楚Umbra的真正目标。他没有直接进攻，但他在王国的存在就像蓄势待发的风暴。我们必须弄清他的意图，否则会措手不及。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1067
translate chinese dawn1_59dccd0f:

    # rub "I trust we’ve all read up on Umbra's history this morning? Strong, domineering, a brilliant tactician... and a relentless idealist."
    rub "相信各位今早都研读过Umbra的履历了？强大、专制、卓越的战术家……而且是个顽固的理想主义者。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1068
translate chinese dawn1_9a5b6261:

    # rub "The only man in history to successfully win a battle against nightmares."
    rub "他是史上唯一成功战胜梦魇军团的人。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1071
translate chinese dawn1_32f0ddf0:

    # mox "Second man in history~"
    mox "史上第二位～"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1074
translate chinese dawn1_021fc123:

    # rik "Yeah, yeah, we’ve all heard the rumors... I don’t like that he’s just lurking around. I’d rather face him head-on, get this over with."
    rik "是是是，传闻都听过了…我不喜欢他这样暗中窥探。宁可正面交锋彻底解决这事。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1076
translate chinese dawn1_5edb73b3:

    # lil "Showing force now will undermine our ability to be diplomatic. He may have declared war, but we’d rather like to settle this peacefully."
    lil "现在展示武力会破坏我们外交解决的可能。虽然他已宣战，但我们仍希望和平解决。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1081
translate chinese dawn1_54488745:

    # hon "If he’s so strong, why this quiet approach? It’s unsettling."
    hon "既然他这么强大，为什么采取这种悄无声息的方式？真让人不安。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1086
translate chinese dawn1_432e4c2b:

    # bla "You’d have to consider what he’s up against! I know [aur] and [sel] aren’t exactly in fighting condition, but I’ve never felt better!"
    bla "你得考虑他面对的对手！我知道[aur]和[sel]还没完全恢复战力，但我现在状态好极了！"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1088
translate chinese dawn1_4b54ff1e:

    # rik "Exactly! We shouldn’t give him time to prepare! The more dirt he has on us, the harder it’ll be to take him out."
    rik "没错！不能给他准备时间！他掌握的情报越多，我们就越难对付他。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1090
translate chinese dawn1_9242abba:

    # hon "Afraid [aur]’s orders are to avoid provocation. There’s no need for rash decisions when we don’t know his full plan yet."
    hon "但[aur]的命令是避免挑衅。在摸清他的完整计划前，我们不需要贸然行动。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1092
translate chinese dawn1_9e6c7508:

    # rub "What if his goal isn’t to start a fight, but to turn people against [aur]? He could be trying to undermine her authority without spilling blood. It wouldn’t be the first time someone tried that."
    rub "万一他的目标不是开战，而是煽动民众反对[aur]呢？他可能想在不流血的情况下动摇她的权威。这招以前也有人试过。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1097
translate chinese dawn1_ca80df1f:

    # "[but] shifted uneasily in her seat, her eyes avoiding the group’s gaze."
    "[but]在座位上不安地动了动，目光避开了众人的视线。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1102
translate chinese dawn1_e5aee374:

    # lil "Umbra’s always been about power, but he’s also a tactician. Subtlety is just as much his weapon as brute force. We need to understand his motivations—what’s driving him this time."
    lil "Umbra向来追求权力，但他同时也是战略家。精妙算计和野蛮武力都是他的武器。我们必须弄清他的动机——这次究竟是什么在驱动他。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1104
translate chinese dawn1_1ff72226:

    # lil "[daw], I think it’s your time to shine. What do you know?"
    lil "[daw]，该你登场了。你知道些什么？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1109
translate chinese dawn1_43e81a37:

    # daw "Of course. In my universe… {i}our{/i} universe."
    daw "当然。在我的宇宙…{i} 我们 {/i}的宇宙里。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1110
translate chinese dawn1_6c57b2e8:

    # "She looks at me and nods."
    "她看向我点了点头。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1112
translate chinese dawn1_0f58051a:

    # daw "King Umbra met a different fate. In my version of Arcadia…"
    daw "Umbra国王的结局不同。在我那个Arcadia里……"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1114
translate chinese dawn1_dc295921:

    # daw "He was assassinated… in his own castle. Over fifty years ago."
    daw "他在自己的城堡里被暗杀了…发生在五十多年前。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1115
translate chinese dawn1_35c4bc63:

    # "The group falls silent, processing the unexpected revelation."
    "众人陷入沉默，消化着这个出乎意料的真相。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1117
translate chinese dawn1_1f0822c0:

    # but "Wait… what? Umbra is… dead in your world?"
    but "等等…什么？你们世界的Umbra已经…死了？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1122
translate chinese dawn1_42d406a0:

    # rik "Huh… This guy isn’t that tough after all! What happened?"
    rik "呵…看来这家伙也没多厉害嘛！当时发生了什么？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1124
translate chinese dawn1_fa3860e4:

    # daw "The details surrounding his death are… mysterious. No clear culprit. His own guards just discovered him drained of life in his own chamber one day."
    daw "他的死亡细节…很蹊跷。没有明确凶手。某天他的护卫发现他在寝宫里莫名失去了生命体征。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1126
translate chinese dawn1_32cb6289:

    # lil "That’s… crazy. Who could have..? Is this even information we can use?"
    lil "这…太疯狂了。谁可能…？这条情报能用上吗？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1128
translate chinese dawn1_d8987cc0:

    # daw "That’s the million-money question, isn’t it?"
    daw "这正是最值钱的问题，对吧？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1129
translate chinese dawn1_09b4e667:

    # "I glance over at [but]… Does she have any information about this?"
    "我看向[but]…她对此有什么情报吗？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1130
translate chinese dawn1_c760d5ad:

    # "If I recall correctly, the [but] of my universe had dealings with Umbra, but that doesn’t mean it’s a guarantee that this [but] has."
    "如果我没记错，我们宇宙的[but]确实与Umbra有过往来，但不敢保证这个宇宙的[but]也是如此。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1131
translate chinese dawn1_8e306da6:

    # "Although, since Umbra in this world is still alive..."
    "不过，既然这个世界的Umbra还活着……"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1132
translate chinese dawn1_6a8e5318:

    # "The thought is cut short as a strange sensation sweeps across the room."
    "思绪被突然掠过房间的异样感应打断。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1135
translate chinese dawn1_a2b9bab2:

    # "A deep, echoing voice breaks through the silence, resonating within the very walls of the castle. It comes from nowhere and everywhere, like the whisper of a shadow."
    "一道深沉的共鸣声穿透寂静，在城堡的墙壁间回荡。它无迹可寻又无处不在，如同阴影的低语。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1136
translate chinese dawn1_18aa39cd:

    # umb "Virtues of Arcadia, I have been watching you."
    umb "Arcadia的美德们，我一直在注视着你们。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1137
translate chinese dawn1_76b93220:

    # "Everyone stiffens at the sound; a chill runs down their spines."
    "所有人闻声僵住，寒意窜过她们的脊背。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1140
translate chinese dawn1_e7e67d48:

    # rik "What the hell…?"
    rik "搞什么…？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1143
translate chinese dawn1_cce23889:

    # hon "It’s him... Umbra."
    hon "是他…Umbra。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1148
translate chinese dawn1_c7c6d9ed:

    # "A dark presence fills the room, its weight pressing down on every person in the chamber. The temperature drops sharply, and a figure steps from the shadows."
    "黑暗的气息笼罩了整个房间，压得室内每个人喘不过气。气温骤降，一道身影从阴影中迈步而出。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1151
translate chinese dawn1_9be8ddfd:

    # "There, standing at the far end of the table, is Umbra. His presence is suffocating."
    "Umbra就站在长桌的尽头。他的存在令人窒息。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1155
translate chinese dawn1_2556567d:

    # lil "How... did he—?"
    lil "他是怎么…进来的？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1158
translate chinese dawn1_7d388667:

    # daw "That's... him?"
    daw "那就是…他？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1162
translate chinese dawn1_03f54346:

    # umb "Virtues of Arcadia, you have my thanks for saving the country."
    umb "Arcadia的美德们，感谢你们拯救了这个国家。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1163
translate chinese dawn1_ffde73a5:

    # umb "Know that under my rule, you'd still rightfully be considered heroes."
    umb "请记住，在我的统治下，你们依然会是被敬仰的英雄。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1165
translate chinese dawn1_d567d196:

    # umb "And yet, I must drag you into this war regardless. But know that I'm not here to fight. Not yet. Now is the time for words."
    umb "但我仍不得不将你们卷入这场战争。不过请明白，此刻我不是来交战的，时机未到。现在是谈话的时候。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1168
translate chinese dawn1_4dc7606b:

    # lil "... You have a lot of explaining to do."
    lil "…你有很多事需要解释。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1170
translate chinese dawn1_7b0140f0:

    # umb "Indeed I do, but not here. I'd like for us to meet in neutral territory. Cadia Falls marks an equal distance between our kingdoms."
    umb "确实如此，但不是在这里谈判。希望我们在中立地带会面。卡迪亚瀑布恰好位于两国等距的中点。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1171
translate chinese dawn1_6cd802ba:

    # umb "There, I hope to engage in a battle of words."
    umb "我期待在那里展开一场言语的交锋。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1174
translate chinese dawn1_a0f4a7a6:

    # rik "This reeks of a trap. What’s stopping you from ambushing us there?"
    rik "这明显是个陷阱。你怎么保证不会在那里伏击我们？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1176
translate chinese dawn1_e7ed6997:

    # umb "Do not let fear guide your steps. I offer this challenge with honor. No blood need be spilled for the entire duration of this war... if you truly stand by your beliefs."
    umb "别让恐惧支配你的行动。我以荣誉发起这场挑战。如果你们真坚守信念，这场战争完全可以不流一滴血…"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1181
translate chinese dawn1_5e9aef13:

    # hon "And if we refuse?"
    hon "如果我们拒绝呢？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1183
translate chinese dawn1_34fd7f13:

    # umb "Then your silence will speak for you. I will not be idle forever."
    umb "那你们的沉默便是答案。我不会永远等待。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1188
translate chinese dawn1_e4ddd604:

    # mox "You’re being deliberately vague..."
    mox "你在故意含糊其辞…"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1190
translate chinese dawn1_ab8cbb29:

    # umb "I must keep my intentions to myself for now. I give you one week. Face me, or prove your ideals are but fragile words."
    umb "目前我必须保留我的意图。给你们一周时间。来面对我，或者证明你们的理想不过是空洞的言辞。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1192
translate chinese dawn1_872fba15:

    # lil "You think you know us? What game are you playing?"
    lil "你以为你了解我们？你到底在玩什么把戏？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1193
translate chinese dawn1_b23054a9:

    # "Umbra's lips barely shift into a thin, unreadable smile."
    "Umbra的嘴唇几乎难以察觉地弯成一道难以捉摸的淡笑。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1195
translate chinese dawn1_9ad9e6e3:

    # umb "You are wise to be cautious. But I do not play games, [lil]."
    umb "你的谨慎很明智。但我从不玩弄把戏，[lil]。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1203
translate chinese dawn1_c3ef9bb7:

    # "The door bursts open. Queen [aur] strides into the chamber, with an expression sharp as steel."
    "门猛地被推开。[aur]女王大步走进议事厅，面容冷峻如钢。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1204
translate chinese dawn1_a641c20a:

    # aur "Umbra."
    aur "Umbra。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1209
translate chinese dawn1_f0befa18:

    # "All eyes shift between the two, the tension rippling."
    "所有目光在两人之间游移，紧绷的暗流在空气中震颤。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1211
translate chinese dawn1_05f6f1b7:

    # umb "[aur]. Time has not dulled your beauty."
    umb "[aur]。岁月未曾减损你的容颜。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1212
translate chinese dawn1_9663222f:

    # "She doesn’t flinch, but the memories are clear."
    "她并未退缩，但往事的轮廓清晰可见。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1214
translate chinese dawn1_c0101fef:

    # aur "Nor yours for threats veiled in riddles."
    aur "你谜语藏刃的威胁也丝毫未变。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1216
translate chinese dawn1_4246170f:

    # umb "Threats? No, [aur]. I simply seek truth. Do they stand with you out of loyalty… or blindness?"
    umb "威胁？不，[aur]。我只是寻求真相。她们追随你究竟是出于忠诚…还是盲目？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1218
translate chinese dawn1_c2868ef2:

    # aur "They stand with me because they choose to. Because they believe in the values we once both held, before you lost your way. Umbra. What changed?"
    aur "她们站在我这边是出于自主选择。因为她们信仰我们曾共同秉持的价值观，在你迷失之前。Umbra，是什么改变了你？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1220
translate chinese dawn1_1e49fb0b:

    # umb "I still fight for justice, but blind justice breeds chaos. You’d shield those who should answer for their crimes, and that is a dangerous path."
    umb "我仍在为正义而战，但盲目的正义只会滋生混乱。你庇护本应伏罪的恶徒，这才是危险的道路。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1222
translate chinese dawn1_3f97fb09:

    # aur "You were once guided by conviction, Umbra, not obsession. You believed in something greater than yourself. I remember the fire in you, the way you stood for the helpless when we fought side-by-side."
    aur "你曾受信念指引而非执念，Umbra。你的信仰高于自我的理想。我记得你眼中的火焰，记得我们并肩作战时你守护弱者的姿态。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1224
translate chinese dawn1_84c36f4b:

    # umb "I remember believing we could change the world, [aur]. But idealism alone cannot protect the weak. I learned that hard truth while you clung to comforting lies."
    umb "我记得曾相信我们能改变世界，[aur]。但空想保护不了弱者。当我认清这个残酷现实时，你却仍沉溺于温柔的谎言。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1226
translate chinese dawn1_00c91582:

    # aur "No. You abandoned truth. You let pain and ambition twist you. Somewhere along the way, you stopped protecting people and started controlling them."
    aur "不。是你背弃了真相。让痛苦与野心扭曲了自己。不知从何时起，你不再保护人民，转而开始控制他们。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1228
translate chinese dawn1_5f4b8a48:

    # umb "Control? No. I offer order. I have not lost my conviction, [aur]. Only my delusions."
    umb "控制？不，我带来秩序。我从未失去信念，[aur]。只是摆脱了妄想。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1230
translate chinese dawn1_ea2e974f:

    # aur "And yet, you declare war not as a protector, but as a tyrant. Your vision of order sacrifices compassion for dominance."
    aur "可你宣战的模样不是保护者，而是暴君。你所谓的秩序是用仁慈换取统治。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1232
translate chinese dawn1_45e060f5:

    # umb "You misunderstand me. This challenge is not for power. It is to test the strength of your ideals. Are they truly unbreakable? Or are they as fragile as you fear?"
    umb "你误解了。这场挑战不为权力，只为检验你们理想的韧性。它们当真坚不可摧？还是如你所惧般脆弱？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1233
translate chinese dawn1_13bcd187:

    # "She searches his face for honesty, but there is only the same cold resolve."
    "她审视着他的面容寻找真诚，却只看到冰冷的决意。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1235
translate chinese dawn1_5bee537c:

    # aur "This ‘test’ is nothing but a display of force. You hope to break us, not enlighten us."
    aur "这场“检验”只是武力的炫耀。你想击溃我们，而非启迪我们。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1237
translate chinese dawn1_b6bc0eb2:

    # umb "Do you still believe in childish absolutes? I have seen the world’s darkness more clearly than you, [aur]. There are no simple heroes and villains. There is only strength and weakness."
    umb "你仍相信幼稚的绝对论吗？我比你看清了更深的黑暗，[aur]。世上没有简单的英雄与恶棍，只有强弱之分。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1239
translate chinese dawn1_9536d80c:

    # aur "No, Umbra. Strength without compassion corrupts."
    aur "不，Umbra。失去怜悯的力量只会堕落。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1240
translate chinese dawn1_fd9f6bc4:

    # aur "Don’t do this…"
    aur "别这样…"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1242
translate chinese dawn1_18f98583:

    # "Umbra’s expression hardens, his lips pressing into a thin line, but he says nothing."
    "Umbra的表情凝固了，双唇抿成一道冷硬的直线，却沉默不语。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1244
translate chinese dawn1_6b99621b:

    # umb "You refuse to see the truth. Very well. One week from today. Cadia Falls."
    umb "你拒绝看清真相。很好。一周后的今天，卡迪亚瀑布见。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1247
translate chinese dawn1_7542b0bd:

    # "Umbra's form begins to dissolve, the shadows retracting, but his voice remains cold and piercing."
    "Umbra的身影开始消散，暗影逐渐退去，但他的声音依然冰冷刺骨。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1248
translate chinese dawn1_2b0a01b6:

    # umb "Let us see if your ideals can withstand the weight of the world."
    umb "让我们看看你的理想能否承受世界的重量。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1250
translate chinese dawn1_b845baf4:

    # aur "This war is madness, Umbra! What of the consequences? What of the people who will suffer while you play this game?"
    aur "这场战争太疯狂了，Umbra！后果呢？你玩弄这场游戏时受苦的人民怎么办？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1251
translate chinese dawn1_51bd9ba9:

    # "The presence vanishes entirely, leaving only silence, and the challenge he left behind."
    "那道存在彻底消失，只余寂静与他留下的挑战。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1256
translate chinese dawn1_64be8ba9:

    # "[aur] casts a spell and the walls glisten with a protective barrier, shutting out outside interference. She turns to us with a sigh."
    "[aur]施放咒语，墙壁泛起防护屏障的微光隔绝外界干扰。她转身对我们轻叹一声。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1257
translate chinese dawn1_102a92dd:

    # aur "I know what some of you may be thinking, but Umbra is more dangerous than you think...."
    aur "我知道你们中有人可能心存疑虑，但Umbra比你们想象的更危险…"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1260
translate chinese dawn1_94454bfe:

    # lil "But we beat Midnight! If we could take an alicorn down, surely..."
    lil "可我们击败了Midnight！既然能战胜天角兽，肯定……"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1262
translate chinese dawn1_7c8240fe:

    # aur "Midnight was a formidable opponent, yes. But she was driven by raw power and instinct. Her strength was her only weapon, the raw magic of an Alicorn’s power made flesh."
    aur "Midnight确实是个难缠的对手。但她只依靠原始力量与本能作战，纯粹的天角兽魔力是她的唯一武器。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1264
translate chinese dawn1_7806fa8d:

    # aur "Umbra, however... he is far more than just powerful. He is a master tactician, both magically and strategically. He exploits weakness and waits for moments of doubt."
    aur "但Umbra…远不止力量强大。他是魔法与战略的双重大师，擅长利用弱点并伺机而动。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1265
translate chinese dawn1_d2832157:

    # aur "He’ll never leave himself vulnerable for a straightforward attack like Midnight. He studies his enemies, he plans, and he counters with precision. If you miss your window against him, you won’t get another."
    aur "他绝不会像Midnight那样露出破绽让人直接攻击。他会研究敌人、制定计划、精准反击。如果错过对付他的时机，就再无胜算。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1266
translate chinese dawn1_0bd7f8bb:

    # "She pauses, allowing her words to sink in, but the tension in the room only deepens."
    "她停顿片刻让话语沉淀，但房间里的紧张气氛反而加剧了。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1269
translate chinese dawn1_e1206354:

    # hon "So... what, you’re saying we can’t win? That he’s just... too much for us?"
    hon "所以…你的意思是我们赢不了？他实在…太强了？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1272
translate chinese dawn1_75467ed6:

    # aur "No, [hon]. I’m saying the battle will not be won by strength alone. Yes, you are powerful. Each of you is extraordinary, but Umbra’s power isn’t just physical. His mind and experiences are advantages we cannot ignore."
    aur "不，[hon]。我是说这场战斗无法单靠力量取胜。你们确实强大，每个人都非凡卓越，但Umbra的优势不只在武力。他的谋略与经验是我们不能忽视的。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1273
translate chinese dawn1_0ae8d63e:

    # "She pauses, searching for the right words."
    "她停顿片刻，斟酌着用词。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1275
translate chinese dawn1_b4102c3c:

    # aur "If you rely only on overwhelming him with magic, you will fail. He’ll see it coming and break through your formations. If you cannot strike as one, if you hesitate, or act alone, he will dismantle you piece by piece."
    aur "如果你们只想用魔法压制他，必败无疑。他会预判你们的行动并瓦解阵型。如果无法协同出击、稍有犹豫或各自为战，他就会逐个击破。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1280
translate chinese dawn1_1a06ae56:

    # mox "But what if we don’t miss? We got Midnight."
    mox "但要是我们没失手呢？我们可是击败过Midnight。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1282
translate chinese dawn1_9d6c25bc:

    # aur "You had no choice but to rely on a single, desperate attack against Midnight. But against Umbra, we cannot afford to gamble on luck alone."
    aur "对抗Midnight时你们只能背水一战。但对Umbra，我们不能只赌运气。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1287
translate chinese dawn1_46abbada:

    # lil "Yeah... we needed two shots for Midnight, and she was already making attempts to separate us and obfuscate her positioning against us... It’s not reliable."
    lil "是啊…对付Midnight都需要两次机会，而且她当时还在试图分化我们，干扰我们的定位…这方法确实不稳妥。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1289
translate chinese dawn1_51650c1c:

    # aur "Indeed. Against Umbra, reckless gambles won’t succeed. You need coordination, strategy... and control. Strength can only carry you so far without focus."
    aur "确实。对付Umbra，鲁莽的赌博行不通。你们需要配合、策略…以及掌控力。缺乏专注的力量终究有限。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1290
translate chinese dawn1_e1e47f3d:

    # aur "Even his appearance here was deliberate and calculated. When dealing with him, I'd highly recommend spinning the chessboard around and questioning his every move. Who knows what pieces he may be targeting."
    aur "就连他此刻的出现都是精心算计的结果。对付他时，我强烈建议彻底扭转棋局，质疑他的每一步行动。天知道他真正瞄准的是哪颗棋子。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1295
translate chinese dawn1_474bc50f:

    # rub "Hmm... Sounds like he's after us, in that case."
    rub "唔…这么说他的目标是我们了。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1297
translate chinese dawn1_526cdcd7:

    # aur "Precisely... His decision to hide his motives? Yet another part of his plan. His decision to tell you that his motives are hidden? Yes, when dealing with Umbra, there often are that many layers."
    aur "完全正确…他隐藏动机的选择？仍是计划的一环。他特意告知你们自己隐藏了动机？没错，对付Umbra时，局势往往嵌套着这么多层算计。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1299
translate chinese dawn1_be8feb36:

    # lil "Hmph... He also clearly emphasized that we were heroes. When we're alone, away from your influence, he'll try to sway us to his side."
    lil "哼…他还特意强调我们是英雄。等我们独处时，他肯定会试图拉拢我们背叛你。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1304
translate chinese dawn1_2fb48e25:

    # bla "He'll have to try harder than that! We worked super hard to save this place!"
    bla "那他可得加把劲了！我们拼了命才拯救这里！"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1306
translate chinese dawn1_bbb35189:

    # aur "If that’s truly his intention, he’ll need to put in considerable effort to convince you. It’s the perfect chance to gather intelligence—and yes, perhaps even defeat him."
    aur "如果这是他的真实意图，那需要下很大功夫才能说服你们。这正是收集情报的绝佳机会——甚至可能借此击败他。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1311
translate chinese dawn1_b4f7aab8:

    # daw "Wouldn’t that risk turning him into a martyr?"
    daw "但这会不会让他变成殉道者？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1315
translate chinese dawn1_d417e436:

    # aur "Let my sister and I manage the aftermath. As rulers celebrated as the saviors of our nation, we’re in a unique position to shape public perception. We’ll ensure his legacy doesn’t gain... undue sympathy."
    aur "后续事宜交给我和妹妹处理。作为国家公认的拯救者，我们拥有引导舆论的独特优势。会确保他的名声不会获得…不应得的同情。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1317
translate chinese dawn1_e24ae15d:

    # daw "Sheesh... This world is bleaker than I expected..."
    daw "天呐…这世界比我想象的更残酷…"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1318
translate chinese dawn1_98f699a8:

    # "[aur]'s dictatorial side is showing, and yet... he's the one that declared war. Hard to say that such a reaction isn't earned."
    "[aur]显露出专制的一面，但…毕竟是他先宣战的。很难说这种反应不合情理。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1320
translate chinese dawn1_953ff5a0:

    # aur "His deadline of a week will work against him. It'll give us time to unify our efforts. Sharpen your skills and prepare."
    aur "他给出的一周期限反而对我们有利。这让我们有时间整合力量。精进技艺，做好准备吧。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1321
translate chinese dawn1_8c33e1b9:

    # "There’s a murmur of agreement around the table."
    "桌前响起一片附和的低语。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1326
translate chinese dawn1_bc995dd8:

    # but "We need to make every second count."
    but "我们必须分秒必争。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1331
translate chinese dawn1_8cc55067:

    # mox "Yeah. No more relying on luck. We train, we plan... and when the time comes, we'll fight smart too."
    mox "没错。不能再依赖运气了。我们要训练、制定计划…等到时机来临，更要智取。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1333
translate chinese dawn1_95492e61:

    # aur "However, you won't be doing it here. I want you somewhere far away from the prying eyes of spies and informants. If knowledge is power, the best thing we can do now is blind them."
    aur "但你们不能在这里训练。我要你们去远离间谍眼线的地方。如果知识就是力量，现在最好的对策就是蒙蔽他们的视线。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1334
translate chinese dawn1_2af65636:

    # aur "I’ve already made the necessary arrangements with the Queen of the Crystal Kingdom last night."
    aur "我昨晚已经与水晶王国的女王做好必要安排。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1335
translate chinese dawn1_e6c8dda5:

    # "Queen of the Crystal Kingdom? The Queen of Love, That must be..."
    "水晶王国的女王？那位爱之女王，难道是……"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1352
translate chinese dawn1_42d5e268:

    # aur "I want you to travel to the Crystal Kingdom. It stands as neutral ground and happens to be located near Cadia Falls."
    aur "我要你们前往水晶王国。那里是中立地带，而且正好靠近卡迪亚瀑布。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1353
translate chinese dawn1_4294f3ce:

    # aur "Queen [aug], while sympathetic to Arcadia’s cause, cannot openly support us without risk. Her kingdom sits on the brink of Umbra’s reach, and direct involvement could jeopardize her people."
    aur "[aug]女王虽然同情Arcadia的处境，但公开支持我们会让她身处险境。她的王国位于Umbra势力范围的边缘，直接卷入可能危及她的人民。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1355
translate chinese dawn1_641624db:

    # aur "However, she has assured me that she will not obstruct your access to the kingdom’s resources. You will be granted temporary refuge and use of the training grounds."
    aur "但她向我保证不会阻挠你们使用王国资源。你们将获得临时庇护权并使用训练场。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1360
translate chinese dawn1_a9d35898:

    # rik "But isn’t that a bit risky? If Umbra catches wind of us, aren’t we even more exposed there?"
    rik "但这会不会太冒险了？如果Umbra发现我们，在那里不是更容易暴露吗？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1362
translate chinese dawn1_a1c6b7b6:

    # aur "Umbra values calculated moves over rash action. Moreover, your journey will be discreet, he should remain unaware of your presence."
    aur "Umbra更倾向谨慎行动而非鲁莽出击。何况你们的行程会保持隐蔽，他应该察觉不到你们的存在。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1363
translate chinese dawn1_4b1423d1:

    # aur "Beyond security, the Crystal Kingdom’s wealth of knowledge and faculties make it an ideal place for you to refine your abilities."
    aur "除了安全因素，水晶王国丰富的知识资源和设施也是你们提升实力的理想场所。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1368
translate chinese dawn1_d810a01f:

    # lil "And what exactly will our focus be once we arrive? Are there specific tasks you need us to accomplish, Your Majesty?"
    lil "我们抵达后的具体任务是什么？陛下有特别需要我们完成的事吗？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1370
translate chinese dawn1_531b1bbb:

    # aur "You will focus on cultivating your individual strengths. Each of you possesses a unique skill set, and I need you to perfect it."
    aur "你们要专注于发展个人特长。每人都有独特的能力，我需要你们将其磨练至臻。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1371
translate chinese dawn1_7f1b7f84:

    # aur "Currently, you're still amateurs with your new powers, relying on combining them as a crutch."
    aur "目前你们运用新能力时仍像业余者，总依赖合力作战作为捷径。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1372
translate chinese dawn1_a34a6634:

    # aur "Your goal should be to reach a point where you can achieve that power without sacrifice or risk. Only then may you be capable of standing against Umbra's cunning."
    aur "你们的目标是做到不靠牺牲或冒险也能发挥那种力量。唯有到那时，才可能抗衡Umbra的诡计。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1374
translate chinese dawn1_7803d2d8:

    # aur "So, hone your abilities, expand your magic, train your minds as well as your bodies. I want you to become the best versions of yourselves."
    aur "所以，精进你们的能力，拓展魔法修为，同时训练心智与体魄。我要你们成为最强的自己。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1376
translate chinese dawn1_fcd07cc1:

    # lil "And Queen [aug] is really okay with us using her resources like this?"
    lil "[aug]女王真的同意我们这样使用她的资源吗？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1378
translate chinese dawn1_2ab898f8:

    # aur "She understands the stakes. This struggle affects the entire country. Though she cannot openly align with us yet, she’s an ally."
    aur "她明白利害关系。这场斗争关乎整个国家。虽然还不能公开支持我们，但她是盟友。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1383
translate chinese dawn1_faa1ca03:

    # daw "What about you, [aur]? What will you do?"
    daw "那你呢，[aur]？你有什么计划？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1385
translate chinese dawn1_7a92ce0c:

    # aur "I’ll stay here with [sel] and we’ll continue our own preparations, but the truth is... I’m not as strong as I once was."
    aur "我会和[sel]留在这里继续做准备，但说实话…我的力量已不如从前。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1386
translate chinese dawn1_4f970d28:

    # aur "I will support you in every way I can. But this battle will be yours, as much as it is mine."
    aur "我会竭尽所能支持你们。但这场战斗属于你们，也属于我。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1391
translate chinese dawn1_478307fd:

    # mox "Alright, then! Let’s get this training arc underway."
    mox "好吧！那就开始特训篇章吧。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1396
translate chinese dawn1_c346102b:

    # bla "He may be a so-called 'genius,' but we’ve got a few in our group too!"
    bla "他或许是个所谓的天才，但我们队伍里也有几个天才！"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1401
translate chinese dawn1_28762e38:

    # lil "Right. If anyone can take down Umbra, it'll be us."
    lil "没错。要说谁能击败Umbra，那一定是我们。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1407
translate chinese dawn1_ab9fada2:

    # "The road ahead stretches out, the landscape of Arcadia shifting as we travel toward the Crystal Kingdom."
    "前方的道路不断延伸，随着我们驶向水晶王国，Arcadia的景色逐渐变化。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1408
translate chinese dawn1_6ce54443:

    # "The car hums quietly, the rhythm of the tires on the road almost soothing. I admit, it's still rather strange to me that this universe has cars, but I can't forget that this universe is supposed to closely resembles my original's."
    "车厢安静地嗡鸣着，轮胎压过路面的节奏几乎令人放松。我得承认，这个宇宙有汽车对我来说依然很新奇，但别忘了这里本应与我原来的世界高度相似。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1415
translate chinese dawn1_0886cee5:

    # "I’m wedged between [daw] and [mox]. There’s no shortage of energy on this road trip."
    "我夹在[daw]和[mox]中间。这趟旅途绝不会无聊。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1418
translate chinese dawn1_d3f6911f:

    # daw "Umbra’s an expert at stringing people along, isn’t he? So many words, so little clarity."
    daw "Umbra很擅长吊人胃口对吧？说了那么多，却没几句明白话。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1419
translate chinese dawn1_97ea8cf7:

    # mc "No kidding. If he’s being vague on purpose, there must be something we’re missing that works to his advantage."
    mc "没错。如果他故意含糊其辞，那肯定有什么对他有利的信息被我们忽略了。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1421
translate chinese dawn1_b9a2923b:

    # mox "He didn’t strike me as the lying type, though. The way [aur] spoke about him..."
    mox "但他不像会说谎的人。[aur]谈论他的方式……"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1422
translate chinese dawn1_fc64e10b:

    # mc "Agreed. I don’t think this is just about taking over or flexing power."
    mc "同意。我觉得这不只是夺权或炫耀力量那么简单。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1424
translate chinese dawn1_3750970f:

    # daw "Mmm, so you suspect there’s a hidden motive behind his challenge? A ‘battle of ideals’ masking something else?"
    daw "嗯，所以你怀疑他的挑战背后有隐藏动机？用“理想之争”掩盖别的目的？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1425
translate chinese dawn1_3ce3c65f:

    # mc "I can’t shake this feeling that we’re not seeing the full picture. He's keeping everything under wraps, based on what I've heard, that sounds like that’s textbook Umbra, I guess."
    mc "我总觉得我们没看清全局。根据我听到的，他隐瞒一切的做法倒很符合Umbra的风格。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1427
translate chinese dawn1_8da8ee4f:

    # "[daw] chuckles softly, glancing at me with a knowing look."
    "[daw]轻声笑起来，用了然的眼神瞥了我一眼。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1428
translate chinese dawn1_2176e9e3:

    # daw "You’ve always been the sort to sense a hidden layer. The moment something’s off, you get those detective instincts."
    daw "你向来擅长察觉隐藏的线索。一旦有不对劲，你的侦探直觉就冒出来了。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1430
translate chinese dawn1_ef8c8418:

    # mox "And, in my experience, he’s right most of the time. Trouble is, we haven’t got all the puzzle pieces yet."
    mox "而且根据我的经验，他的直觉大多是对的。问题是我们还没掌握所有线索。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1431
translate chinese dawn1_710a2368:

    # mc "Just when I think we're about to settle into a long, pleasant peace... Another villain shows up. How infuriating."
    mc "每次以为终于能享受长久的和平时…总有反派冒出来。真让人火大。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1433
translate chinese dawn1_e27c7a2d:

    # "[daw] lifts a shoulder in a half-shrug, gazing out at the passing countryside."
    "[daw]微微耸肩，望向窗外掠过的乡间景色。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1434
translate chinese dawn1_74bdaff1:

    # daw "It’s the nature of this world, isn’t it? Constant motion. One second it all makes sense, then {i}bam{/i}, the rug’s pulled out from under you."
    daw "这就是世界的本质对吧？永远动荡不安。前一秒还一切正常，后一秒{i} 砰 {/i}地就被颠覆了。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1436
translate chinese dawn1_f38a09b0:

    # mox "Sometimes I wonder if we’re stuck focusing too hard on what’s right in front of us. Maybe we’re missing the bigger picture."
    mox "有时我觉得我们是否过于专注眼前的事物，反而忽略了更大的格局。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1437
translate chinese dawn1_8b975684:

    # mc "How do you mean?"
    mc "怎么说？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1439
translate chinese dawn1_2f625178:

    # "[mox] drums her fingers against her thigh, her brow slightly furrowed."
    "[mox]用手指轻敲大腿，眉头微蹙。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1440
translate chinese dawn1_831faf45:

    # mox "Think about it: the country’s celebrating us for defeating Midnight. Umbra’s timing for an invasion is terrible politically. So why now?"
    mox "想想看：全国正在庆祝我们击败Midnight。Umbra选在这种政治时机入侵太不合常理。他为什么偏要现在行动？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1442
translate chinese dawn1_0bb876c6:

    # daw "Good point. Usually, a move like that would come after everything’s cooled off, not right when morale is highest. Makes me think something urgent spurred him on."
    daw "有道理。通常这种行动会等风波平息后展开，而不是在士气最高昂时出手。看来有紧急事态刺激了他。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1443
translate chinese dawn1_df7b2f04:

    # mc "So, something that pushed Umbra to seize this moment... Looks like there’s a key piece of information we’re missing."
    mc "所以有某种原因迫使Umbra抓住这个时机…看来我们漏掉了关键情报。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1445
translate chinese dawn1_1b5949fc:

    # "[mox]'s eyes narrow thoughtfully."
    "[mox]若有所思地眯起眼睛。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1446
translate chinese dawn1_6b3c23f2:

    # mox "Sure feels personal, doesn’t it? I mean, why now? What changed between the fall of Midnight and this sudden declaration of war?"
    mox "确实像私人恩怨对吧？为什么是现在？从Midnight覆灭到突然宣战之间发生了什么？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1447
translate chinese dawn1_86657d3d:

    # mc "Or simpler still—why did beating Midnight push him over the edge?"
    mc "或者更简单点——为什么击败Midnight会刺激到他？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1449
translate chinese dawn1_78a227c2:

    # "[daw]'s voice grows quieter, a note of intrigue slipping in."
    "[daw]的嗓音低沉下来，带着一丝探究的意味。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1450
translate chinese dawn1_889b441d:

    # daw "He might’ve kept his cards close, but he did let something slip..."
    daw "他或许藏得很深，但确实说漏了一点……"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1451
translate chinese dawn1_516f2184:

    # daw "Even he seemed a little flustered when [aur] showed up, and he said {i}'you’d shield those who should answer for their crimes,’{/i} that’s a big accusation."
    daw "就连[aur]出现时他似乎也有些慌乱，而且他说{i} “你庇护本应伏罪的恶徒” {/i}这可是严重的指控。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1453
translate chinese dawn1_476564d2:

    # daw "If he truly believes it, or if he’s using it as fuel for his takeover, either way it’s a huge clue."
    daw "无论他真心这么认为，还是借此作为夺权的借口，这都是条重大线索。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1454
translate chinese dawn1_e1552247:

    # "I shake my head, trying to make sense of it."
    "我摇摇头，试图理清头绪。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1455
translate chinese dawn1_bec33f07:

    # mc "Is there a history we don’t know about?"
    mc "有什么我们不知道的往事吗？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1457
translate chinese dawn1_9f20eb37:

    # mox "Could even be about [mor], no? In fact, I dare say he's smart enough to pretend to let something like that slip."
    mox "甚至可能和[mor]有关，对吧？说实话，我敢说他聪明到会故意假装说漏嘴。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1458
translate chinese dawn1_f85c1f45:

    # mox "Whether his convictions are real or underhanded. He's sowing the seeds of doubt regarding [aur]'s claim to the throne."
    mox "无论他的信念是真诚还是诡计，他都在散播对[aur]王权合法性的质疑。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1459
translate chinese dawn1_8fe1dd51:

    # mox "After all, it'd be awfully convenient if he could claim it without bloodshed. All he'd have to do is convince everyone that she's not worthy."
    mox "毕竟，如果能兵不血刃夺取王位再方便不过。他只需让所有人相信她不配为王。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1460
translate chinese dawn1_ae67ec79:

    # mox "While [lil] and the other intellectuals in the group may be invested in his motives. Perhaps it's also best to just take what he says with a grain of salt, lest you get spun in his web."
    mox "虽然[lil]和其他知识分子可能执着于分析他的动机。但或许最好对他的话保持怀疑，以免陷入他的圈套。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1462
translate chinese dawn1_3fe8a826:

    # daw "Hehe, you're as wise as ever..."
    daw "呵呵，你还是这么聪明……"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1464
translate chinese dawn1_6ea02284:

    # mox "(Wise as ever...?)"
    mox "（还是这么聪明…？）"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1465
translate chinese dawn1_6257b411:

    # "A silence settles in for a moment as the car speeds onward, mountains looming ever closer. The stakes are climbing, and we can all feel it in the air."
    "车厢陷入短暂的寂静，汽车向前疾驰，山峦越来越近。风险正在攀升，我们都能感受到空气中的紧张。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1466
translate chinese dawn1_8ebf335f:

    # "Eventually, [mox] clears her throat."
    "最终，[mox]轻咳一声打破了沉默。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1468
translate chinese dawn1_99be8058:

    # mox "So, [daw]..."
    mox "所以，[daw]…"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1470
translate chinese dawn1_dfc2f7a4:

    # mox "We’ve haven't had a chance to talk, y’know, just the two of us. You’re from the other Arcadia too, right?"
    mox "我们还没机会好好聊聊呢，就咱俩。你也是从另一个Arcadia来的对吧？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1472
translate chinese dawn1_1ff2f5dd:

    # daw "In truth, I’ve been meaning to corner you for a while, you scrumptious, starlit showpony."
    daw "说实话，我早就想找你单独聊聊了，你这颗诱人的星光表演家。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1474
translate chinese dawn1_e9a55f3b:

    # mox "H-Hey! Tone it down or you’ll make me blush. We’ll be in this car for hours yet, and I’ve got questions."
    mox "嘿-嘿！别这样，我会脸红的。我们还要在车里待好几小时，我正好有些问题要问。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1476
translate chinese dawn1_a96ec58e:

    # daw "Ask away, darling. You might find my answers more... invigorating than you expect."
    daw "尽管问吧，亲爱的。你会发现我的答案比预期更…令人振奋哦。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1478
translate chinese dawn1_0d7bb822:

    # mox "Let’s start with the basics. If you’re from the same dimension as [mc], that means there’s probably a version of me in your world too, right?"
    mox "从最基本的开始吧。如果你和[mc]来自同一宇宙，那说明你的世界也存在另一个我，对吗？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1480
translate chinese dawn1_c53f939b:

    # "[daw]’s grin widens, and she draws a deep breath."
    "[daw]的笑容加深，深深吸了一口气。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1481
translate chinese dawn1_5a3168c4:

    # daw "Oh, yes. Your counterpart is very real, my dear [mox]. An absolute stunner and quite the handful."
    daw "噢，当然。亲爱的[mox]，那个你真实存在。是个绝色美人，也相当难应付呢。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1483
translate chinese dawn1_af93a23b:

    # "[mox] cocks an eyebrow, leaning forward with fresh curiosity."
    "[mox]挑起眉毛，带着新的好奇向前倾身。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1484
translate chinese dawn1_50575e25:

    # mox "A handful, huh? Is she as big on spectacle as I am?"
    mox "难应付？她也像我一样热衷排场吗？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1486
translate chinese dawn1_2a7b4be7:

    # daw "Bigger, in ways you might not expect. And she’s not just some flashy stage performer…"
    daw "比你想象的更夸张。而且她不只是个华丽的舞台表演者…"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1487
translate chinese dawn1_5e56d9ef:

    # daw "She’s an Alicorn Princess. Think: shimmering wings, a graceful horn, and a royal necklace that could blind a man if it caught the right light."
    daw "她是天角兽公主。想象一下：流光溢彩的翅膀，优雅的独角，还有一条能在特定光线下闪瞎眼的皇家项链。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1489
translate chinese dawn1_e0a7d652:

    # "[mox]’s jaw drops."
    "[mox]惊得张大了嘴。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1490
translate chinese dawn1_a0cd6204:

    # mox "Wait—Princess? Me? You’ve gotta be kidding. I mean, I’ve been called a diva before, sure, but actual royalty is a whole other level."
    mox "等等—公主？我？你开玩笑吧。虽然以前有人叫我天后，但真正的皇室完全是另一回事。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1492
translate chinese dawn1_da433d6e:

    # mox "[mc]! How come you’ve never told me this?"
    mox "[mc]！你怎么从没告诉过我？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1493
translate chinese dawn1_ad68cef7:

    # mc "You know, that’s a great question..."
    mc "嗯，这问题问得好…"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1495
translate chinese dawn1_29e1c78a:

    # daw "Currently, she rules jointly with Princess [lil], while [sel] and [aur] are slowly moving away from their main duties."
    daw "目前她和[lil]公主共同执政，而[sel]与[aur]正逐渐淡出主要职责。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1496
translate chinese dawn1_27f429db:

    # daw "Princess [mox]’s main focus has been transforming Arcadia into a vibrant hub of culture and creativity."
    daw "[mox]公主主要致力于将Arcadia转变为充满活力的文化创意中心。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1497
translate chinese dawn1_33c69b8d:

    # daw "Festivals, nightly performances, that sort of thing. The place buzzes with music and life under Princess [mox]’s guidance."
    daw "庆典、夜间演出之类的活动。在[mox]公主的引领下，整座王国洋溢着音乐与生机。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1499
translate chinese dawn1_680ae92b:

    # mox "That’s insane. I mean, sure, I love performing, but to actually lead an entire kingdom? That’s a little beyond me."
    mox "太疯狂了。虽然我喜欢表演，但领导整个王国？这有点超出我的能力了。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1501
translate chinese dawn1_9e3d90bf:

    # "She shoots me a playful wink."
    "她朝我俏皮地眨了眨眼。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1503
translate chinese dawn1_bc65f4b9:

    # mox "Guess that means I should be addressed as ‘Your Royal Highness’ from now on, huh?"
    mox "看来从现在起你们该尊称我“殿下”了是吧？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1504
translate chinese dawn1_19f9cf0b:

    # mc "Oh, absolutely. I’ll get on my knees and pledge my loyalty first chance I get."
    mc "噢，当然。一有机会我就跪地宣誓效忠。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1506
translate chinese dawn1_53867804:

    # daw "Careful, sweet things, or I’ll start getting jealous of all this worship. Though, come to think of it..."
    daw "当心哦，甜心，再这样崇拜下去我都要吃醋了。不过话说回来…"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1508
translate chinese dawn1_87c5f15f:

    # daw "Princess [mox] loves having her subjects kneel."
    daw "[mox]公主可喜欢让臣民行跪礼了。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1510
translate chinese dawn1_0233161a:

    # mox "Well, I can’t say I wouldn’t enjoy the attention. Would you mind telling me more about her? Was she born an Alicorn, or did she ascend somehow?"
    mox "好吧，我得承认这种关注很让人享受。能多讲讲她的事吗？她是天生就是天角兽，还是后来晋升的？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1512
translate chinese dawn1_4bffb468:

    # daw "She earned it, darling. Proved her worth by defeating [mor]. And she rose to the occasion every time."
    daw "她是凭实力获得的，亲爱的。通过击败[mor]证明了自身价值，而且每次都能挺身而出应对危机。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1514
translate chinese dawn1_e536bce4:

    # "[mox]'s eyes shine, and she clasps her hands together with excitement."
    "[mox]眼睛一亮，兴奋地双手交握。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1515
translate chinese dawn1_bea63976:

    # mox "That’s incredible. I wonder… if things had gone differently here, could I have become an Alicorn too?"
    mox "太不可思议了。我在想…如果这里的情况不同，我有没有可能也成为天角兽？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1516
translate chinese dawn1_11c8f1bf:

    # mc "Who knows? Different choices, different circumstances. But to be honest, I think you might be on that path already."
    mc "谁知道呢？不同的选择，不同的境遇。但说实话，我觉得你或许已经走在这条路上了。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1518
translate chinese dawn1_f5626afa:

    # "[daw] giggles, her voice dropping to that playful, velvety tone again."
    "[daw]轻笑出声，嗓音又带上那种戏谑的丝绒质感。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1519
translate chinese dawn1_8dc43a1f:

    # daw "My dear, your potential is limitless. Just because the crown’s on a different head right now, doesn’t mean you can’t forge your own brand of royalty here. I see that spark in you already."
    daw "亲爱的，你的潜力是无限的。虽然王冠现在戴在别人头上，不代表你不能在这里开创自己的王者之道。我已经在你身上看到那种光芒了。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1521
translate chinese dawn1_c06270a4:

    # mox "Thanks, [daw]... Did you two... ever, you know, cross paths in a big way?"
    mox "谢谢，[daw]…你们俩有没有…那个，发生过重要交集？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1523
translate chinese dawn1_f4cd7c4a:

    # "She crosses her arms and leans back, a sultry smile curving her lips."
    "她抱起双臂向后靠去，唇边勾起一抹慵懒的笑意。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1524
translate chinese dawn1_3162aedc:

    # daw "Let’s just say that [mc] and I have had our share of ‘royal engagements.’"
    daw "这么说吧，[mc]和我可没少进行“王室级深入交流”。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1526
translate chinese dawn1_796448b5:

    # daw "She had quite an appetite for life. Kept me on my toes."
    daw "她对生活的热情相当旺盛，总让我保持警觉呢。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1528
translate chinese dawn1_e8e2c4f6:

    # "A brief, charged silence passes before [mox] lets out a snort and folds her arms."
    "短暂的暧昧沉默后，[mox]噗嗤一笑抱起胳膊。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1529
translate chinese dawn1_47c76e43:

    # mox "Ha! Sounds like me, alright."
    mox "哈！听起来确实像我。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1530
translate chinese dawn1_b840ec7b:

    # "From the front of the car, the driver shifts and coughs. He can totally hear us..."
    "车前座的司机动了动身子咳嗽一声。他绝对能听见我们说话…"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1532
translate chinese dawn1_4eb50d6d:

    # "We all refocus on the road as the Crystal Kingdom’s majestic skyline finally comes into view."
    "当水晶王国雄伟的天际线终于映入眼帘时，我们都重新将注意力投向道路。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1533
translate chinese dawn1_dd76eb39:

    # daw "There’s plenty more gossip to be had, but let’s save that for another time, hmm? We’ve enough on our plate with Umbra’s invasion."
    daw "八卦话题还多着呢，不过留到下次再说吧？眼下对付Umbra的入侵就够忙了。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1535
translate chinese dawn1_6caed085:

    # mox "Fine, you tease. But I will corner you again for details. Whether I'm a princess here or not, I can’t just let that dangle."
    mox "好吧，你这吊胃口的家伙。但我一定会再找你问清楚的。不管我在这里是不是公主，都不可能放过这种猛料。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1537
translate chinese dawn1_77cb6cfa:

    # daw "Careful, darling. I know your buttons~"
    daw "当心哦亲爱的，我可知道你的敏感点呢~"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1539
translate chinese dawn1_1cc967c6:

    # "I can only imagine the trouble she got up in my 'absence' in the other universe."
    "只能想象我不在的那个宇宙里她惹了多少麻烦。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1542
translate chinese dawn1_4dc876c8:

    # "As we arrived and walked through the main avenue, we came upon the ultimate view of the Crystal Kingdom."
    "当我们抵达并穿过主大道时，水晶王国的壮丽全景映入眼帘。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1543
translate chinese dawn1_cec3e932:

    # "[mox] slowed, her eyes widening as she took in the sprawling cityscape."
    "[mox]放缓脚步，睁大眼睛凝视着延展的城市景观。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1544
translate chinese dawn1_a38b4883:

    # mox "Wow... This place really is something else."
    mox "哇…这里真是别具一格。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1545
translate chinese dawn1_7aa6d96f:

    # mc "It’s advanced in such a different way compared to Arcadia. Advanced, yet... traditional at the same time."
    mc "它的发展方式与Arcadia截然不同。既先进又…保留着传统。"

