    "她将头发甩到一侧肩头，迈着不稳的脚步走向门口。[daw]却仍留在原地，指尖轻轻划过我的手臂，嘴角勾起一抹得意的笑。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1861
translate chinese dawn1_08c3a194:

    # daw "You two recover. I’ve a feeling we’ll need all our strength in the days to come."
    daw "你们俩先休息会儿吧。我预感往后我们得花费不少力气。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1863
translate chinese dawn1_4bf82282:

    # mox "Uhm, yeah… I actually still need to unpack. See you at dinner, [mc]."
    mox "呃，是啊......我还得整理一下。晚饭见，[mc]。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1867
translate chinese dawn1_5addfdc3:

    # daw "Someone's playing hard to get~"
    daw "有人在欲情故纵呢~"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1869
translate chinese dawn1_f74b1d91:

    # mox "Perhaps I misread the room!"
    mox "可能我误会了什么！"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1870
translate chinese dawn1_3773cbd7:

    # mox "Well, I still need to do some unpacking. I'll see you two at dinner."
    mox "好吧，我还是得整理整理。等晚饭再见吧。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1871
translate chinese dawn1_0993920a:

    # daw "Same, dearies~ Bye for now."
    daw "我也是，亲爱的们~先拜拜了。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1877
translate chinese dawn1_2709d868:

    # "[daw] blows me a kiss before following [mox] out with her dress in hand."
    "[daw]抛来飞吻，手持裙摆随[mox]离去。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1878
translate chinese dawn1_c04ae095:

    # "I’m left in the hush of the suite once more, like nothing ever happened."
    "房间重归寂静，恍若南柯一梦。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1879
translate chinese dawn1_00cca14f:

    # "If this is day one in the Crystal Kingdom, I can’t imagine what else might be in store."
    "如果这还只是水晶王国的第一天，我真不敢想后面还会有什么在等着我们。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1881
translate chinese dawn1_f7594f13:

    # "An hour later…"
    "一小时后…"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1884
translate chinese dawn1_7f14b871:

    # "The dinner hall is grand, the chandelier above casting a golden light over the tables where we’ve all gathered."
    "餐厅大厅非常气派，头顶的水晶吊灯洒下金色的光芒，照亮了我们围坐的长桌。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1885
translate chinese dawn1_0c130b4c:

    # "The food is rich and colorful. Platters of fresh fruits, honey-glazed vegetables, and what smells like spiced cider filling the air."
    "桌上的食物又丰盛又好看。大盘的新鲜水果、裹着蜂蜜的蔬菜，空气里还飘着像是香料苹果酒的香甜气味。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1886
translate chinese dawn1_9fc919c9:

    # "[rub] is the first to break the casual conversation, setting down her fork and giving me a pointed look."
    "[rub]第一个打破了轻松的闲聊，她放下叉子，意味深长地看了我一眼。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1889
translate chinese dawn1_3cc8ce79:

    # rub "So! I was thinking. [mc], we’ve got a week to prepare for Umbra. You should join me and [bla] for some magic practice tomorrow."
    rub "这样吧！我有个想法。[mc]，我们有一周时间为对抗Umbra做准备。明天你应该来找我和[bla]，一起练习魔法。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1890
translate chinese dawn1_a20c6210:

    # mc "Yeah, I tried looking at a few spell books, but I confess, I have no idea what I’m looking at. It’s like knowing how to play music from memory but not being able to read music."
    mc "是啊，我试着翻过几本魔法书，但说实话根本看不懂。就像光会凭记忆弹曲子，却看不懂乐谱一样。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1893
translate chinese dawn1_42a314b4:

    # bla "Exactly why you need a few lessons. We’ve got the power, but we don’t have the knowledge. Time to work backwards."
    bla "这正是你需要上课的原因。我们有力量，但缺乏知识。现在该从基础补起了。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1895
translate chinese dawn1_71db030a:

    # rub "Plus, I’ve made some major strides myself. I’d like to demonstrate what I’ve learned."
    rub "再说，我自己也进步了不少。很想给你们看看我新掌握的技巧。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1896
translate chinese dawn1_38684976:

    # "Before I can respond, a deep huff comes from the other end of the table."
    "还没等我开口，长桌另一端传来一声低沉的哼声。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1902
translate chinese dawn1_b115b14b:

    # hon "Magic schmagic. Ain’t nothin’ beats good old-fashioned body training’."
    hon "魔法有什么了不起。再怎么样也比不上老老实实锻炼身体。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1903
translate chinese dawn1_ef59c3ad:

    # hon "[mc], you should spar with me an’ [rik]. Build some real strength!"
    hon "[mc]，你应该来跟我还有[rik]对练。练出真本事！"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1905
translate chinese dawn1_69dd0acc:

    # rik "Exactly! Magic won’t help you if the enemies get in your face."
    rik "说得对！要是敌人都怼到眼前了，魔法根本派不上用场。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1907
translate chinese dawn1_88de9755:

    # hon "Darn right. Fists and footwork. That’s what wins battles. No offense, [rub]."
    hon "没错，靠拳头和步伐才能打赢。不是针对你，[rub]。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1909
translate chinese dawn1_a3632f13:

    # rub "Offense taken."
    rub "这话我不爱听。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1910
translate chinese dawn1_223cb892:

    # "[rub] crosses her arms but smirks all the same."
    "[rub]抱起胳膊，但嘴角却挂着似笑非笑的表情。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1919
translate chinese dawn1_a31e8594:

    # lil "You’re both right. As the Queen said, we should focus on our own strengths. The casters will benefit greatly from your strength on the frontlines."
    lil "你们说得都有道理。就像女王说的，我们应该发挥各自的长处。有你们在前线冲锋，我们施法者才能更好地发挥作用。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1920
translate chinese dawn1_06a4df8a:

    # "I glance down the table where [pen] sits, neatly stacking her cutlery after finishing her meal. [but] sits beside her, picking at an apple. She's been quiet all day."
    "我顺着餐桌望过去，看到[pen]坐在那里，吃完饭后正仔细地叠放着自己的餐具。[but]坐在她旁边，小口小口地啃着苹果。她一整天都没怎么说话。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1921
translate chinese dawn1_ef32ff24:

    # pen "[but] and I have some personal matters to attend to. Studying and researching."
    pen "[but]和我有些私事要处理。是学习和研究方面的事。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1922
translate chinese dawn1_c4da455c:

    # pen "We’d love to include you, but it’s less… training and more theory."
    pen "我们很希望你能加入，但这不太算是训练……更像是理论研究。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1924
translate chinese dawn1_d59eadab:

    # but "It’s kind of delicate work. We might be able to loop you in later, if we find anything interesting."
    but "这项任务有点精细。要是发现什么有意思的内容，或许之后可以请你参与进来。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1925
translate chinese dawn1_4b49b0a8:

    # mc "So… we’re splitting up to do magic, physical sparring, and research?"
    mc "所以……我们现在要分头行动，有人去练魔法，有人去实战对练，还有人去做研究？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1927
translate chinese dawn1_95ac9ac5:

    # lil "Actually, there’s a fourth! Well, not for you exactly."
    lil "其实还有第四项安排！不过这个跟你关系不大。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1928
translate chinese dawn1_ee87e6f3:

    # mc "Oh?"
    mc "哦？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1930
translate chinese dawn1_5e9f76f5:

    # lil "I’ve decided to personally tutor [mox] to help refine her abilities. Her performance is evolving thanks to her virtue power, but it lacks structure."
    lil "我决定亲自指导[mox]，帮她提升能力。虽然她的表现因美德之力正在进步，但还缺乏系统性。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1933
translate chinese dawn1_5f32208e:

    # mox "Ta-da! That's me!"
    mox "看我的！这就是我啦！"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1935
translate chinese dawn1_f420e56b:

    # "Her thighs are still trembling from earlier!"
    "她大腿到现在还因为刚才的事微微发抖呢！"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1936
translate chinese dawn1_6b0c54dd:

    # mox "I’ve actually been taught a few basics from [sel]. Time to put them into practice."
    mox "其实[sel]教过我一些基础。现在正好可以实践看看。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1938
translate chinese dawn1_72ebe9e8:

    # lil "I’ll be focusing on theory, energy regulation, and emotional stability in spellcasting."
    lil "我会把重点放在理论研究、能量控制和施法时的情绪稳定上。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1940
translate chinese dawn1_40207292:

    # mox "Which is code for ‘I’m gonna make sure [mox] doesn’t blow something up next time she tries a magic trick.’"
    mox "这话说白了就是“我得盯着点[mox]，免得她下次变魔法把戏时又把什么东西炸飞”。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1942
translate chinese dawn1_5d9d1bd8:

    # lil "On the contrary. I’m going to teach you how to make those explosions even more powerful, but in a concentrated manner."
    lil "恰恰相反。我要教你怎么让那些爆炸威力更强，不过得控制在可控范围内。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1944
translate chinese dawn1_1bf59956:

    # mox "Oooo~ I can’t wait."
    mox "哇哦～我都等不及了。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1945
translate chinese dawn1_b19af27e:

    # mc "Guess I’ll have to cheer from the sidelines for that one."
    mc "看来这个项目我只能在旁边给你们加油了。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1949
translate chinese dawn1_6ace0823:

    # "[daw] suddenly shifts beside me, swirling her wine glass as she tilts her head, studying me with that ever-present smirk."
    "[daw]突然在我身边动了动，她晃着酒杯歪过头，用那惯常的似笑非笑表情打量着我。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1950
translate chinese dawn1_d14fe209:

    # daw "Such variety, isn’t there? Sparring, spellcraft and plenty of salicious moments in between."
    daw "活动真丰富啊，不是吗？既有对战训练，又有法术研习，中间还穿插着不少暧昧时刻。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1952
translate chinese dawn1_3623ae72:

    # daw "Of course, I’ll be watching very closely no matter which path you choose. Wouldn’t want to miss any… breakthroughs."
    daw "当然啦，不管你选哪项活动，我都会仔细关注的。毕竟不想错过任何……突破性进展呢。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1953
translate chinese dawn1_0a20f2dd:

    # mc "Right. Uh. Thanks for the… support."
    mc "好的。呃…谢谢你的…支持。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1954
translate chinese dawn1_87045dc9:

    # "[daw] chuckles, sitting back in her seat as the conversation begins to pick up again, laughter and playful banter filling the dining hall."
    "[daw]轻笑一声，随着谈话声重新活跃起来，她向后靠回椅背，餐厅里充满了欢声笑语和嬉闹的交谈。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1961
translate chinese dawn1_8903ca07:

    # rub "Well, [mc]? What’s it gonna be?"
    rub "所以，[mc]？你打算选哪个？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1962
translate chinese dawn1_d9c411b4:

    # hon "Don’t take too long decidin’. We start at sun rise!"
    hon "别犹豫太久啦！我们天亮就出发！"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1965
translate chinese dawn1_f339c1db:

    # rik "Huh, we do?"
    rik "啊，真的吗？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1967
translate chinese dawn1_4d12ced1:

    # "Looks like everyone has their plans in order except me. I know in many ways I'm an anchor for this group, but in a situation like this, what exactly am {i}I{/i} best at?"
    "看来大家都安排好了，就我还没着落。我知道在很多方面自己是这个团队的支柱，但眼下这种情况，我{i} 究竟 {/i}最擅长什么呢？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1968
translate chinese dawn1_c6b7d19f:

    # "I take a slow breath, realizing that whatever choice I make next, it’ll shape how prepared we are for Umbra’s challenge."
    "我缓缓吸了口气，意识到无论接下来作何选择，都将决定我们面对Umbra挑战时的准备程度。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1971
translate chinese dawn1_b1832f99:

    # "It’s time to decide how I want to spend tomorrow."
    "是时候决定明天要怎么安排了。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1985
translate chinese crystal1a_d73229ff:

    # "The air was crisp, the dew still fresh on the grass as the sun began to stretch over the horizon."
    "空气很清新，草叶上的露珠还闪着微光，朝阳刚刚从地平线探出头来。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1988
translate chinese crystal1a_082f20c3:

    # "The sun painted the landscape in soft orange as I sat next to [hon] on the low stone wall, watching the day come alive."
    "朝阳将四周染成柔和的橘色，我和[hon]并肩坐在矮石墙上，看着天色渐渐亮起来。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1989
translate chinese crystal1a_88967823:

    # "[hon] adjusted her hat, tilting it forward slightly to shield her eyes from the light."
    "[hon]调整了下帽子，把帽檐往前压了压，挡住照过来的阳光。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1991
translate chinese crystal1a_a3983528:

    # hon "You’re up awful early, sugar. Didn’t think you were the sunrise kinda fella."
    hon "起得真早呀，甜心。没想到你会来看日出呢。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1992
translate chinese crystal1a_c4ff8a64:

    # mc "That's what you said, wasn't it? Although it seems like the others are still fast asleep."
    mc "你昨天是这么说的对吧？不过其他人好像都还在睡着呢。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1994
translate chinese crystal1a_2931f8fc:

    # hon "Last night was a late one, but a long day’s work don’t wait for the sun. I couldn't sleep, guess I'm just stuck like this."
    hon "昨晚是熬得晚了点，可活儿不等人啊。我实在睡不着，估计这毛病是改不掉了。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1995
translate chinese crystal1a_93885463:

    # mc "Any updates from the farm? Repairs, new equipment and such."
    mc "农场那边有什么新消息吗？比如维修进度，或者添置了新设备之类的？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1997
translate chinese crystal1a_8fc0328a:

    # hon "It’s promising so far. Crops weren't trampled much in the attacks, so despite everything, we may have the best yield in years."
    hon "目前情况还不错。虽然经历了那些袭击，但庄稼没怎么被踩坏，说不定今年收成反而会是这几年里最好的。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:1999
translate chinese crystal1a_5f4199f2:

    # hon "[blo]'s taking care of it now. At first, she was hesitant, but I assured her she's far tougher than she thinks!"
    hon "现在[blo]在负责照看农场。她起初还挺犹豫的，但我告诉她，她可比自己想象的要坚强得多！"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2001
translate chinese crystal1a_40c23ae1:

    # hon "Although, I wonder if I was only saying that out loud for myself. Sometimes, I wonder if I did the right thing, leavin’ it all to her."
    hon "不过有时候我也会想，当初把农场全交给她打理，这个决定到底对不对。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2002
translate chinese crystal1a_c447fe47:

    # mc "She’s an adult too. You wouldn’t have left if you didn’t trust her."
    mc "她也是成年人了。要是信不过她，你当初就不会离开了。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2004
translate chinese crystal1a_dad63345:

    # "[hon] let out a soft exhale, rubbing her hands together."
    "[hon]轻轻呼出一口气，双手交叠着搓了搓。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2006
translate chinese crystal1a_ba466308:

    # hon "Yeah. She’s grown, sure. Got the know-how and the heart for it. But she’s alone out there. No Ma. No Pa. Just... her."
    hon "是啊。她确实长大了，有本事也有那份心思。可现在就她一个人守在那儿。没有妈陪着，没有爸撑着。就只剩……她孤零零的。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2007
translate chinese crystal1a_fc3f111c:

    # hon "The farm was everything to us, ya know? Kept us together when we lost our folks. We worked it side by side every day, rain or shine."
    hon "那片农场对我们意义重大，明白吗？爹妈走后就是它让我们姐妹相依为命。不管刮风下雨，我们每天都一起下地干活。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2008
translate chinese crystal1a_a1ac1475:

    # hon "Now I've just... walked away. Left her with all that weight."
    hon "可现在我却……一走了之。把那么重的担子全扔给她。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2009
translate chinese crystal1a_c024d8c3:

    # mc "You didn’t walk away. You stepped up. You’re out here protecting Arcadia, including her. And I know she understands that. She wouldn’t want you putting everything on hold for her sake."
    mc "你没有选择离开。而是选择挺身而出。现在你在这里守护Arcadia，其中也包括她。我相信她明白这一点。她不会希望你为了她而停下前进的脚步。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2011
translate chinese crystal1a_4222ecad:

    # hon "Yeah, but what if she needs me? What if somethin’ goes wrong and I ain’t there to help?"
    hon "是啊，可万一她需要我呢？万一出了什么岔子，我却不在她身边帮忙怎么办？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2012
translate chinese crystal1a_346c7be4:

    # mc "Then she’ll handle it, just like you taught her. You gave her the tools to stand on her own. And you’re still fighting for her."
    mc "那她也会自己应对的，就像你教她的那样。你早已给了她独立面对的能力。而且你现在不也仍在为她而战吗？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2014
translate chinese crystal1a_864937a3:

    # "She was quiet again, the tension in her shoulders easing just a fraction. The sun had climbed higher now, warm light catching her face."
    "她再度沉默下来，肩膀的紧绷感稍稍缓和了些。太阳渐渐升高，暖融融的光线映照在她脸上。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2015
translate chinese crystal1a_99ab7835:

    # hon "Heh... Right, we can't be together forever. I have to let go some time... Maybe I'm the one who's really scared of being alone."
    hon "呵呵…是啊，我们不可能永远在一起。总有一天我得放手…也许其实害怕孤独的人，是我自己才对。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2017
translate chinese crystal1a_e4cb0522:

    # hon "And yet... Suppose neither of us are alone, not anymore."
    hon "可是…想想看，我们其实都不再是孤身一人了，早就不算了。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2018
translate chinese crystal1a_5d311465:

    # "She looked up at me and nodded."
    "她抬起头看着我，点了点头。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2019
translate chinese crystal1a_43410312:

    # "After a moment, she rolled her shoulders back and cracked her knuckles."
    "过了一会儿，她活动了下肩膀，又把指关节按得咔咔响。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2021
translate chinese crystal1a_a46dc9b5:

    # hon "Well. Words are nice an’ all, but they ain’t gonna help us when Umbra comes knockin’. How ‘bout we see if your moves are as sharp as your mouth?"
    hon "话说得是挺好听，不过等黑暗军团真打上门的时候，光靠嘴可不管用。不如让我看看，你的身手是不是也像你的嘴皮子这么利索？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2022
translate chinese crystal1a_7de7ad5a:

    # mc "Oh, I can keep up just fine. Question is... think you can handle me at my best?"
    mc "哼，我跟得上你的节奏。问题是…你觉得能接住我全力出手的招式吗？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2023
translate chinese crystal1a_98efa816:

    # "She smirked, tipping her hat back."
    "她嘴角一翘，把帽子往后推了推。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2026
translate chinese crystal1a_e5a25c98:

