    "她那副笑容实在太过得意了。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2912
translate chinese rub4_2f726935:

    # "Focus... This was going to be difficult."
    "专注……这可不容易。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2914
translate chinese rub4_fb228ff1:

    # "The next thirty minutes was vigorous to say the least. [rub] guided us through the formation of magical barriers in her own natural, effortless way."
    "接下来的三十分钟的练习强度堪称激烈。[rub]以她那自然而轻松的方式，教导我们去学习魔法护盾的构建。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2915
translate chinese rub4_400e84c9:

    # "Which lead to [bla] and I brute-forcing the method through sheer willpower."
    "这导致[bla]和我凭借纯粹的意志力对该方法进行了暴力破解。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2916
translate chinese rub4_3b8fe4ed:

    # "We struggled at first, our barriers flickering out before they could fully form."
    "起初我们举步维艰，那些屏障尚未成形便已消散。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2919
translate chinese rub4_c030d78b:

    # rub "For a unicorn, magic is intuitive, like any other sense."
    rub "对角马而言，魔法如同其他感官般自然。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2920
translate chinese rub4_24d6073c:

    # rub "For you two, it’ll be like learning to walk in a week."
    rub "对你们俩来说，这就像从头学习一门语言一样困难。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2922
translate chinese rub4_cc4c52b6:

    # "With some guidance, I began to get the hang of it."
    "在一些指导过后，我渐渐掌握了诀窍。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2923
translate chinese rub4_ff1e3110:

    # "And nearing the end of the first hour, we were all standing within a triangle of glowing shields, able to deflect a basic magical attack."
    "随着第一小时的练习临近尾声，我们终于学会了魔法护盾的释放方法，这足以抵御基础的魔法攻击。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2928
translate chinese rub4_c940235e:

    # rub "Much better! Look at you, darling. I’m proud."
    rub "就是这样！瞧瞧你，亲爱的，我为你感到骄傲。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2930
translate chinese rub4_619c24d8:

    # bla "Yeah, yeah, don’t get too impressed yet… Truth is, this isn’t going to do shit against the ‘world’s strongest unicorn,’ is it?"
    bla "是啊，但别太自信……说真的，这玩意儿对上“世界最强的角马”根本没啥用，对吧？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2932
translate chinese rub4_06b9911a:

    # rub "Hm… It’s hard to quantify the boost we got from the virtue’s relics against that… If only there was someone strong enough to test us."
    rub "嗯……要量化谐律这个圣物给我们带来的加成可不容易……要是能有足够强悍的对手来检验我们的练习成果就好了。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2933
translate chinese rub4_dff4dc96:

    # "Just as we were about to reset and try another round, there was a shift of energy in the room. Powerful enough to send a shiver down my spine."
    "正当我们准备开始新一轮练习时，房间里的魔力突然怎强，那股力量强大得令我不禁打了个冷颤。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2938
translate chinese rub4_604981f4:

    # "Queen [aug]. Warmth emanated from her, like stepping into an embrace. But beneath that heart laid pure power."
    "是[aug]女王。她身上散发着温暖的气场，如同步入一个温暖的怀抱之中。但在那颗外表之下，蕴藏着纯粹的力量。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2939
translate chinese rub4_b52b0820:

    # "I couldn’t sense it before, but immediately after experimenting with magic, I was especially attuned to that feeling."
    "此前我从未在她身上察觉过这种感觉，但在我尝试施展魔法之后，我对这种感觉变得格外敏感。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2940
translate chinese rub4_0c8a9ad8:

    # aug "My, my... such diligence! It pleases me to see you taking your training seriously."
    aug "哎呀~……你们真勤奋啊！看到你们如此认真对待训练，我深感欣慰。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2941
translate chinese rub4_95a52320:

    # "Her voice was rich as honey, effortlessly filling the chamber without need for volume. We all straightened instinctively, and [rub] even seemed momentarily starstruck."
    "她的声音如蜜糖般甜美，无需提高音量便能轻而易举地充盈整个房间。我们不约而同地挺直了身子，连[rub]似乎也瞬间被她的魅力所折服。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2943
translate chinese rub4_51aebca5:

    # bla "Uh... Hello, Your Majesty!"
    bla "哦……您好，陛下！"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2945
translate chinese rub4_467d8b0a:

    # rub "Oh, this just got much more interesting."
    rub "哦~，这下可有意思了。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2947
translate chinese rub4_0b4723ce:

    # aug "I hope you don’t mind the intrusion. In truth, I’ve been watching you for a while now, and I’ve decided that I will personally oversee your magical training."
    aug "希望你不介意我的打扰。其实我已观察你许久，现决定亲自指导你们的魔法训练。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2948
translate chinese rub4_0afd6513:

    # mc "Wait, you're really going to teach us?"
    mc "等等，你真的要教我们使用魔法吗？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2950
translate chinese rub4_7f290f48:

    # aug "Indeed. Your defensive magic is progressing well, but you still lack something crucial."
    aug "是的。你们的防御魔法进步显著，但仍缺少关键要素。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2953
translate chinese rub4_07f22167:

    # "She lifted a single hand, and without a word, a dazzling burst of energy erupted from her palm. Swirling, golden, pink magic expanded outward as an intricate shield."
    "她单手一抬，未发一语，掌心便迸发出耀眼的光芒。金色与粉色的魔法旋涡向外扩散，化作一道精巧的护盾。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2954
translate chinese rub4_a25f5b55:

    # "It wasn’t a mere shield, it was art."
    "那并非普通的魔法护盾，而是一件艺术品。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2957
translate chinese rub4_bf1d901b:

    # "Then, just as effortlessly... It hardened within an instant, like a spike trap shooting from a wall. The shield was suddenly a razor-sharp blade of energy."
    "接着，她同样毫不费力地……使其瞬间硬化，骤然化作如剃刀般锋利的能量刃。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2958
translate chinese rub4_e4dfdbd1:

    # "If any foes were to strike her shield, they’d have been met with a quick and inevitable end."
    "若有敌人敢于击打她的盾牌，必将遭遇迅捷而必然的终结。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2959
translate chinese rub4_2d100bf3:

    # "She had combined the elegance of [rub] with the practicality [bla] sought after."
    "她将[rub]的优雅与[bla]的实用性完美结合在了一起。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2961
translate chinese rub4_6a0918af:

    # aug "I imagine you’re wondering why I’ve chosen to teach you personally."
    aug "我想你们一定在想，为什么我会选择亲自教你们。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2963
translate chinese rub4_8b84c108:

    # rub "It is a bit of a surprise, Your Majesty. Shouldn’t you be preparing for war?"
    rub "是的，陛下，这着实令我们感到意外。您不该在备战吗？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2965
translate chinese rub4_af70968b:

    # bla "Or leading it? We could really use someone at your level out there."
    bla "或在前线激励您的子民？我们确实需要像你这样的马在前线领导军队。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2967
translate chinese rub4_4004c1fc:

    # aug "Mmm, if only it were that simple, darling."
    aug "唉，要是事情真有这么简单就好了，亲爱的。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2968
translate chinese rub4_5e580bce:

    # aug "The truth is, my direct involvement would do more harm than good."
    aug "事实上，我直接参与战争准备肯定弊大于利。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2969
translate chinese rub4_c8c41d6b:

    # mc "You’re saying you can’t fight?"
    mc "您的意思是？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2971
translate chinese rub4_d29e32a2:

    # aug "This is a war of ego. Umbra does not see himself as a villain. No tyrant ever does."
    aug "这是一场自尊心的战争。Umbra并不认为自己是反派。毕竟，暴君从来都不会这么想。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2976
translate chinese rub4_25fa3d63:

    # "Her fingers danced, conjuring a shimmering image of Arcadia. Not just the city, but the vast country, its many kingdoms intertwined."
    "她的手指轻舞，勾勒出Arcadia的往日。不仅仅只是一座城市，而是一片辽阔的国度，无数王国在此交织相连。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2978
translate chinese rub4_588beb99:

    # aug "Ambrose is but one kingdom within Arcadia, but its people? They are still Arcadians. And whether we like it or not, Umbra believes himself to be saving them."
    aug "Ambrose不过是Arcadia境内的一座王国，但它的子民们依然是Arcadia的子民。无论我们是否认同，Umbra坚信自己是在拯救他们。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2979
translate chinese rub4_8b1efe5d:

    # aug "If I were to take to the battlefield against him, it would not be seen as a defense of Arcadia, it would be seen as an attack on Ambrose. It would stoke the flames of war and justify full retaliation."
    aug "倘若我率军与他交战，世人不会视作捍卫Arcadia，而将之视为对Ambrose的进攻。此举必将煽动战火，为他对我们进行全面报复提供正当理由。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2980
translate chinese rub4_4d92d3bf:

    # aug "In that sense, the first aggressor loses. And Ambrose? It is no fragile state in need of protection. It is a military juggernaut, one that has spent decades forging alliances and preparing to combat the darkness, even working closely with the Crystal Kingdom."
    aug "从这个意义上说，发动侵略的国家注定失败。而Ambrose？它绝非需要庇护的脆弱国度，而是一座庞大的战争机器——数十年来，它不断缔结同盟，为对抗黑暗做足准备，甚至与水晶王国建立了紧密合作。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2982
translate chinese rub4_628894f9:

    # bla "So if you came to help, it’d just make things worse?"
    bla "所以如果你来帮忙，反而会让事情变得更糟？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2984
translate chinese rub4_f4c1e29e:

    # aug "Not just worse, my dear. Irreversible."
    aug "你猜得没错，亲爱的，且不可逆转。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2986
translate chinese rub4_c7a90c1d:

    # aug "But you, the Virtues, stand apart from the throne. You may act where rulers cannot."
    aug "但你们，谐律之元们，却超然于王座之上。你们能行君王所不能为之事。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2987
translate chinese rub4_a0476e61:

    # mc "I… see. We’re being sent because we’re not officially tied to the monarchy. There’s plausible deniability in our actions."
    mc "我……明白了。我们之所以被派去，是因为我们与王室没有正式的联系，这就让我们的行动不会牵连到王室。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2989
translate chinese rub4_e7dfd8bf:

    # aug "That is a rather pragmatic interpretation. But do not mistake my reasoning. You are not mere blades to be wielded and discarded."
    aug "这倒是个相当务实的解读。但别误解我的本意——你们并非用完即扔的刀剑。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2990
translate chinese rub4_ffed5e35:

    # aug "Umbra himself has extended the invitation to face him. This is your chance to prevent war before it engulfs all of Arcadia. That is why I must train you, to ensure that when the time comes, you are ready."
    aug "Umbra本马已发出决斗邀请，这是阻止战争吞噬整个Arcadia的最后机会。因此我必须训练你们，确保当决战时刻来临，你们已做好准备。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2992
translate chinese rub4_0374fa73:

    # aug "And, well… with your unique abilities, I must say, you’re proving to be quite fascinating."
    aug "而且，嗯……凭借你们独特的才能，我必须说，你们确实展现出了非凡的魅力。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2994
translate chinese rub4_de19a752:

    # rub "What may we learn from your unique powers as Queen of Love?"
    rub "作为爱之女王，我们能从您独特的能力中领悟到什么？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2996
translate chinese rub4_2e5960c8:

    # aug "Love isn’t just about warmth and kindness. It can be a powerful force, and if needed... a weapon."
    aug "爱不仅关乎温暖与仁慈。它可以是强大的力量，必要时……亦可化作武器。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2997
translate chinese rub4_b32bb324:

    # aug "Let me show you what it means to wield it."
    aug "让我带你们见识见识，爱的威力。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:2998
translate chinese rub4_31258002:

    # "The real lesson begins…"
    "真正的课程开始了……"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3000
translate chinese rub4_a21366f0:

    # rub "Oh, this is going to be fun."
    rub "哦，这下可有意思了。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3001
translate chinese rub4_1a20b846:

    # rub "Please, do go on, Your Majesty. I’m very interested in how love magic works."
    rub "请继续说，陛下。我对爱情魔法的运作原理深感兴趣。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3003
translate chinese rub4_6b6feb13:

    # "[bla], meanwhile, had a more skeptical expression, arms crossed."
    "与此同时，[bla]面露怀疑之色，双臂又交叉在了一起。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3004
translate chinese rub4_b6bf6a14:

    # bla "Okay, but let’s be real here… I’m not [rub]. I don’t exactly have a... romantic connection to magic. Can I even use something like this?"
    bla "好吧，但我说实话……我可不是什么专业的魔法师。我对魔法可没什么……浪漫的情怀。这种东西我真能用吗？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3006
translate chinese rub4_c7c12733:

    # aug "Love is not limited to art or romance, child. It is found in all things. Passion. Purpose. Protecting that for which you care."
    aug "爱不仅存在于艺术或浪漫之中，我的孩子。它存在于万物之中。热诚、使命、或你所珍视的一切。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3007
translate chinese rub4_3d8f29e5:

    # aug "These, too, are bonds. And for many, bonds are where magic draws its strength."
    aug "它们同样是种纽带。对许多马而言，正是纽带的存在，魔法才得以变得强大。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3009
translate chinese rub4_eec15535:

    # bla "Mm… I want to learn. Even if I don’t get it yet... I’ll figure it out."
    bla "嗯……我想学。即使现在还不懂……但我总会弄明白的。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3011
translate chinese rub4_52ad0e6a:

    # aug "Then let us begin. You will not just learn how to create barriers today. You will learn how to weave power through your very emotions, how to strengthen your magic by understanding its roots."
    aug "那么，让我们开始吧。今日你不仅将学会如何筑起屏障，更将领悟如何将力量编织进自身的情感之中，如何通过理解魔法的根源来强化你的法术。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3012
translate chinese rub4_879e20a9:

    # aug "And, most importantly, how to use love as both shield... and sword."
    aug "最重要的是，如何将爱既作为盾牌...又作为利剑。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3014
translate chinese rub4_fe58c7a2:

    # "[aug] guided us through a series of rigorous exercise, each tailored to our individual strengths and weaknesses."
    "[aug]带领我们完成了一系列严格的训练，每项训练都针对我们各自的优势与不足量身定制。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3015
translate chinese rub4_33a3ad2c:

    # "[rub] excelled in weaving elegant, purposeful magic. Illusions, enchantments, barriers…"
    "[rub]擅长编织优雅而富有目的性的魔法。幻术、咒语、屏障……"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3020
translate chinese rub4_37832d26:

    # "But when [aug] asked her to generate something with force, her confidence wavered."
    "但当[aug]要求她强行生成能量体体时，她的自信心动摇了。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3021
translate chinese rub4_f47685a4:

    # "Her first few attempts resulted in bursts of magic. Powerful, but she could tell that she was falling short of her true potential."
    "她最初的几次尝试都引发了魔能爆炸。虽然威力强大，但她能感觉到自己尚未发挥出真正的潜力。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3023
translate chinese rub4_82bee979:

    # rub "Well, that was underwhelming…"
    rub "唉，这可真够令马失望的……"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3025
translate chinese rub4_7aa933f6:

    # aug "You are too focused on how your magic should behave rather than why you’re casting it."
    aug "你过于专注于魔法的运作，却忽略了施展它的初衷。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3026
translate chinese rub4_73e23846:

    # aug "Tell me, [rub]. Why do you fight?"
    aug "告诉我，[rub]。你为何而战？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3028
translate chinese rub4_ecf0dacd:

    # rub "I suppose... I fight to protect. But combat magic feels so... unintuitive to me. Outside of blasting a few nightmares, I have no experience."
    rub "我……我为了守护而战。但战斗魔法对我而言如此……违背了我的直觉。除了轰炸过几只梦魇之外，我毫无实战经验。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3030
translate chinese rub4_d271af28:

    # aug "A rose and a thorn, my dear. One grows in beauty, the other cuts with precision, but both stem from the same place."
    aug "记住玫瑰与荆棘的关系，亲爱的。玫瑰绽放绚烂，荆棘锋芒毕露，却都生长于同一根茎上。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3031
translate chinese rub4_07a40e66:

    # "[rub]’s gaze lingered and something clicking."
    "[rub]的目光久久停留，脑内咔嗒作响。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3033
translate chinese rub4_60d3f87c:

    # aug "Don’t force it, [rub]. Let the magic flow naturally, but give it purpose."
    aug "别去强求它，[rub]。让魔法自然流淌，同时赋予它目标。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3036
translate chinese rub4_66ae457d:

    # "[rub] closed her eyes, magic pooling at her horn. this time, rather than willing the energy, she shaped it, molding it."
    "[rub]闭上双眼，魔法在她的犄角处凝聚。这次，她没有强行调动能量，而是将其塑形，精心雕琢。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3038
translate chinese rub4_a24d60c8:

    # "When she opened her eyes, her shimmering shield bloomed like petals of a flower. But it was more than a rigid shield, it was layered in thorns."
    "当她睁开双眼，那闪烁的护盾如花瓣般绽放。但它不仅是坚硬的盾牌，还有层层叠叠的荆棘。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3040
translate chinese rub4_db0ccb7a:

    # aug "There it is."
    aug "就是这样。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3042
translate chinese rub4_079a5763:

    # rub "Oh, that is rather lovely, isn’t it? Defensive, but... there’s potential for offense."
    rub "哦，挺可爱的，不是吗？既能防御，也能.......攻击。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3045
translate chinese rub4_aaa5baad:

    # "She extended her magic, experimenting with pushing and pulling the shield forward in small bursts. Like combat with a spiked shield, her own unique take on combat magic."
    "她施展法术，尝试以短促的推力推动护盾前移。如同使用带刺盾牌进行防守反击一样，这是她独创的战斗魔法。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3047
translate chinese rub4_052396b9:

    # rub "I think I could get used to this."
    rub "我觉得我能习惯这个。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3049
translate chinese rub4_304fe1d5:

    # "While [rub] refined the way she shaped magic, [bla]’s challenge was entirely different."
    "当[rub]在精进魔法塑造之术时，[bla]面临的的挑战却截然不同。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3054
translate chinese rub4_75914c00:

    # "Unlike a unicorn, she and I didn’t have natural conduits for magic. No horn to focus energy, no years of practice."
    "与角马不同，她和我天生不会魔法，也没有角来凝聚魔法，更没有多年的实践。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3055
translate chinese rub4_adf39a40:

    # "Instead, she pulled it from within herself, raw and untamed."
    "相反，她从内心深处撬开了它，原始而狂野"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3056
translate chinese rub4_2f125f20:

    # "She may have been able to conjure a fireball when fighting the nightmares, but her first attempts at more serious magic were... rough."
    "她或许能在对抗梦魇时施展火球术，但初次尝试更复杂的魔法时……效果实在不太理想。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3057
translate chinese rub4_d23c60b8:

    # "When she tried to summon energy, the force either fizzled out or blasted out of control, launching yet another training dummy clear across the room."
    "当她试图凝聚魔法时，那股魔法要么消散殆尽，要么失控爆发，将另一个训练假人轰飞到房间另一头。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3059
translate chinese rub4_78c9b24c:

    # bla "Ugh! This is why I hate magic. It’s like… like trying to wrestle something slippery!"
    bla "唉！这就是我讨厌魔法的原因。简直像……像在和果冻战斗一样！"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3060
translate chinese rub4_f0ad54e5:

    # bla "It either gets away from me or knocks me on my ass."
    bla "要么它溜走了，要么它把我打得落花流水。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3062
translate chinese rub4_998fdf6c:

    # aug "Magic does not escape you, [bla]. You are simply not listening to it."
    aug "魔法并未逃离你，[bla]。你只是没有倾听它罢了。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3063
translate chinese rub4_971eb04e:

    # "[bla] scoffed, wiping the sweat from her brow. It wasn't just difficult, but also exhausting, similar to a rigorous physical exercise."
    "[bla]自嘲地笑一声，擦去额头的汗珠。这不仅困难，而且令人精疲力竭，如同进行了一场高强度的体能训练。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3065
translate chinese rub4_49247214:

    # bla "I don’t have that fancy magical sense like [rub]. I don’t feel it like you do. Maybe your advice only works for unicorns?"
    bla "我可没有像[rub]那样与生俱来的高超的魔法感知力。我感受不到你那种东西。说不定你的建议只对角马管用？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3067
translate chinese rub4_80e64c7c:

    # aug "Mm... You do not trust it?"
    aug "嗯……你不信任你自己吗？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3068
translate chinese rub4_ef96b235:

    # aug "The relics have amplified your latent magical potential. You have more magic than almost every unicorn."
    aug "圣物已经激发了你潜藏的魔法潜能。你现在的魔法能力已远超绝大多数角马。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3069
translate chinese rub4_d6e54e31:

    # aug "But magic is borne of willpower. If you doubt yourself, if you do not believe you are worthy of it, then of course it will resist you."
    aug "但魔法源于意志力。若你怀疑自己，若你认为自己不配拥有它，那么它自然会与你抗衡。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3070
translate chinese rub4_d6adb720:

    # aug "Find it. It is there, waiting for you."
    aug "找到它。它就在那里，等着你。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3071
translate chinese rub4_632ab2dc:

    # "[bla] frowned, reluctant but thoughtful, furrowing her brows as she focused inward. For a long moment, nothing happened."
    "[bla]皱起眉头，虽不情愿却思绪万千，她紧锁双眉，将心神沉入内心。漫长的片刻里，一切静止如初。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3072
translate chinese rub4_83a331e3:

    # "The two stood patiently... Minutes passed as [bla] searched deep inside her."
    "我们耐心等待着……几分钟过去，[bla]在内心深处搜寻着它。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3073
translate chinese rub4_4e45ae2d:

    # "First, she channeled that feeling, her chest glowing. This was normal, but instead of immediately harnessing this power, she let it sit and continued to explore it."
    "首先，她引导着那种感觉，胸口泛起光芒。这本是寻常现象，但她并未立即驾驭这份力量，而是任其沉淀，继续探索其中奥秘。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3074
translate chinese rub4_3184a1a7:

    # "The energy just kept expanding from deep within her, until her entire body was glowing with latent magic."
    "魔力不断从她体内深处向外扩散，直至她全身都笼罩在魔法的光芒之中。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3075
translate chinese rub4_03d4df7a:

    # bla "There's so much! It feels… limitless."
    bla "太多了！它们好像……无穷无尽。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3076
translate chinese rub4_555373fc:

    # aug "You see? The magic is there. You simply have to believe you are worthy of it."
    aug "你看到了吗？魔法就在那里，你只需相信自己配得上它。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3077
translate chinese rub4_25a41f76:

    # "Encouraged, [bla] extended her hand forward, willing the energy to move outward."
    "受到鼓舞，[bla]将手向前伸出，意念驱使魔力向外流动。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3080
translate chinese rub4_d73aaf7e:

    # "This time, it formed a small, concentrated burst of power in her palm. It wasn’t large, but it was perfectly stable and more than capable of rattling the training dummy."
    "这次，一股小而集中的魔力在她的掌心爆发。形状不算大，却异常的稳定，足以让训练假人剧烈震颤。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3082
translate chinese rub4_367de903:

    # "For the first time since they started, [bla] smiled."
    "自从我们开始练习以来，[bla]第一次笑了。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3083
translate chinese rub4_e42eef9a:

    # bla "Huh. Would you look at that? I can be more than just a fire hazard."
    bla "哈，瞧瞧这个！我才不是个火灾隐患呢。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3084
translate chinese rub4_b03a3ffe:

    # bla "Small but mighty. That’s not so bad."
    bla "小而强大，这也不错。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3086
translate chinese rub4_3f57072a:

    # aug "It’s not about the size, it’s about how you use it, ah-ha~!"
    aug "关键不在于尺寸，而在是技巧，啊-哈~！"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3087
translate chinese rub4_77aff2fb:

    # aug "You will not wield magic like [rub] or myself, but you will wield it in a way that is your own. Keep training, and soon enough, that small spark will become something formidable."
    aug "你虽无法像[rub]或我这般驾驭魔法，但终将开创属于自己的施法之道。继续练习吧，那微弱的火花终将蜕变为惊世之力。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3089
translate chinese rub4_62e9a309:

    # bla "Yeah. I think I can work with that."
    bla "嗯，我觉得可以哦。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3091
translate chinese rub4_61234089:

    # "The lesson continues…"
    "课程继续……"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3095
translate chinese rub4_8f531147:

    # "I noticed the Queen’s gaze drifting toward me more than once. There was something... in those eyes."
    "我注意到女王的目光不止一次地飘向我。那双眼睛里……藏着什么。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3096
translate chinese rub4_defb2874:

    # aug "Well, well, my dear outsider. I do believe it’s time for your lesson."
    aug "哎呀呀，我亲爱的第三者。我认为是时候给你上一课了。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3097
translate chinese rub4_782aca4a:

    # mc "Alright, hit me with it."
    mc "好的，老师您请讲。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3098
translate chinese rub4_b8b3a9cd:

    # "[aug]’s smile widened, but it wasn’t just her usual queenly grace. No, this expression had an edge to it."
    "[aug]的笑容更灿烂了，但这已非她惯常的女王风范。不，这表情里透着锋芒。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3103
translate chinese rub4_d327cd78:

    # aug "Oh, I think you’ll like this one. In fact..."
    aug "哦，我觉得你会喜欢这个。事实上……"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3104
translate chinese rub4_2c8c6261:

    # aug "... Perhaps you’d be interested in a private one-on-one lesson? Ah-ha!"
    aug "……或许您对私密的一对一课程感兴趣？嗯-哼~！"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3105
translate chinese rub4_cfa79c26:

    # "The sudden, cackle. I knew that laugh from the other universe."
    "她笑了起来。我认出来了，是和另一个宇宙一模一样的笑声。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3106
translate chinese rub4_0181021c:

    # mc "You... Oh, you’re not nearly as composed as you let on, are you?"
    mc "你……唉，你可没表面上那么冷静，对吧？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3109
translate chinese rub4_98cc6fa3:

    # "Her royal grace wavered further as she twirled her fingers, conjuring a small orb of pink energy between her hands."
    "她的王室礼仪愈发动摇，手指旋转着，在掌心凝聚出一颗粉红色的能量球。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3111
translate chinese rub4_7b4b9c91:

    # aug "Let’s drop the formalities, shall we? You and I both know that ‘Queen’ is just the fancy packaging. Underneath all this..."
    aug "咱们别客气了，行吗？你我都清楚，“女王”不过是华丽的包装。在这层包装之下的我..."

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3112
translate chinese rub4_bf0bacbb:

    # aug "I’m way more fun."
    aug "可有趣多了~。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3113
translate chinese rub4_2c43029f:

    # mc "You’re wild at heart beneath your Queenly persona?"
    mc "你那女王般的表象之下，藏着一颗狂野的心？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3115
translate chinese rub4_590e3db0:

    # aug "Pfft, is that a bad thing~?"
    aug "噗，这也不算什么坏事吧~？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3117
translate chinese rub4_419a9163:

    # "The orb of energy pulsed in her hands, and I could feel something radiating from it."
    "能量球在她手中不断的跳动，我能感觉到某种魔法正从它身上散发出来。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3118
translate chinese rub4_5a54339f:

    # mc "Wait... so what exactly are you going to teach me?"
    mc "等等……所以你到底要教我什么？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3121
translate chinese rub4_df7055fc:

    # "She stepped forward, placing the orb into my palm. The moment it touched me, a strange pulse ran through my body, setting every nerve alight."
    "她向前一步，将那颗球体放入我的掌心。它刚一触及我的皮肤，一股奇异的脉动便贯穿全身，令我每一根神经都燃起火焰。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3122
translate chinese rub4_fbf78001:

    # "This magic… is familiar. Intuitive."
    "这股魔法的效果……如此的熟悉且直白。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3124
translate chinese rub4_32e8f2e7:

    # aug "Oh-ho! Interesting. Very interesting."
    aug "哦-嚯~！有意思，非常有意思。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3125
translate chinese rub4_edfc9956:

    # aug "You feel it, don’t you? The magic of love – it’s not foreign to you. No, no, no... you, my dear, are overflowing with it."
    aug "你感受到了吧？爱的魔力——它对你而言并不陌生。不，不，不……亲爱的，你浑身都洋溢着这份魔力。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3126
translate chinese rub4_bb6f4f1c:

    # "I shook off the strange tingling in my limbs."
    "我甩开了四肢那种奇怪的刺痛感。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3127
translate chinese rub4_e035a69d:

    # mc "Overflowing with {i}love{/i}?"
    mc "我的身体充满着{i}爱的魔力{/i}？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3129
translate chinese rub4_12aa2714:

    # aug "Oh, without even knowing the specifics, I’m well aware of your ‘generous contributions’ to this world, darling."
    aug "哦，亲爱的，即便不了解具体细节，我也深知你对这个世界做出了多么“慷慨的贡献”。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3130
translate chinese rub4_de8914c8:

    # "Her fingers walked along my arm, tracing the path where the magic had traveled through me."
    "她的手指沿着我的手臂游移，追寻着魔法穿行而过的轨迹。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3132
translate chinese rub4_ef762116:

    # aug "You’re not just good with people. You’re not just charming. You..."
    aug "你不仅擅长与雌驹相处。你不仅魅力非凡。你……"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3133
translate chinese rub4_f027687a:

    # "Her hand splayed against my chest, her magic pulsing through me again."
    "她的手掌摊开贴在我胸膛上，魔法再度在我体内涌动。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3135
translate chinese rub4_caa7dd4c:

    # aug "… have the potential to wield this magic the same way I do."
    aug "……有潜力像我一样施展这种魔法。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3136
translate chinese rub4_14edcb93:

    # mc "’Love’ magic?"
    mc "‘爱之魔法’？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3138
translate chinese rub4_cf477cae:

    # aug "You might be naturally attuned to it."
    aug "你可能天生就对此有共鸣。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3139
translate chinese rub4_690878d0:

    # aug "That’s rare. Which means... you’re a perfect test subject! A-ha!"
    aug "这可真少见。也就是说……你简直是我完美的实验对象！啊-哈~！"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3140
translate chinese rub4_db772b3d:

    # "I sighed, playfully acting like I regret giving her the opening."
    "我叹了口气，故作懊悔地假装后悔给了她开口的机会。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3141
translate chinese rub4_7b7acf08:

    # mc "I knew you were going to say something like that."
    mc "我就知道你会说这种话。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3143
translate chinese rub4_dc896a22:

    # aug "Oh please! You’ve been slinging that stud energy around like a walking aphrodisiac. Don’t you wanna see what happens when you learn to actually control it?"
    aug "拜托！你那股魅力四射的能量可以把让你变得像个会走路的春药一样。难道不想看看当你学会并掌控它时会发生什么吗？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3145
translate chinese rub4_47ff1428:

    # "She clapped her hands, bouncing slightly on her heels."
    "她拍了拍手，脚跟轻轻蹦跳着。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3146
translate chinese rub4_ac0cafba:

    # aug "Let’s do some fun experiments, shall we? Let’s see just what you can do~"
    aug "来做些有趣的实验吧，好吗？让我们看看你究竟能做到什么程度~"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3147
translate chinese rub4_39b62039:

    # mc "Oh boy…"
    mc "我滴神呐......"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3149
translate chinese rub4_ea32dd17:

    # "[aug] wasted no time. She guided me through the flow of magic, showing me how to pull on the energy she had planted in me and mold it into something tangible."
    "[aug] 毫不迟疑。引导我领悟魔法的流动，教我如何汲取她植入我体内的能量，并将之塑造成具体可感的形态。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3150
translate chinese rub4_1e79a855:

    # "Her method of instruction was... intimate."
    "她的教学方式……很亲密。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3155
translate chinese rub4_4f119b5e:

    # "She took my hands in hers, pressing them against her own chest, not quite indecent, but certainly close enough to feel something poking out beneath the fabric..."
    "她将我的双手握在她的掌心里，按在自己胸前，虽不算太过分，却也足够让我感受到布料下那处凸起的异物……"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3156
translate chinese rub4_90e5f395:

    # aug "Love magic isn’t about brute force. It’s about intimacy. You have to let it breathe, let it flow. Think of it like... coaxing pleasure from a lover."
    aug "爱之魔法并非依靠蛮力，而在于亲密。你必须让它自由呼吸，顺势而为。不妨将其想象成……从爱人身上唤起欢愉的过程。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3157
translate chinese rub4_f80c6b6d:

    # mc "{i}Cough{/i} Are all of your lessons this hands-on?"
    mc "{i}咳咳{/i} 你的课一般都需要进行接触行为吗？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3159
translate chinese rub4_0cf518e0:

    # aug "Oh, you’ve no idea what you’ve signed up for."
    aug "哎呀，不懂就不要乱说啦。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3160
translate chinese rub4_63e6ac73:

    # "With slow precision, she had me direct the energy outward."
    "她以缓慢而精准的动作，引导我将能量向外释放。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3161
translate chinese rub4_3d617063:

    # "At first, it was chaotic, raw, but I followed the feeling."
    "起初，我只能感受到最原始且混乱的魔法，但逐渐顺从了那份感觉。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3164
translate chinese rub4_ff3b166a:

    # "A warm, golden-pink shield pulsed around us. Then I balled my fist and shot it forwards. The spherical shield concentrated and blasted forth as a projectile."
    "一道温暖的粉金色护盾在我们周围显现。接着我紧握拳头向前一挥，球形护盾凝聚成弹丸般猛然迸射而出。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3165
translate chinese rub4_625eca89:

    # "I thought it'd knock the target-dummy over, but instead it sliced a spherical chunk from it. Only the bottom half of its torso was left."
    "我以为它会把靶子打倒，结果它直接将靶子一切为二，只剩下了半截躯干。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3167
translate chinese rub4_ae05fdb9:

    # aug "Ah-ha! I knew it! You’re a natural! Just look at you, casting like a seasoned lover—er, I mean, spellcaster!"
    aug "啊-哈~！我就知道！你就是天生为此而生的！瞧瞧你这架势，施法时活像个老练的情人——呃，我是说，魔法师！"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3168
translate chinese rub4_0957db22:

    # mc "Riiight. That’s what you meant."
    mc "彳亍，原来你说的是魔法师啊。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3169
translate chinese rub4_6ab48508:

    # "She smirked, tossing her hair over her shoulder."
    "她噙着笑意，将头发甩到肩后。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3171
translate chinese rub4_eb50c6b8:

    # aug "Oh, don’t be so shy, my dear! You are fascinating. And incredibly, deliciously fun to tease."
    aug "哦，别这么害羞嘛，亲爱的！你真的很有魅力。而且，逗弄你简直是种令人难以置信的、美妙的乐趣。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3172
translate chinese rub4_eba0d634:

    # mc "Don’t you have a husband?"
    mc "你不是有个丈夫吗？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3174
translate chinese rub4_14eb25b9:

    # aug "Ah-hahaha… Keep practicing! I’m going to see how the others are getting on~"
    aug "啊-哈哈哈……继续练习吧！我去看看姑娘们进展如何啦~"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3177
translate chinese rub4_8c0c49b0:

    # "I sighed, shaking my head with a smirk. By the time she reached [rub], she wore the mask of a Queen once again."
    "我叹了口气，摇头时嘴角带着一丝无奈的笑意。当她走到[rub]处时，又重新戴上了女王的面具。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3183
translate chinese rub4_98532676:

    # "The rest of the day was filled with relentless practice. [rub], adapted quickly to [aug]’s teachings."
    "我们将剩下的时间都投入进了不间断的练习之中。[rub]很快适应了[aug]的教学方式。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3184
translate chinese rub4_e749958b:

    # "By late afternoon, she was effortlessly weaving shimmering thorny walls that felt entirely hers."
    "到傍晚时分，她已能轻易地使用魔法编织出闪闪发光的荆棘墙，而那墙也仿佛完全变成了她的一部分一样。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3186
translate chinese rub4_9e59ad8f:

    # "[bla], while rougher around the edges, had developed a steady control over her magic."
    "[bla]虽然动作略显生涩，但已能稳稳掌控自己的魔法。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3187
translate chinese rub4_2bf22615:

    # "The control she gained allowed her to do more than just create fire, she could manipulate the temperature to such extreme heights that it would crackle as lightning, and such extreme lows that sharp shards of ice would form."
    "她现在不仅能创造火焰，更能所以操控温度——既可炽热如闪电般噼啪作响，亦可冰冷至极，凝结出锋利的冰晶碎片。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3189
