translate chinese crystal2_10900dcc:

    # lil "Enough empty words. Let’s talk about this plainly."
    lil "别再空谈了。咱们直截了当地说吧。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3776
translate chinese crystal2_5b26c66e:

    # umb "Very well… Your queen hides a monster — one who terrorized this kingdom as Midnight."
    umb "很好……你们的女王藏着一个怪物——一个曾以梦魇之月之名肆虐这片王国的怪物。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3777
translate chinese crystal2_3e84c35d:

    # umb "And yet, she pardons her. Raises her up as if she were a hero, covering up that she was the very villain that threatened Arcadia’s existence."
    umb "然而，她却宽恕了她。将她捧上英雄的宝座，掩盖了她正是那个威胁Arcadia存亡的恶魔这一事实。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3778
translate chinese crystal2_a3e5bbf6:

    # umb "For decades, darkness terrorized this kingdom. Midnight waged war, drove many cities into ruin, shattered families."
    umb "数十年来，黑暗肆虐着这片王国。梦魇之月发动战争，摧毁了无数座城市，让无数的家庭支离破碎。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3779
translate chinese crystal2_7df6f0e3:

    # umb "Tell me... Where is the justice in that?"
    umb "告诉我……这算什么正义？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3784
translate chinese crystal2_93d61d1b:

    # hon "[sel] wants nothing more than the best for this country!"
    hon "[sel]现在只希望为这个国家争取最好的未来！"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3788
translate chinese crystal2_a5e3d330:

    # "His gaze landed on [hon]."
    "他的目光落在了[hon]身上。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3789
translate chinese crystal2_7ba08816:

    # umb "[hon], if someone came to your farm, burned your fields, destroyed the home you built with your own two hands… and years later, they came back, claiming to have changed… Would you invite them to your table? Would you allow them to walk among your family, without fear?"
    umb "告诉我，[hon]，倘若有马闯入你的农场，焚毁你的田地，摧毁你亲手建造的家园……多年后，他们竟卷土重来，声称已改过自新……你会邀请他们共进晚餐吗？你会让他们随意地出现在你的亲友身边并对此毫无顾虑吗？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3794
translate chinese crystal2_323883e0:

    # "[hon] stiffened. The question hit harder than any punch."
    "[hon]僵住了。这个问题比任何的攻击都更具有杀伤力。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3795
translate chinese crystal2_49dbe196:

    # "She couldn’t answer. The rest of us exchanged uneasy glances."
    "她无法回答。我们面面相觑，眼神中透着不安。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3796
translate chinese crystal2_df9b20a5:

    # lil "{i}Clears throat{/i} [sel] isn’t Midnight! They’re different people!"
    lil "{i}清了清嗓子{/i} [sel]不是梦魇之月！她们是不同的马！"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3800
translate chinese crystal2_aca6aca2:

    # umb "[lil], the Queen’s prized student, the paragon of wisdom. You, of all people, understand the nature of governance. Of trust."
    umb "[lil]，女王的得意门生，智慧的典范。你比任何马都更懂治国之道。更懂信任的真谛。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3801
translate chinese crystal2_e7efc656:

    # umb "Tell me, then. If a tyrant may be forgiven for her atrocities simply because she claims to have changed, where do we draw the line?"
    umb "那么告诉我，如果一个暴君仅仅因为声称自己已改过自新，就能被原谅其暴行，我们该如何划定原谅的界限？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3805
translate chinese crystal2_17dc59ea:

    # lil "… Midnight is dead. The world is healing. You know that."
    lil "……梦魇之月已死。世界正在愈合。你心知肚明。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3809
translate chinese crystal2_a53aea34:

    # umb "A convenient answer. But does it ease the hearts of those who lost their families? Of those who still wake in cold sweat, reliving the nightmare she created?"
    umb "客套的答案。但它能抚平那些失去亲人的心吗？能抚平那些至今仍惊醒于冷汗中，不断重温她制造的噩梦的受害者的内心吗？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3810
translate chinese crystal2_31c162df:

    # umb "If we rewrite history to paint our former oppressors as heroes, what message do we send to the people?"
    umb "如果我们篡改历史，将曾经的压迫者描绘成英雄，这会向子民传递怎样的信息？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3814
translate chinese crystal2_5fa84c2b:

    # lil "[sel] was never an oppressor, she was a victim too! We’ve seen her remorse, her desire to right the world."
    lil "[sel]从来不是压迫者，她同样也是受害者！我们见证过她的悔恨，见证过她想要让世界变得更好的渴望。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3818
translate chinese crystal2_a29a9cad:

    # umb "Remorse without consequence? A throne without accountability? That’s not justice. Lest we not forget it was [sel] herself that let the darkness consume her in the first place."
    umb "后悔但不承担相应的后果？重新坐上了王座却不负担责任？这算什么正义。不要忘记，最初正是[sel]自己任由黑暗吞噬了自己。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3819
translate chinese crystal2_6e47cf5a:

    # "He continued, turning toward [but]."
    "他继续说道，转过身来，直指[but]。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3820
translate chinese crystal2_84ab89c5:

    # umb "[but]… you, more than anyone, should understand the power of such transformations. The kind that leaves you questioning if you were ever truly yourself to begin with."
    umb "[but]……你，比任何马都更该明白这种蜕变的感觉。那种让你怀疑自己是否曾真正活过本真的蜕变。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3821
translate chinese crystal2_b98ac5c8:

    # "[but]’s ears flattened as she turned away."
    "[but]转过身去，双耳垂在头侧。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3822
translate chinese crystal2_920769fd:

    # umb "Can you ever truly escape your nature?"
    umb "你是否真正摆脱了自己的本性呢？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3827
translate chinese crystal2_2492c804:

    # rik "You talk a big game, but what do you want, really? A throne?"
    rik "你嘴上说得天花乱坠，可你到底想要什么？王位吗？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3831
translate chinese crystal2_3a1ce733:

    # umb "No. I want a kingdom that isn’t rotting from within. Where leaders earn their place, not inherit it, nor steal it through pity."
    umb "不。我想要的王国不会从内部腐烂。那里领袖凭实力赢得地位，而非继承，更不靠窃取。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3832
translate chinese crystal2_2638decb:

    # "I could feel [but] shifting uncomfortably beside me, her hands curling into fists."
    "我能感觉到[but]在我身旁不安地挪动着身子，双手紧握成拳。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3833
translate chinese crystal2_efe3f4bc:

    # "[rub], however, snapped."
    "突然，[rub]大喝一声，打断了他。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3839
translate chinese crystal2_d4c9732d:

    # rub "Enough. You can dress this up in pretty speeches, but it doesn’t change what you are. A usurper. You’re trying to justify your power grab."
    rub "够了。你尽可用华丽辞藻粉饰，却改变不了你的本质。一个篡位者。你不过是在为自己的权力掠夺寻找借口罢了。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3840
translate chinese crystal2_253224ba:

    # "For the first time in a while, Umbra’s smirk faded."
    "许久以来，Umbra的冷笑首次消失了。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3844
translate chinese crystal2_820f81ed:

    # um "Is that what you think?"
    um "你们就是这么想的？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3845
translate chinese crystal2_3230e393:

    # rub "That’s what I know. She almost died for us. For the Kingdom. Do you truly think you’re the only one who cares?"
    rub "没错，我就是这么想的。她为了我们，为了王国，几乎牺牲了自己的性命。你当真以为只有你在乎吗？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3847
translate chinese crystal2_ca47af1b:

    # umb "Then tell me this — why were [sel]’s sins erased with the flick of a wrist?"
    umb "那么告诉我——为何[sel]的罪孽能轻而易举地被抹去？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3848
translate chinese crystal2_cd08ae8e:

    # umb "Covered up without consequence. No justice. Only absolution, granted by a ruler who did not have to bear the brunt of the suffering. And you, all of you, are expected to accept it without question. Why?"
    umb "随意掩盖真相并毫无后果，这没有正义可言。并且赐予了她赦免，还是由那位无需承受苦难重担的统治者赐予给她的。而你们，还有王国所有的子民们，都必须毫无质疑地接受这一切。为什么？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3849
translate chinese crystal2_da2464d1:

    # umb "Are you comfortable with the weight of that lie? Can you not feel the sins crawling up your back?"
    umb "你可曾感受过那谎言的沉重？可曾觉察罪孽正沿着你的脊背爬升？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3851
translate chinese crystal2_46b1a69b:

    # "His voice was so calm. So reasonable. We'd tried to ignore this point, but as he returned to it, I could feel the unease creeping through the group."
    "他的声音如此平静。如此合理。我们曾试图忽略这个关键点，但当他再次提及时，我能感觉到不安正悄然蔓延至整个团队。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3853
translate chinese crystal2_dcba4dc2:

    # umb "And you, [mc]…"
    umb "还有你，[mc]....."

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3854
translate chinese crystal2_8ff076de:

    # umb "The only reason you’re standing here now, and not rotting away in a jail cell, is because you proved yourself useful. [aur] is a tyrant."
    umb "你此刻能站在这里，而不是在牢房里腐烂，唯一的原因就是你证明了自己的价值。你同时也证明[aur]是个暴君。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3855
translate chinese crystal2_2bca52ad:

    # "His strategy was to divide. And as I looked around: at [hon]’s clenched fists, at [but]’s tense shoulders, at the uncertainty flickering in [lil]’s eyes... It was working."
    "他的策略就是通过他的狗屁道理，将我们分化瓦解。当我环顾四周：看着[hon]紧握的拳头，[but]绷紧的肩膀，[lil]眼中闪烁的不安……这招果然奏效了。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3858
translate chinese crystal2_d88cb576:

    # "Umbra reached behind him, drawing forth a staff, everyone tensed up in reaction."
    "Umbra伸手向后，抽出法杖，我们顿时绷紧了神经。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3859
translate chinese crystal2_58e2dfe1:

    # umb "This staff is an ancient relic, perhaps similar to your own virtuous relics. Discovered earlier this year, I had hoped it’d assist me in defeating the darkness."
    umb "此杖乃上古圣物，或许与诸位所用的圣物相仿。当你年初获此物时，我曾期盼它能助我击溃黑暗。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3860
translate chinese crystal2_424631b9:

    # "It was long and obsidian, its surface shimmering with an arcane glow, intricate engravings twisting along its length. At its peak, a familiar crystal pulsed, deep crimson, alive with power."
    "它十分修长，外表如黑曜石，表面则泛着玄奥的光晕，精雕细琢的纹路沿着长杆盘旋蜿蜒。顶端一颗熟悉的晶体正跳动着，深红如血，蕴藏着蓬勃的力量。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3861
translate chinese crystal2_bfd79889:

    # "Even from here, I could feel the sheer, undeniable magic radiating from it. I thought I recognized it, but I couldn't even begin to imagine where from."
    "即便隔着这段距离，我也能感受到它散发出的纯粹而强大的魔力。我熟悉这种气息，却完全想不起它从何而来。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3862
translate chinese crystal2_8adfd7c5:

    # umb "I understand your hesitation. But I do not stand before you with only words."
    umb "我理解你们的犹豫。但使我有信心对付你们的，绝不止有言语。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3863
translate chinese crystal2_cf31038f:

    # umb "For centuries, the Alicorns have held dominion over this land. Not by merit, not by choice, but by the circumstance of their birth."
    umb "数个世纪以来，天角兽始终统治着这片土地。并非凭功绩，亦非出于选择，而是源于它们的出身。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3864
translate chinese crystal2_c0e78188:

    # umb "This staff contains the power to break the cycle of oppression. To bring balance between those who were born to rule and those who earned the right to lead."
    umb "此杖蕴藏着打破这种无理循环的力量，使生而为王者与凭实力赢得领导权者之间恢复平衡。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3869
translate chinese crystal2_b6f12eb9:

    # mox "Okay, and? You’re not the first guy to complain about the monarchy. What makes you different?"
    mox "行呗，那又怎样？你又不是第一个抱怨君主制的马。你的理论有什么特别之处捏？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3873
translate chinese crystal2_899a1ab7:

    # umb "And yet, does it not bother you? The idea that no matter how powerful, how skilled, how brilliant a pony may be… they will never sit upon the throne of Arcadia?"
    umb "有啊，这一切难道不令你困扰吗？无论小马多么强大、多么技艺精湛、多么才华横溢……那为什么它们永远无法替代天角兽，坐上Arcadia的王座？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3874
translate chinese crystal2_924e1bce:

    # umb "You are a performer, an artist. You thrive on freedom, on individuality. Tell me, does it not disturb you that your Queen was simply… born into her power? That you fight for a ruler you never chose?"
    umb "你是一名表演者，也是一名艺术家。你因自由而蓬勃，因个性而绽放。告诉我，难道你不觉得困扰吗——你的女王的权力居然是……与生俱来的？你们竟在为一位从未选择的统治者而战？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3880
translate chinese crystal2_1662c5ee:

    # rik "So what? You want to force yourself onto the throne instead? Isn’t that a blatant contradiction?"
    rik "那又怎样？你想强行篡夺王位？这不是赤裸裸的自相矛盾吗？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3884
translate chinese crystal2_7f6e7fcc:

    # umb "At the beginning, perhaps. But I will enable a democracy, where the will of the people decides the ruler. A system free of bloodlines and birthrights, where a leader earns their place through respect and trust."
    umb "起初或许如此。但我将建立民主选票制度，让每一匹小马都有投票选择的权力。这个体系将摆脱血统与世袭特权的束缚，每一个党派的领袖唯有赢得尊重与信任才能坐上王座。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3885
translate chinese crystal2_2ff3e3fb:

    # umb "Whether you agree with me or not, I believe people have the right to a choice."
    umb "无论你是否认同我的观点，我坚信小马们拥有选择的权利。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3890
translate chinese crystal2_019f4e85:

    # "[rik] exhaled sharply, glancing away. She wasn’t the type to care about politics. But even she had to admit, he had a point."
    "[rik]猛地呼出一口气，目光移开。她向来不关心政治。但即便如此，她也得承认，他说的有道理。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3891
translate chinese crystal2_b5a43aef:

    # bla "Sounds neat in theory. But you don’t really think [aur]’s just gonna step down if you ask nicely, do you?"
    bla "理论上听起来挺好。但你不会真的以为只要客气地请求，[aur]就会乖乖下台吧？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3895
translate chinese crystal2_6fb831d1:

    # umb "Of course not. Those in power rarely relinquish it willingly. That is why it must be taken."
    umb "当然不会。掌权者很少会心甘情愿地放弃权力。正因如此，我必须使用武力去夺取权力。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3896
translate chinese crystal2_ea7401ac:

    # "The way he said it— {i}not with malice, not with anger, but with complete certainty{/i}— made the hair on my arms stand on end."
    "他说话的方式——{i}没有恶意，没有愤怒，却带着绝对的自信{/i}——令我胳膊上的汗毛都竖了起来。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3897
translate chinese crystal2_2a009920:

    # umb "[aur] has ruled for a thousand years. Not because she was chosen. But because she simply… never let go."
    umb "[aur]能够统治千年。并非因她被选中，而是因为她从未……放权。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3898
translate chinese crystal2_7ffaacd5:

    # umb "Is that not the definition of tyranny?"
    umb "这难道不符合独裁的定义吗？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3903
translate chinese crystal2_93cbbdc1:

    # "[bla] didn’t answer. But she also didn’t argue."
    "[bla]没有回答。但她也没有争辩。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3904
translate chinese crystal2_696dcde7:

    # "[pen] had been quiet this entire time. Observing. Calculating. But now, she finally pitched in."
    "[pen]一直保持沉默。观察，思考。但此刻，她终于出声了。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3905
translate chinese crystal2_11b9bbc2:

    # pen "…And you believe this staff will change that?"
    pen "……而你竟相信这根权杖能改变这一切？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3909
translate chinese crystal2_20948a88:

    # umb "You, more than most, understand that power shapes history. That without power, ideals remain… just that. Ideals."
    umb "你比任何马都更清楚，唯有权力才能塑造历史。没有权力，理想终究只是理想。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3910
translate chinese crystal2_06cb17ea:

    # umb "The Virtues of Harmony are powerful, yes. But against the might of an Alicorn, do you truly believe you stand a chance? Do you truly believe that, should [aur] decide to tighten her grip, you could stop her?"
    umb "谐律之力固然强大，但面对天角兽的威能，你真以为自己能有胜算？倘若[aur]决定收紧缰绳，你能阻止她？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3911
translate chinese crystal2_30ae1262:

    # "The group exchanged glances. The cracks had widened. My chest was tight."
    "我们面面相觑，裂痕已然扩大。我的胸口发紧。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3912
translate chinese crystal2_0eb27894:

    # "Yet, still, Umbra continued."
    "然而，Umbra仍在继续着他的演讲。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3914
translate chinese crystal2_fa2e8f3a:

    # umb "This staff is not for me. It is for all who would fight against tyranny. It is for a new future. A future where no child is born into rule or servitude. Where the people, not the crown, decide who is worthy."
    umb "此杖并非为我而存。它属于所有反抗暴政之者。它属于崭新的未来。在那样的未来里，没有孩子生来就注定统治或被奴役。由子民而非血统，来决定谁配得上王冠。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3915
translate chinese crystal2_c12e7ab0:

    # "He extended the staff forward almost as it were an offering of peace."
    "他将手杖向前伸出，仿佛是在献上和平的礼物。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3916
translate chinese crystal2_aa2eb2b5:

    # umb "I offer you more than words. I offer you balance."
    umb "我给你的，远不止言语。我给你的，是平等。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3917
translate chinese crystal2_1dff780f:

    # umb "Do you agree?"
    umb "你们，同意吗？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3920
translate chinese crystal2_0958afc0:

    # umb "Then you understand. Power should be earned."
    umb "你们应该明白，权力应当靠自己争取。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3921
translate chinese crystal2_377a71cf:

    # "The group stiffens, shifting uneasily."
    "大家一同僵住了，不安地挪动着身子。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3926
translate chinese crystal2_e06e7356:

    # lil "You… actually agree with him?"
    lil "你……居然赞同他的观点？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3927
translate chinese crystal2_73fc6888:

    # hon "Careful now, sugar."
    hon "说话小心点，甜心。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3931
translate chinese crystal2_58179e2a:

    # umb "Then fight with me. Not against me."
    umb "那就与我并肩作战，而非与我为敌。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3932
translate chinese crystal2_ed8724cf:

    # mc "It’s your actions that bother me, [umb]."
    mc "你的行为让我感到困扰，[umb]。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3933
translate chinese crystal2_53e51bbb:

    # umb "Hoh?"
    umb "哼？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:3934
translate chinese crystal2_79540c1c:

    # mc "[aur]’s rule is not a tyranny, and we virtues are perfectly poised to enable more democratic values."
