    "她声音渐渐低了下去，双手紧握成拳。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4142
translate chinese crystal2_d82b6b68:

    # hon "We should’ve won."
    hon "我们应该胜利了才对。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4143
translate chinese crystal2_dc8878f9:

    # hon "But we didn’t. We could have kept going... We hesitated. Because we—"
    hon "但我们没有赢。我们本该继续战斗……但我们却犹豫了。因为我们—"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4148
translate chinese crystal2_a5a0a35f:

    # rik "He really played us, eh?"
    rik "他真的把我们都给耍了，对吧？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4149
translate chinese crystal2_c6ce4f48:

    # rik "Made us look like idiots."
    rik "他让我们显得像呆瓜一样。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4151
translate chinese crystal2_d573bf91:

    # bla "Maybe that was the point."
    bla "也许这正是关键所在。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4152
translate chinese crystal2_b74346db:

    # bla "Maybe he wanted us to see that we’re not as righteous as we think we are."
    bla "也许他想让我们明白，我们并没有自以为的那般正义。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4154
translate chinese crystal2_830db519:

    # hon "You’re saying he’s right?"
    hon "你是说他是对的？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4156
translate chinese crystal2_f3e84071:

    # bla "I’m saying he’s not stupid. He knew what he was doing."
    bla "我说他不是傻瓜。他清楚自己在做什么。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4158
translate chinese crystal2_153a3973:

    # mox "That’s the problem, ain’t it? It’s not like he’s some evil overlord twirling his mustache."
    mox "问题就在这儿，对吧？他又不是那种留着小胡子作恶的邪恶统治者。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4159
translate chinese crystal2_23488faf:

    # mox "He’s not Midnight. He’s not a monster. And that makes him a lot harder to fight."
    mox "他不是梦魇之月，更不是怪物。正因如此，与他对抗才更难。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4164
translate chinese crystal2_e8614ecc:

    # "[lil] exhaled softly, rubbing her forehead."
    "[lil]轻轻呼出一口气，揉了揉额头"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4165
translate chinese crystal2_2b3cb54a:

    # lil "He’ll set his sights on Arcadia next..."
    lil "他接下来将把目标锁定在Arcadia……"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4166
translate chinese crystal2_eac6b22f:

    # lil "But... I imagine everyone needs a break. If you want a breather, or some time alone, feel free."
    lil "不过……我想大家都该稍微休息一下。如果谁想放松一下，或者独处片刻，尽管去吧。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4167
translate chinese crystal2_7be411a2:

    # "The group dispersed. Some lingered behind, others heading deeper into the castle."
    "我们解散了。有的滞留原地，有的则深入城堡内部。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4168
translate chinese crystal2_ecc75bf6:

    # "Now might be a good opportunity to see how they’re doing."
    "或许我该趁现在去看看她们的状态如何。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4174
translate chinese crystal2m1_c39ed017:

    # "[lil] stayed in the war room, standing over the scattered battle plans, her expression empty."
    "[lil]留在作战室里，伫立在散落的作战计划前，神情空洞。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4176
translate chinese crystal2m1_03496a2f:

    # lil "... I should have known something was wrong. Maybe if I had realized it earlier, we wouldn’t have walked into his game."
    lil "……我早该察觉不对劲。要是能早点意识到，我们就不至于落入他的圈套。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4177
translate chinese crystal2m1_6ce4d29a:

    # lil "But... I say that as if I even know what went wrong..."
    lil "但是……我这么说，好像我连问题出在哪里都清楚似的……"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4178
translate chinese crystal2m1_cf483062:

    # lil "I failed to defeat Umbra... I failed to stop the war..."
    lil "我失败了…我没能打败Umbra.…我未能阻止这场战争……"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4182
translate chinese crystal2m1_51ef742d:

    # lil "…Then why does it feel like I did?"
    lil "……但为什么我总觉得，一切的问题都出在我身上呢？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4183
translate chinese crystal2m1_d4c4f0e2:

    # "She turned back to the battle plans."
    "她转过身，继续研究作战计划。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4185
translate chinese crystal2m1_0669350c:

    # lil "They look to me for guidance. Strategy. And I was at a loss for words."
    lil "她们向我寻求指引，寻求对策，而我却无言以对。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4186
translate chinese crystal2m1_6c3e697d:

    # "I reached out, placing a gentle hand on her shoulder."
    "我伸手轻轻搭在她肩上。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4187
translate chinese crystal2m1_ce2578e8:

    # mc "Failure is inevitable, you should know that. It’s valuable experience. And now? We do what you’re best at. We learn."
    mc "失败是成功之母，你应该明白。这也是种宝贵的经验。而现在？我们专注于你最擅长的事——学习。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4189
translate chinese crystal2m1_e1f009d5:

    # lil "Hm… Okay~"
    lil "唔....好吧~"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4192
translate chinese crystal2m1_33f9e817:

    # lil "I know that. But…"
    lil "我知道。但是……"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4193
translate chinese crystal2m1_8e31706a:

    # "She gestured at the table, the maps, the plans, the calculations."
    "她朝桌子、地图、计划和推测结果比划了比划。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4195
translate chinese crystal2m1_df5136fe:

    # lil "It was my responsibility to see through him. And I didn’t."
    lil "看穿他的计谋本是我的责任。而我却没有做到。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4196
translate chinese crystal2m1_cf154fd0:

    # lil "They trusted me to lead. And it feels like I led them straight into his hands."
    lil "她们信任我，让我来领导谐律之元。而我却感觉自己把她们直接引进了他的圈套。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4197
translate chinese crystal2m1_c5a8781d:

    # mc "And what do leaders do, [lil]?"
    mc "那么领导者会做什么呢，[lil]？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4198
translate chinese crystal2m1_ccd6447c:

    # mc "They learn. They get better."
    mc "学习与进步。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4200
translate chinese crystal2m1_bce1f950:

    # lil "That… I can try to do…"
    lil "那个……我可以试试看……"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4203
translate chinese crystal2m1_e8022986:

    # lil "…I was afraid you’d say that."
    lil "……我就怕你会这么说。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4204
translate chinese crystal2m1_8c885178:

    # lil "…You don’t sugarcoat things, do you?"
    lil "……你说话一直都很直白，不是吗？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4205
translate chinese crystal2m1_2c585569:

    # mc "You don’t need sugarcoating."
    mc "糖衣炮弹对你毫无意义。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4206
translate chinese crystal2m1_e3dc8e88:

    # mc "What matters is what happens next."
    mc "过去只是过去，未来才是我们应该考虑的事情。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4208
translate chinese crystal2m1_a26b81be:

    # lil "…You’re right."
    lil "....你是对的。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4211
translate chinese crystal2m1_274e4cb6:

    # lil "…Maybe that’s my real mistake."
    lil "……也许那才是我真正的错误。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4212
translate chinese crystal2m1_a055ae6a:

    # "Her hands trailed over the maps, fingers brushing lightly against the paper."
    "她的手指在地图上轻抚而过，指尖轻柔地掠过纸面。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4214
translate chinese crystal2m1_3aa8812c:

    # lil "Thinking I have to be perfect. That I can’t make mistakes. That if I do, I’ve somehow failed everyone."
    lil "总觉得自己必须完美无缺。仿佛不能犯任何错误。一旦出错，就觉得辜负了所有马。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4215
translate chinese crystal2m1_79da2b4e:

    # "She let out a slow breath, realizing it in real-time."
    "她缓缓吐出一口气，意识到了这一点。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4216
translate chinese crystal2m1_61b45425:

    # mc "You don’t have to be perfect, [lil]."
    mc "你不必万事都追求完美，[lil]。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4218
translate chinese crystal2m1_2007bf2f:

    # lil "Hm… Where does that leave us?"
    lil "嗯……这下我们该怎么办？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4219
translate chinese crystal2m1_8ad702b7:

    # mc "It might have been a loss for morale, but don't forget that we got a lot of information out of Umbra."
    mc "失败或许打击了我们的士气，但别忘了我们也从这场失败里收集了大量的与Umbra有关的情报。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4221
translate chinese crystal2m1_02bc4912:

    # lil "Right! We’re far from done."
    lil "你说得对，事情还远远没有结束。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4222
translate chinese crystal2m1_58f4aced:

    # "She turned to me, the fire returning to her gaze."
    "她转向我，眼中的那团火重新燃烧起来。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4223
translate chinese crystal2m1_bf1e9622:

    # lil "We’ll find a way through this. For the sake of Arcadia and its people."
    lil "我们会找到突破困境的办法。为了Arcadia和它的子民。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4234
translate chinese crystal2m1_06dffdf3:

    # "[rub] stood at the edge of the garden, overlooking the city."
    "[rub] 站在花园边缘，俯瞰着整座城市。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4235
translate chinese crystal2m1_983206d5:

    # rub "…For all my experience, for everything I’ve learned… it amounted to nothing."
    rub "……纵使我历经沧桑，纵使我学识渊博……终究一无所获。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4236
translate chinese crystal2m1_11e137ad:

    # rub "It wasn’t even a failure for me. I achieved nothing. I learned nothing. I contributed nothing."
    rub "这对我而言甚至算不上失败。我一无所获，一无所学，毫无贡献。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4237
translate chinese crystal2m1_04a02299:

    # rub "For the first time in a long time… I feel absolutely numb."
    rub "时隔许久……我竟感到麻木。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4239
translate chinese crystal2m1_d14cf0e4:

    # rub "What do I do with that?"
    rub "我该怎么办啊？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4243
translate chinese crystal2m1_ec9ff8fb:

    # rub "I have spent my entire life chasing experiences. Seeking out the universe in all its beauty, its pleasure, its pain."
    rub "我毕生都在探寻宇宙间的一切的美好、欢愉与痛苦。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4244
translate chinese crystal2m1_61ec9f76:

    # rub "But this? This was the first time such abject failure."
    rub "但这次？这可是头一次遭遇如此惨痛的失败。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4245
translate chinese crystal2m1_85a5e3fd:

    # rub "And that terrifies me."
    rub "这让我感到恐惧。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4246
translate chinese crystal2m1_c7546dec:

    # mc "Then imagine the catharsis once we find a way forward, [rub]."
    mc "试想一旦我们找到前进的方向，那种成就感该有多强烈。[rub]。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4247
translate chinese crystal2m1_664dbb31:

    # "Reluctantly, she nodded."
    "她不情愿地点了点头。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4250
translate chinese crystal2m1_16353f5e:

    # rub "…You’re really trying to spin this into some grand learning moment, aren’t you?"
    rub "……你这是真想把这事儿包装成什么深刻的成长时刻，对吧？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4251
translate chinese crystal2m1_293ed0aa:

    # "I gave her a small shrug."
    "我耸了耸肩。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4252
translate chinese crystal2m1_38239c60:

    # mc "You’re a sensate, [rub]. You live to experience everything. Even the bad."
    mc "你是存在主义者，[rub]。你活着就是为了体验一切。哪怕是糟糕的。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4254
translate chinese crystal2m1_59d226dd:

    # rub "... And I thought I could handle it. But this? This is new."
    rub "……我以为自己能应付一切困难。但这？还是头一次。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4255
translate chinese crystal2m1_efbdbac7:

    # rub "I always thought that experiencing everything meant taking it in completely. But maybe this is something I don’t have to absorb all at once."
    rub "我总以为体验万物就意味着要一次性完全吸收它们。但也许有些东西不必一次全盘接受。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4256
translate chinese crystal2m1_36bf5772:

    # mc "One step at a time?"
    mc "一步一个脚印，对吧？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4258
translate chinese crystal2m1_aba182b8:

    # "She finally looked at me, there was a flicker of herself again."
    "她终于看向我，那抹熟悉的神色又在眼中一闪而过。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4259
translate chinese crystal2m1_cfeee1db:

    # rub "One step at a time."
    rub "一步一个脚印。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4262
translate chinese crystal2m1_394e7bbe:

    # rub "{i}Giggle{/i} …What a perfectly useless response."
    rub "{i}嬉笑着{/i}……多么无用的回答啊。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4263
translate chinese crystal2m1_9d9c68aa:

    # mc "Hahah. I mean, you want me to pretend I have the answer?"
    mc "哈哈~。意思是，你是要让我假装知道答案吗？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4265
translate chinese crystal2m1_1d555589:

    # "Her amusement faded slightly, but she didn’t look quite as numb anymore."
    "她的笑意稍减，但神情已不再那么麻木。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4266
translate chinese crystal2m1_4c15c3fa:

    # rub "No… I suppose not."
    rub "不用......我觉得不用。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4268
translate chinese crystal2m1_415f09f0:

    # rub "Thanks for just… being here. Coming to see me."
    rub "谢谢你……来看我。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4269
translate chinese crystal2m1_40c56712:

    # mc "You’d do the same for me."
    mc "你也会为我做同样的事。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4272
translate chinese crystal2m1_4108feba:

    # "She watched me for a moment."
    "她注视了我片刻。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4273
translate chinese crystal2m1_fd6aea0c:

    # "Then, she sighed, looking back out towards the city."
    "随后，她叹了口气，目光又转向了城市。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4275
translate chinese crystal2m1_bf8282bb:

    # rub "I built my life on experiencing everything. And when something happens that I can’t process, that I can’t feel—"
    rub "我的马生建立在体验万事万物之上。而当发生某些我无法理解、无法感受的事情时——"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4276
translate chinese crystal2m1_66f7923f:

    # rub "… It makes me wonder if I was ever really in control at all."
    rub "……这让我不禁怀疑，我是否真的曾经掌控过局面。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4277
translate chinese crystal2m1_c2a68a90:

    # rub "That’s the part I can’t stand."
    rub "这正是我无法忍受的部分。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4278
translate chinese crystal2m1_782aa242:

    # mc "Then let’s take that control back."
    mc "那么，让我们夺回主导权吧。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4280
translate chinese crystal2m1_bb820032:

    # "[rub] stood a little straighter. She wasn’t fully recovered. But she was moving forward."
    "[rub]挺直了些身子。她尚未完全恢复心态，但正在向好的那一头发展。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4281
translate chinese crystal2m1_730483e3:

    # rub "Every force will have an equal and opposite reaction."
    rub "作用力必有等大反向的反作用力。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4282
translate chinese crystal2m1_48f1402c:

    # rub "Such a low… it can only be met with an equal high."
    rub "如此普通的道理……唯有以同样的高昂来回应。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4283
translate chinese crystal2m1_b9bfb723:

    # rub "I’m looking forward to our victory."
    rub "我期待着我们的胜利。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4294
translate chinese crystal2m1_886f6f20:

    # "In the training yard, [hon] was already throwing punches at a wooden dummy."
    "在训练场里，[hon]在疯狂殴打着训练假人。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4295
translate chinese crystal2m1_ecebb162:

    # "[hon] was breathing hard, her fists clenched, her rage unspent."
    "[hon]气喘吁吁，双拳紧握，怒火未消。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4296
translate chinese crystal2m1_c67cb3d9:

    # hon "…I should’ve charged him the moment he started talking."
    hon "……我就应该让他付给我参与他狗屁演讲的参与费。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4297
translate chinese crystal2m1_d7bc95af:

    # hon "Maybe if I had, we wouldn’t be sittin’ here, second-guessing ourselves."
    hon "或许当初我那样做了，我现在就不会站在这里，如此懊悔了。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4299
translate chinese crystal2m1_331b0a32:

    # hon "Tell me somethin’, sugar…"
    hon "告诉我点什么吧，甜心……"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4300
translate chinese crystal2m1_d14bb6e0:

    # hon "Do you really think listenin’ to all his fancy words did us a lick of good?"
    hon "你觉得他的那些花言巧语对我们有什么好处吗？"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4303
translate chinese crystal2m1_150aea44:

    # "She wasn’t happy with that answer, but she also didn’t argue."
    "她对这个回答并不满意，但也没有争辩。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4305
translate chinese crystal2m1_75b72e56:

    # hon "I dunno. Feels like it’d have been better than just… standin’ there."
    hon "我不知道。总觉得这样总比……什么都不干强。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4306
translate chinese crystal2m1_504b4370:

    # mc "And if we charged him? What then? He would have loved that. A perfect justification for aggression and this war."
    mc "如果我们指控他呢？那又如何？他反而会乐见其成。这恰恰为我们侵略他们和这场战争提供了完美的借口。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4308
translate chinese crystal2m1_61187ada:

    # hon "Would’ve still felt better than sittin’ on my damn hands."
    hon "总比干坐着强。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4309
translate chinese crystal2m1_ed1f01ec:

    # hon "I hate feelin’ powerless."
    hon "我讨厌那种无能为力的感觉。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4310
translate chinese crystal2m1_5fcca38d:

    # mc "Then let’s make sure we’re never powerless again."
    mc "那么让我们确保这种感觉永远不再发生。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4312
translate chinese crystal2m1_0c0f9652:

    # "She did a double take, as if she hadn’t expected me to agree."
    "她愣了一下，仿佛没想到我会同意。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4314
translate chinese crystal2m1_57fb39d1:

    # hon "Damn right we shoulda!"
    hon "他妈的没错，我们本该这么做的！"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4315
translate chinese crystal2m1_cd075088:

    # "She leaned against the training dummy, rolling her shoulders."
    "她倚着训练假人，耸了耸肩。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4317
translate chinese crystal2m1_837e952c:

    # hon "He made us look weak. Like we ain’t ready for this fight."
    hon "他让我们显得软弱无力，仿佛我们根本没准备好迎接这场战斗。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:4318
translate chinese crystal2m1_24586589:

