    # "I shrugged and left the book as I moved to the onsen. Nothing in there that I didn’t already know by now."
    "我耸耸肩，把书留在原处走向温泉。里面没什么是我现在不知道的。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:8826
translate chinese finale_4cc49052:

    # "Soft steam curled around the wooden platforms as the natural hot spring pools shimmered under the lantern-lit night."
    "柔和的蒸汽在木质平台间袅袅升腾，天然温泉池在灯火映照的夜色中泛着粼粼波光。"

