    "混乱不堪，疯狂得超乎理智，却盛满我从未想象过的爱。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:8854
translate chinese finale_acdad757:

    # mc "I hope you all know… this is only the beginning."
    mc "希望你们都明白……这仅仅是个开始。"

# game/6 - Act 2.rpy:8855
